<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1SA" style="id">- Tsishingini (tsw)</book>
  <para style="h">1 Sama'ila</para>
  <para style="toc3">1 Sam</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Sama'ila</para>
  <para style="toc1">1 Sama'ila</para>
  <para style="mt2">1 Sama'ila</para>
  <para style="mt1">1 Sama'ila</para>
  <para style="is">Ucuɗuwu wa aatagada a nda</para>
  <para style="ip">A ca ucuɗuwu wu za na ɗanai aatagada a nda shi. Amma uka̱lyusa̱ u roco ta̱ za na ɗanai aatagada a nda u yuwan ta̱ wuma cina ili i na a ɗanai nda'a a farasa. Aatagada o ufaru wa 1 Sama'ila u ta̱ utanu na a alabari o uvadalu u tsugbain diga uba̱ta̱ wa̱ ozo o uge'etosu a̱ tyo uba̱ta̱ wu ngono wa a alabari a Isra'ila. E ɗe ta̱ aala a ama a ta'atsu aza a na a yuwain a̱ba̱jini a̱ba̱jini e ili adama o uvadalu'u. Ama'a ele ɗa, Sama'ila za na da̱na̱i mokosoto a̱tsuma̱ a̱za̱ o uge'etosu wa a Isra'ila, Shawulu za na da̱na̱i mogono mo ufaru ma a Isra'ila, oɓolo na̱ Da̱wuda za na unai Goliya va Filistiya, waru wo o'wo ta̱ mogono ana Shawulu kuwa̱i.</para>
  <para style="ip">Aatagada'a u ta̱ na a alabari na̱ cine a̱ shuwa̱i tsugono a̱tsuma̱ a Isra'ila. A̱ usu a na A̱sulazuva a ɗa na aa aciya̱yi a̱yi mogono ma a Isra'ila shi, a na ama'a a zami yi adama a ca le mogono, reve A̱sulazuva a ɗangula le mogono. A̱ba̱jini e ili pa nda a̱ yi ɗa, mogono na ama, ko za vu utsuru ko za vu ulambu, suru n le a̱ ta̱ za̱la̱ vu uge'etosu wa̱ A̱sula̱ na 'yuwan a̱ kuru yi 2:7-10.</para>
  <para style="is">Ili i na i ri pe a̱tsuma̱ a aatagada a nda</para>
  <para style="io">Limatan va Sama'ila na̱ ufaru u tsugbain tsa a̱yi 1:1-7:17</para>
  <para style="io">Shawulu wo o'wo ta̱ mogono 8:1-10:27</para>
  <para style="io">Ufaru u tsugono tsa Shawulu 11:1-15:35</para>
  <para style="io">Da̱wuda na̱ Shawulu 16:1-30:31</para>
  <para style="io">Ukwa̱ wa Shawulu no olobo a̱ yi 31:1-13.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1SA 1" />
  <para style="s">Limatan va Sama'ila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 1:1" />A yuwan ta̱ vuma ro aala a̱ yi Elikana, vuma va Zuf za vu ugundo wa Ifiramu u ta̱ nden a̱ lyuci va Rama, e iɗa ya agaɗi ya Ifiramu. A̱yi ulobo wa Yeroham u ɗa ulobo wa Elihu ulobo wa Tohu ulobo wa Zuf vuma va Ifiramu. <verse eid="1SA 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 1:2" />U da̱na̱ ta̱ na̱ a̱ma̱ci e re, za ta̱ aala a̱ yi Hanatu za ve ire waru aala a̱ yi a ɗa Penina. Penina ta̱ na̱ muwun, agba Hanatu ri ni i ɗa shi.<verse eid="1SA 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 1:3" />Aa'wan suru Elikana tsu lyawa ta̱ lyuci va̱ yi Rama, reve u gawan a̱ 'ya̱wa̱ lyuci va̱ Shilo tsa̱ra̱ u yuwaan A̱sulazuva o oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a zuva a̱ga̱nda̱, waru u yuwaan yi kucci. Olobo e Eli e re Hofini na̱ Finiha ele ɗa a̱ da̱na̱i nan ganu va̱ A̱sulazuva ɗe. <verse eid="1SA 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 1:4" />A mantsa ma na suru Elikana cayi kucci va̱ yi, u tsu ca ta̱ ka va̱ yi Penina na̱ muwun mo olobo ma̱ yi suru ne esheli akunda e inama i le. <verse eid="1SA 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 1:5" />Amma u tsu ca ta̱ Hanatu akunda a gbain adama a na u ciga yi ta̱ lon, adama a na a̱ A̱sulazuva a̱ ɓa̱ru ta̱ umatsutsun wa̱ yi. <verse eid="1SA 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 1:6" />Shewun va̱ yi Penina tsu cukurusa̱ yi ta̱ adama u yuwaan yi ulamu waru u ca yi upan, adama a na A̱sulazuva a̱ ɓa̱ru ta̱ umatsutsun wa̱ yi. <verse eid="1SA 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 1:7" />Ucukurusa̱'a̱ u lyuwa ta̱ elime aa'wan suru. Mantsa ma na Hanatu 'ya̱wa̱i o u'wa wa̱ A̱sulazuva suru, shewun va̱ yi tsu cukurusa̱ yi ta̱ adama u ca yi upan, hali u shon reve u 'yuwan a lyuwa ilyalya. <verse eid="1SA 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 1:8" />Elikana vali va̱ yi tsu damma yi ta̱, &lt;&lt;Hanatu nye i zuwai vu ri e mesun? Nye i zuwa vu lyuwai ilyalya shi? Waru nye i zuwai vu ri ya̱ a̱tsuma̱la̱ngu? A̱mu n la'aa wu muwun mo olobo kupa shi?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hanatu na̱ Eli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 1:9" />Urana u ro ɗe Shilo ana a lyuwai ilyalya o sowoi, reve Hanatu 'yon u yuwan avasa. Eli ganu gba da̱na̱ ta̱ lo nden o ootogu o una̱ntsutsu wu u'wa wa̱ A̱sulazuva. <verse eid="1SA 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 1:10" />Hanatu da̱na̱ ta̱ na̱ a̱tsumola̱ngu lon, a̱vu u yuwan avasa a̱ tyo uba̱ta̱ wa̱ A̱sulazuva na̱ mesun lon. <verse eid="1SA 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 1:11" />Reve u yuwan akucunu u damma, &lt;&lt;A̱sulazuva o oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a zuva, na̱ vu ka̱lyuwa̱ a̱tsuma̱lima̱ a aagbashi a̱ wu reve vu cuwan na̱ a̱mu, agba vi icina na aa aagbashi a̱ wu shi, a̱vu vu ca yi ulobo, n ta̱ gba a ca A̱sulazuva a̱yi hali ukwa̱ wa̱ yi. Agba ko utanu wa̱a̱ ju'wa̱n aaci a̱ yi shi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 1:12" />Ana u lyuwai elime na avasa a̱ tyo uba̱ta̱ wa̱ A̱sulazuva, Eli gba e idanasa una̱ wa̱ yi. <verse eid="1SA 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 1:13" />Hanatu yuwusan ta̱ avasa a̱tsuma̱ o okolo a̱ yi, una̱ wa̱ yi u ɗa goon u da̱na̱i a̱ ma̱zungwa̱, agba uɗyo wa̱ yi wu uta̱ shi. A̱vu Eli ene ngashi usowu u ɗa u ri. <verse eid="1SA 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 1:14" />Reve u damma yi, &lt;&lt;Hali a̱ tyo mantsa ma̱ ne va̱a̱ da̱na̱ usowu? Vu lyawa ne oso a masayan ma̱ inabi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 1:15" />A̱vu Hanatu usu u damma, &lt;&lt;Ne ɗa shi zagbain va̱. A̱mu ka ɗa za na ri na̱ a̱tsumola̱ngu lon. N sowo masayan ma̱ ina̱bi ko ili i ro i na i tsu tsura̱to vuma shi. Amma n ta dansaa A̱sulazuva okolo a̱ va̱. <verse eid="1SA 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 1:16" />She vu tara aagbashi a̱ wu tsu ka ve pere wan. N ta avasa mantsa ma nda suru adama a̱ a̱bunda̱ o usa̱n na̱ a̱tsumola̱ngu a na n ri pe.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 1:17" />Reve Eli usu yi, &lt;&lt;Ka̱ra̱ na asuvu nden, lyawa A̱sula̱ a aza a Isra'ila a ca wu ili i na vu pati niyi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 1:18" />Reve u damma, &lt;&lt;Lyawa aagbashi a̱ wu a̱ tsura̱ isa'ani e ekere a̱ wu.&gt;&gt; A̱vu ka'a u reme ure wa̱ yi u 'ya̱wa̱ u lyuwa ilyalya. Agba u da̱shi lukuta̱ urewesu wa̱ yi shi.<verse eid="1SA 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 1:19" />Ana usana u tawai, reve Elikana na̱ a̱ma̱ci a̱ yi na̱ muwun ma̱ yi a yuwaan A̱sulazuva a̱ga̱nda̱. A̱vu a̱ ka̱mba̱ o u'wa u le a Rama. Ana Elikana voyin na̱ ka va̱ yi Hanatu, reve gba A̱sulazuva a cuwain na̱ a̱yi. <verse eid="1SA 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 1:20" />Ana mantsa ma yuwain, reve Hanatu tsura̱ a̱a̱tsuma̱ reve u matsan mawun mo ulobo. Ɗaɗa u ca niyi aala Sama'ila, a dansa, &lt;&lt;M pati ta̱ A̱sulazuva a̱yi.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aala Sama'ila na̱ Tsuyahuda a̱yi ɗa &lt;&lt;Aala A̱sula̱,&gt;&gt; una̱ta̱ u ɗa na̱ Tsuyahuda &lt;&lt;Ipati.&gt;&gt;</char></note><verse eid="1SA 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hanatu ca ta̱ A̱sulazuva Samaꞌila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 1:21" />Ana Elikana nu u'wa wa̱ yi suru a̱a̱ 'ya̱wa̱ tsa̱ra̱ a ca A̱sulazuva kucci va aaꞌwan suru, reve waru u shiton akucunu a̱ yi, <verse eid="1SA 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 1:22" />Hanatu 'ya̱wa̱ shi. U damma ta̱ vali va̱ yi, &lt;&lt;Na̱ n kasa mawu'un maani, n ta tara yi a̱ ꞌya̱wa̱ n ca A̱sulazuva a̱yi, waru ɗe ɗa wa̱a̱ da̱na̱ kuci.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 1:23" />Reve Elikana usu ka va̱ yi u damma, &lt;&lt;Yuwan ili i na i lobono nuwu. Isawan pa hali she mantsa ma na vu kasa niyi maani. A̱yi de lyawa A̱sulazuva o shiton adanshi a̱ yi goon.&gt;&gt; Ɗaɗa Hanatu da̱nuyi o u'wa u co'o mawu'un hali mantsa ma na u kasa niyi maani.<verse eid="1SA 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 1:24" />Ana u kasa niyi maani, reve u tara yi a̱ 'ya̱wa̱ o u'wa wa̱ A̱sulazuva a̱ Shilo, oɓolo na̱ ogono a nan va aꞌwan a taꞌatsu, na̱ makundatsu ma yira kupa ne ejere, na̱ tsa̱n vu ukwan masayan ma̱ ina̱bi, ulobo'o gba a̱yi ubuwu mawun. <verse eid="1SA 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 1:25" />Ana a paɗai ogono a na'an, reve Hanatu na̱ Elikana a tara ulobo'o a̱ tyo ye Eli. <verse eid="1SA 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 1:26" />Reve Hanatu damma Eli, &lt;&lt;Wuma wa̱ wu ujima zagbain va̱! N kucina ta̱ na̱ a̱vu, a̱mu ɗa ka na da̱na̱i pa nda mishin zuzu na̱ a̱vu a yuwusan avasa a̱ tyo uba̱ta̱ wa̱ A̱sulazuva. <verse eid="1SA 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 1:27" />M pati ta̱ mawun ma nda, waru A̱sulazuva a ca mu ta̱ ili i na m pati niyi. <verse eid="1SA 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 1:28" />Adama o ndolo gogo n ca ta̱ A̱sulazuva a̱yi, waru u to o'wo e ekere a̱ yi a mantsa ma a wuma wa̱ yi suru.&gt;&gt; Reve a yuwaan A̱sulazuva a̱ga̱nda̱ ɗe.<verse eid="1SA 1:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1SA 2" />
  <para style="s">Avasa a Hanatu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 2:1" />Reve Hanatu yuwan avasa u damma,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="1SA 2:1" />
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 2:1">&lt;&lt;Okolo a̱ va̱ a shiwan ta̱ na̱ ma̱za̱nga̱ a̱ tyo e ekere a̱ A̱sulazuva!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:1">A̱sulazuva aa zuwa mu ta̱ mo o'wo nu ukadu lon.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 2:1">Reve m kpa̱tu'wa̱ una̱ u va̱ n zo'oso n'yuwatan n va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:1">adama a na u wawa numu.<verse eid="1SA 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 2:2" />&lt;&lt;Babu za na ri na akiza tsa̱ A̱sulazuva,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:2">babu za na ri lo tsa̱ wu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:2">babu lo aatali tsa̱ A̱sula̱ a̱ tsu.<verse eid="1SA 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 2:3" />&lt;&lt;She i lyuwa elime na adanshi o ugbawu wan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:3">ko adanshi o uvaɗu o utusa̱ o una̱ u ɗu wan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 2:3">adama a na A̱sulazuva a̱yi ɗa A̱sula̱ za na revei ili biti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:3">a̱yi ɗa u tsu ge'eto linga vuma biti.<verse eid="1SA 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 2:4" />&lt;&lt;A kuɗa ta̱ tan va aza a na a gurai uvon,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:4">amma aza a na a̱ ri nu ucira shi a̱ tsura̱ ta̱ ugbamu wo ookolo.<verse eid="1SA 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 2:5" />Aza a na a̱ da̱na̱i nu ucuwun, gogo a ta yuwusan ulinga wi izami yi ilyalya.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:5">Amma aza a na a̱ da̱na̱i na ambulu, gogo a̱ ta̱ ucuwun.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 2:5">Ka na da̱na̱i na̱ muwun shi, gogo u ta̱ na̱ muwun n cindere.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:5">Amma a̱yi na u da̱na̱i na̱ muwun ma̱ a̱bunda̱, wo o'wo ta̱ a̱ nde'en.<verse eid="1SA 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 2:6" />A̱sulazuva a̱ tsu ta̱wa̱a̱ ta̱ nu ukwisa̱, waru u tsu ca ta̱ wuma.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:6">U tsu 'ya̱wa̱to ta̱ ama uba̱ta̱ wu nden wa̱ a̱kwa̱kwa̱, a̱vu waru u 'ya̱sa̱n le.<verse eid="1SA 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 2:7" />A̱sulazuva a tsu zuwa ta̱ ulambu, reve waru u ca utsuru.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:7">U tsu ka̱ɗa̱to ta̱ vuma, reve waru u 'ya̱sa̱n zuva.<verse eid="1SA 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 2:8" />U tsu 'ya̱sa̱n ta̱ alambi diga a̱ ma̱buta̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:8">aza a na a cigai ikambishi waru diga e edemu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 2:8">U tsu da̱na̱to le ta̱ oɓolo na̱ azagbain,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:8">waru u tsu ca le ta̱ agadu o ootogu o tsugbain.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 2:8">Adama a na ikyun yu usa wu uvaɗi za va̱ A̱sulazuva a ɗa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:8">a aci a̱yi a ɗa u yuwain uvaɗi.<verse eid="1SA 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 2:9" />&lt;&lt;U tsu wawa ta̱ ana a ama a̱ a̱ɓula̱ a̱yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:9">amma a̱za̱ e iwuya a̱ tsu puwa̱n ta̱ a̱tsuma̱ e irumbu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:9">Adama a na nu ucira u ɗa vuma aa lyuwa aci shi.<verse eid="1SA 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 2:10" />A̱sulazuva a tsu kukuɗa ta̱ a̱za̱ a̱ nla̱ngi na̱ a̱yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:10">u tsu lapa ta̱ tsata a̱ tyo ya̱'a̱ le diga zuva.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 2:10">A̱sulazuva e ge'eto ta̱ uvaɗi ma̱ɓula̱.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:10">U ta ca mogono ma̱ yi ucira,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:10">u tsu zuwa ta̱ za na u tsuwa̱n yi mani'in u tsura̱ ukadu lon.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 2:11" />Reve Elikana na̱ Hanatu a̱ ka̱mba̱ o u'wa a Rama, agba ulobo Sama'ila wi isawan ta̱ ɗe, tsa̱ra̱ u kambusa Eli ganu a yuwusaan A̱sulazuva ulinga.<verse eid="1SA 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iwuya yo olobo a̱ Eli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 2:12" />Muwun mo olobo ma̱ Eli gba ama a vama a ɗa. E reve A̱sulazuva shi. <verse eid="1SA 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 2:13" />Agadu a nan ganu a ɗa oɓolo na ama, na a mantsa ma na za ro cayi kucci, inama'a a̱ ma̱puna̱, aagbashi a ganu a̱ tsu ta̱wa̱ ta̱ na̱ kune gbain va akatsu a ta'atsu o ukere wa̱ yi. <verse eid="1SA 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 2:14" />Reve u sapa pe kune'e a̱tsuma̱ a̱ cu'un vu upondo'o suru, ili i na kune'e u gura sapai o uta̱ suru za va ganu ɗa. Ne ɗa a yuwusain na ama a Isra'ila aza a na a̱ ta̱wusa̱i a yuwan a̱ga̱nda̱ a Shilo. <verse eid="1SA 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 2:15" />Amma kafu a cina mantsa ma na a̱a̱ kula̱to mani'in, reve aagbashi a ganu a̱ ta̱wa̱ u damma za na aa casu kucci'i, &lt;&lt;Vu ca ganu inama yu uta̱nu adama u zun. Waa ciga aza a na a̱ suwa̱in shi, she de a̱za̱ o uta̱nu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 2:16" />Na̱ vuma'a u damma yi, &lt;&lt;Lyawa a̱ kula̱to mani'i'in ne'e, reve vu tara cine vu cigai.&gt;&gt; Aagbashi'i u tsu usu ta̱, &lt;&lt;O'o, vu ca mu gogo! Na̱ vu 'yuwan n ta̱ tara nu ucira.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 2:17" />Unusu wo olobo a̱ Eli u wuyana ta̱ na̱ a̱bunda̱ lon a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ A̱sulazuva, adama a na a tara kucci va̱ A̱sulazuva ili i ro shi.<verse eid="1SA 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 2:18" />Amma Sama'ila molobo ma lyuwa ta̱ elime a yuwusaan A̱sulazuva ulinga. U da̱na̱ ta̱ wotowu na̱ ma̱tugu ma̱ epo vo okoro.<verse eid="1SA 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 2:19" />Aa'wan suru, mma va̱ yi tsu zula̱a̱ yi ta̱ ma̱tugu, reve u 'ya̱wa̱a̱ yi a mantsa ma na vali va̱ yi na̱ a̱yi a̱a̱ 'ya̱wa̱ a ca kucci va aa'wan aa'wan. <verse eid="1SA 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 2:20" />Eli waru tsu zuwaa ta̱ Elikana na̱ ka va̱ yi Hanatu abaꞌun, a̱vu u damma, &lt;&lt;Lyawa A̱sulazuva a ca wu muwun n ro e ekere a Hanatu, tsa̱ra̱ wo o'wo o una̱ wu ulobo u na Hanatu patiyi, reve u ca A̱sulazuva a̱yi.&gt;&gt; Reve Elikana na̱ Hanatu ka va̱ yi a̱ ka̱mba̱ o u'wa. <verse eid="1SA 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 2:21" />Reve A̱sulazuva a cuwan na̱ Hanatu, reve u matsisan olobo a taꞌatsu ne esheli e re. A̱yi gba ulobo Sama'ila u kungwa ta̱ a yuwusaan A̱sulazuva ulinga.<verse eid="1SA 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 2:22" />Eli gba kutsa ta̱ lon. Waru u ta uwwusa suru ili i na olobo a̱ yi aa yuwusan na aza a Isra'ila suru na̱ cine o vosun na̱ a̱ma̱ci aza a na a yuwusan ulinga uba̱ta̱ o una̱ntsu wo Oogodo o Uga'asusan. <verse eid="1SA 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 2:23" />Ɗaɗa u damma nle, &lt;&lt;Nye i zuwai yaa yuwusan cu'un vi ili i nda? N ta uwwusa adanshi diga uba̱ta̱ wa ama suru adama o ulinga wu uwuyanu u na yaa yuwusan. <verse eid="1SA 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 2:24" />Lyawai, olobo a̱ va̱, adanshi a sa'ani a ɗa maa uwwusa diga e ekere a ama a̱ A̱sulazuva shi. <verse eid="1SA 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 2:25" />Na̱ vuma yuwaan vuma ro unusu, A̱sula̱ a ta gura isawaan yi, amma na̱ vuma yuwaan A̱sulazuva unusu, zane ɗa e isawaan yi?&gt;&gt; Agba olobo a̱ Eli a uwwa adanshi a dada le shi, adama a na A̱sulazuva o foɓo ta̱ ɗe a na woo una le.<verse eid="1SA 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 2:26" />Reve Sama'ila lyuwa elime na akungu nu utsuru wi isa'ani e ekere a̱ A̱sulazuva ne e ekere a ama.<verse eid="1SA 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Adanshi e ili i na yaa fara nu u'wa wa̱ Eli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 2:27" />Uranu u ro vuma va̱ A̱sula̱ ta̱wa̱ ta̱ uba̱ta̱ wa̱ Eli, a̱vu u damma yi, &lt;&lt;Nda ili i na A̱sulazuva a dammai: &lt;N roco ta̱ aciya̱va̱ a alanga eteshe uba̱ta̱ wa a akaya a̱ ɗu Haruna nu u'wa wa̱ yi mantsa ma na a̱ da̱na̱i e iɗa ya Masar a yuwusaan mogono Firi'awuna tsugbashi. <verse eid="1SA 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 2:28" />Agba n ɗangula a̱ yi ta̱ diga a̱tsuma̱ o gundo va aza a Isra'ila suru o'wo nan ganu a̱ va̱, waru a yuwan a̱ga̱nda̱ a masa'a, a̱ kula̱to a̱tsuka̱ a̱ ma̱guru, a̱vu oto epo adama a zami majiyan ma̱ va̱. Waru n ca ta̱ akaya a̱ wu nu u'wa wa̱ yi akunda e le diga a̱ kucci na aa yuwain na akina wa aza a Isra'ila suru. <verse eid="1SA 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 2:29" />Nye i zuwai yaa tarasa kucci nu ucasu u na n dammai a̱ ta̱wa̱a̱ uba̱ta̱ wu nden n va̱ ili i ro shi? Nye i zuwai vaa casu muwun ma̱ wu tsugbain ula'awu na̱ a̱mu, na ya aa lyuwusa upasu u na u la'ai ulobonu u kucci va ama a̱ va̱ aza a Isra'ila?&gt;<verse eid="1SA 2:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 2:30" />&lt;&lt;Adama o ndolo A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a aza a Isra'ila a ɗa a dammai, &lt;N yuwan ta̱ nzuwulai na amayun ana, u'wa wa̱ wu nu u'wa wa dada va̱ wu ele ɗa a̱ ri n yuwusan a̱ga̱nda̱ a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ va̱ babu ukotu.&gt; Amma gogo A̱sulazuva a damma ta̱, &lt;Ili i ndolo i ri n yuwan shi! Aza a na a ca numu tsugbain, ele ɗa maa ca tsugbain, amma aza a na o goro numu n ta tara le ili ye pere. <verse eid="1SA 2:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1SA 2:31" />Mantsa ma̱ ta̱ lo a̱ ta̱wa̱ a na moo kototo wu na̱ olobo o u'wa wa dada va̱ wu, hali a̱a̱ tsura̱ za na aa kutsa a̱tsuma̱ o u'wa wa̱ wu shi. <verse eid="1SA 2:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1SA 2:32" />Vu te e ene meleshe ma̱ a̱bunda̱ uba̱ta̱ wu nden n va̱. Amma n ta̱ roco wi isa'ani ekere a Isra'ila, amma za suru o u'wa wa̱ wu u ta̱ kuwa̱ babu u kutsa. <verse eid="1SA 2:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1SA 2:33" />Na̱ n lyawa za a̱tsuma̱ o u'wa wa̱ wu suru a na wa yuwaan mu ulinga u tsuganu a masa'a ma̱ a̱ va̱ wee ene ure shi adama a̱bunda̱ a aɓara na̱ a̱tsuma̱la̱ngu, waru limatan vu u'wa wa̱ wu suru a̱ ta̱ kuwa̱ e ekere matsun me pe'eni.<verse eid="1SA 2:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1SA 2:34" />&lt;&lt; &lt;Nda ili i na yoo o'wo wu iroci, Olobo e re a̱ wu Hofini na̱ Finiha a̱ ta̱ kuwa̱ urana u ta̱. <verse eid="1SA 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1SA 2:35" />N ta̱ 'ya̱sa̱a̱n aciya̱va̱ ganu va̱ a̱ɓula̱ za na aa yuwaan mu a̱ga̱nda̱ reve u yuwan ili i na n cigai waru. N ta ca yi limatan va̱ a̱bunda̱ o u'wa wa̱ yi naa n ri koto shi, reve u yuwan a̱ga̱nda̱ elime mogono ma na a na n tsuwa̱n yi mani'in kuci. <verse eid="1SA 2:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1SA 2:36" />Suru za na buwai a̱tsuma̱ a limatan va̱ wu u ta̱ ta̱wa̱ u kingyo wa̱ yi u pati azurufa na̱ ma̱kutsu mo opopofu u damma, &lt;&lt;Zuwa mu ulinga u tsuganu adama n tsa̱ra̱ ilyalya ya alya.&gt;&gt; &gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 2:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1SA 3" />
  <para style="s">A̱sulazuva e ɗe ta̱ Sama'ila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 3:1" />Molobo Sama'ila u yuwusaan ta̱ A̱sulazuva ulinga e ekere a Eli. A mantsa mo ndolo A̱sulazuva aa yuwusan adanshi na ama kuci shi. Babu a̱bunda̱ a alavu alavu.<verse eid="1SA 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 3:2" />Urana u ro na ayin Eli za na esu a̱ yi o o'woi ga̱nda̱ ga̱nda̱ na u tse ene mejege shi, u da̱na̱ ta̱ nven asula a̱yi. <verse eid="1SA 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 3:3" />Babu fitila va̱ A̱sula̱ kima̱, Sama'ila pe nven o u'wa wa̱ a̱ A̱sulazuva, uba̱ta̱ u na Akpati a Nzuwulai a̱ A̱sula̱ a̱ da̱na̱i, <verse eid="1SA 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 3:4" />reve A̱sulazuva e ɗe Sama'ila, a̱vu Sama'ila usu, &lt;&lt;Mpa mu nda.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 3:5" />Reve u suma a̱ tyo uba̱ta̱ wa̱ Eli, a̱vu u damma, &lt;&lt;Mpa mu nda vu ɗe mu ta̱.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 3:5">A̱vu Eli usu yi, &lt;&lt;N ɗe wu shi, ka̱ra̱ a̱ ka̱mba̱ vu von.&gt;&gt; Reve u ka̱mba̱ u von.<verse eid="1SA 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 3:6" />A̱vu A̱sulazuva a̱ da̱shi ɗe Sama'ila. A̱vu Sama'ila 'yon u 'ya̱wa̱ ya̱ Eli reve u damma, &lt;&lt;Mpa mu nda vu ɗe mu ta̱.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 3:6">A̱vu Eli damma, &lt;&lt;Ulobo u va̱, n ɗe wu shi, ka̱ra̱ a̱ ka̱mba̱ vu von.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 3:7" />Sama'ila gba koto u shi u reve A̱sulazuva shi. Koto A̱sulazuva o roco aciya ya̱ yi uba̱ta̱ wa̱ yi a̱tsuma̱ a adanshi a̱ yi shi.<verse eid="1SA 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 3:8" />Reve A̱sulazuva e ɗewishe Sama'ila u ɗewu wa ta'atsu, a̱vu Sama'ila 'yon u 'ya̱wa̱ uba̱ta̱ wa̱ Eli a̱vu u damma, &lt;&lt;Mpa mu nda vu ɗe mu ta̱.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 3:8">Lo ɗa Eli revei a na A̱sulazuva a ɗa e ɗesu ulobo'o. <verse eid="1SA 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 3:9" />Ɗaɗa Eli dammai Sama'ila, &lt;&lt;Ka̱ra̱ vu 'ya̱wa̱ vu von, nu u da̱shi ɗe wu a̱vu vu damma, &lt;Yuwan adanshi, A̱sulazuva, adama a na aagbashi a̱ wu a ta uwwusa.&gt; &gt;&gt; Ɗaɗa Sama'ila 'ya̱wa̱ u voyin uba̱ta̱ wu nven ma̱ yi.<verse eid="1SA 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 3:10" />Reve A̱sulazuva a̱ ta̱wa̱ wi isawan uba̱ta̱'a̱, a̱vu u ɗewishe tsu ufaru, &lt;&lt;Sama'ila! Sama'ila!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 3:10">A̱vu Sama'ila usu, &lt;&lt;Yuwan adanshi, adama a na aagbashi a̱ wu a ta uwwusa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 3:11" />A̱vu A̱sulazuva a damma yi, &lt;&lt;Gogo, n ciga ta̱ n yuwan ili i ro a̱tsuma̱ a Isra'ila i na vuma na suru uwwa niyi na atsuvu a̱ yi u ta da'wan. <verse eid="1SA 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 3:12" />O urana u ndolo n to shiton adanshi a na n yuwain ekere a̱ Eli nu u'wa wa̱ yi, diga o ufaru hali o ukosu suru. <verse eid="1SA 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 3:13" />Adama a na n damma yi ta̱ n ta paɗaa u'wa wa̱ yi ugana u babu ukotu, adama o unusu u na u revei na̱ a̱yi. Olobo a̱ yi a yuwan ta̱ adanshi a avama e ekere A̱sula̱, agba u ɓara le shi. <verse eid="1SA 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 3:14" />Adama o ndolo n kucinaa ta̱ u'wa wa̱ Eli, babu kucci ko ucasu u na waa gura tara ume wu unusu wu u'wa wa̱ Eli ko ke'en.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 3:15" />Reve Sama'ila von hali she usana. Ana u 'yoyin a̱vu u kpa̱tu'wa̱ na̱ntsutsu vu u'wa wa̱ A̱sulazuva. A̱vu wu uwwa wovon u na waa damma Eli alavu alavu'u. <verse eid="1SA 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 3:16" />Amma Eli ɗe yi ta̱ u damma, &lt;&lt;Sama'ila mawun ma̱ a̱ va̱.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 3:16">A̱vu Sama'ila usu, &lt;&lt;Mpa mu nda.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 3:17" />A̱vu Eli ece yi, &lt;&lt;Nye i ɗa u damma nuwu? She vu soko mu wan. Lyawa A̱sula̱ a ca wu a̱tsuma̱lima̱ lon na̱ vu damma mu suru ili i na u damma nuwu shi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 3:18" />Ɗaɗa Sama'ila damma niyi ili suru, u soko yi ko ili i ta̱ shi. A̱vu Eli damma, &lt;&lt;A̱yi ɗa A̱sulazuva, lyawa u yuwan ili i na i lobono niyi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 3:19" />Sama'ila kungwa ta̱, A̱sulazuva gba a̱ da̱na̱ ta̱ oɓolo na̱ a̱yi. Waru u zuwa ta̱ ili i na Sama'ila dammai suru u shiwan. <verse eid="1SA 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 3:20" />A̱tsuma̱ a Isra'ila suru diga upasu wu ugana u lyuci wa Dan a̱ tyo upasu wu uyagi u lyuci wa Biyasheba, vuma suru a̱tsuma̱ e iɗa'a u reve ta̱ a na Sama'ila vumava̱sula̱ va̱ A̱sulazuva amayun a ɗa. <verse eid="1SA 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 3:21" />Reve A̱sulazuva a̱ ka̱ra̱ o rocosu aciya̱yi a̱ Shilo. Ɗe ɗa u rocoi aciya̱yi ya Sama'ila a̱tsuma̱ a adanshi a̱ yi.<verse eid="1SA 3:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1SA 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 4:1" />Reve adanshi a Sama'ila a̱ ta̱wa̱ e ekere a aza a Isra'ila suru.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="1SA 4:1">Aza a Filistiya a usa ta̱ Akpati a Nzuwulai</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 4:1">A mantsa mo ndolo, aza a Isra'ila o foɓo o uta̱ tsa̱ra̱ a̱ ꞌya̱wa̱a̱ aza a Filistiya nu uvon. Reve aza a Isra'ila a̱ va̱la̱ Ebeniza, reve aza a Filistiya a̱ va̱la̱ a Afe. <verse eid="1SA 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 4:2" />Reve aza a Filistiya e gere adama o uvon. Ana a yuwain uvon wu usuɗuwu, reve a lyuwa aza a Isra'ila nu uvon, reve o una ama ukpakukupa una̱shi (4,000) uba̱ta̱ wu uvon. <verse eid="1SA 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 4:3" />Ana a̱soja a Isra'ila a̱ ka̱mba̱i o uva̱la̱ta̱, reve mbara ma aza a Isra'ila e ece, &lt;&lt;Nye i zuwai A̱sulazuva a lyawai aza a Filistiya a lyuwa ntsu ana'an? Lyawai tsu ta̱wa̱ na Akpati a Nzuwulai a̱ A̱sulazuva pa nda za na ri Shilo, adama u 'ya̱wa̱ oɓolo na̱ a̱ tsu waru u wawa tsu e ekere a n'yuwatan n tsu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 4:4" />Reve a̱ lyungu ama a̱ 'ya̱wa̱ Shilo, a̱vu a̱ ta̱wa̱ na̱ Akpati a Nzuwulai a̱ A̱sulazuva o oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a̱ zuva, za na ri nden a̱ memere me ikerobobi. Olobo e re a Eli, Hofini na̱ Finiha, a̱ shi ta̱ oɓolo na Akpati a Nzuwulai a̱ A̱sula̱'a̱.<verse eid="1SA 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 4:5" />Ana Akpati a Nzuwulai a̱ A̱sulazuva a̱ ta̱wa̱i a̱tsuma̱ o uva̱la̱ta̱, reve aza a Isra'ila suru o oruwo lon adama a̱ ma̱za̱nga̱ hali iɗa i jinga̱ɗa̱. <verse eid="1SA 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 4:6" />Ana aza a Filistiya a uwwai yorori a̱vu a damma, &lt;&lt;Nye i ɗa i ta̱wa̱i na̱ yorori i nda lon o uva̱la̱ta̱ wu mmaci ma Ibrahim?<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mmaci ma Ibrahim ala a ɗa ana n'yuwatan ma aza a Isra'ila e ɗewe yi nle a mantsa ma a nda.</char></note>&gt;&gt; Ana a uwwai a na Akpati a̱ A̱sulazuva a ɗa a̱ ta̱wa̱i a̱tsuma̱ o uva̱la̱ta̱, <verse eid="1SA 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 4:7" />reve wovon u reme aza a Filistiya'a. Reve a damma, &lt;&lt;Musula̱ a̱ ta̱wa̱ ta̱ a̱tsuma̱ o uva̱la̱ta̱'a̱.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 4:7">A̱vu a damma, &lt;&lt;Addama a cina tsu ta̱, adama a na koto a yuwan cu'un vi ili tsunda shi. <verse eid="1SA 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 4:8" />A̱tsuma̱lima̱ a cina tsu ta̱, zane ɗa aa wawa tsu e ekere a̱ musula̱ mu ucira n nda? Ele ɗa musula̱ n na n lapai aza a Masar na̱ cu'un vu mɓa̱la̱ suru a̱tsumona. <verse eid="1SA 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 4:9" />A̱ɗu aza a Filistiya, gbamai okolo yo o ali adama yo o'wo agbashi a mmaci ma Ibrahim a nda cine a̱ shi agbashi a̱ ɗu wan. Yuwain ali, i yuwan uvon!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 4:10" />Reve gba aza a Filistiya a yuwan uvon lon, reve a lyuwa aza a Isra'ila. A̱vu vuma suru suma a̱ ka̱mba̱ o oogodo a̱ yi. O una ta̱ ama a̱bunda̱ lon. Aza a Isra'ila a lamba ta̱ a̱soja a ana a na a̱ da̱na̱i a ana ukpakukupa mataꞌatsu (30,000) o urana u ndolo. <verse eid="1SA 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 4:11" />A usa ta̱ Akpati a Nzuwulai a̱ A̱sula̱. Reve waru o una olobo e re a̱ Eli, Hofini na̱ Finiha.<verse eid="1SA 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukwa̱ wa̱ Eli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 4:12" />A̱vu vuma ro o ugundo wa Banyami suma diga uba̱ta̱ wu uvon, a̱vu u ta̱wa̱ Shilo o urana u ndolo'o na̱ a̱tugu a̱ yi wu karu na̱ ma̱buta̱ aaci a̱ yi, adama u roco wo a̱tsuma̱la̱ngu. <verse eid="1SA 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 4:13" />Ana u rawai, Eli da̱na̱ ta̱ lo nden o ootogu a̱ yi a̱ nge'en mu ure a̱ ka̱lyuwusa̱, adama a na okolo a̱ yi a̱ da̱na̱ ta̱ e meje'en adama a gbaga va Akpati a Nzuwulai a̱ A̱sula̱. Ana vuma'a u uwai a̱ lyuci'i, a̱vu u ca aalabari'i. A̱vu lyuci'i suru gidu'wa̱ na̱ mesun.<verse eid="1SA 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 4:14" />Ana Eli uwwai uɗyo u mesun, a̱vu we ece, &lt;&lt;Nye i ɗa i zuwai mesun ma̱ 'yoyin ne tsunda?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 4:14">Reve vuma'a u jika̱ u 'ya̱wa̱ ya̱ Eli, <verse eid="1SA 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 4:15" />za na da̱na̱i na a'wan kupakucci na̱ kunla̱, waru esu a̱ yi o o'woi ga̱nda̱ ga̱nda̱ u tse ene shi. <verse eid="1SA 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 4:16" />A̱vu vuma'a u damma Eli, &lt;&lt;Gogo nda ɗa n ka̱mba̱i diga uba̱ta̱ wu uvon, waru ana'an n suma ta̱ diga ɗe.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 4:16">Reve Eli ece yi, &lt;&lt;Nye i ɗa i farai, ulobo u va̱?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 4:17" />Reve malingata'a ma̱ usu, &lt;&lt;Aza a Isra'ila a sumaa ta̱ aza a Filistiya, o una ta̱ a̱za̱ o uvon na̱ a̱bunda̱. Waru olobo e re a̱ wu Hofini na̱ Finiha a̱ kuwa̱ ta̱. Waru a usa ta̱ Akpati a Nzuwulai a̱ A̱sula̱.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 4:18" />Ana wu uwwai a̱ ɗeyi aala a Akpati a Nzuwulai a̱ A̱sula̱, a̱vu Eli riya̱ melene diga o ootogu a̱ yi uba̱ta̱ u na u da̱na̱i nden e nge'en mo una̱ntsutsu u lyuci. A̱vu yinlu ya̱ yi i kuɗa reve u kuwa̱, adama a na u kutsa ta̱ waru u ta̱ mgbain. U yuwan ta̱ tsugbain tsa aza a Isra'ila a'wan amunga.<verse eid="1SA 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 4:19" />Jene va̱ yi, ka va Finiha da̱na̱ ta̱ na̱ a̱tsuma̱ ukotu azama limatan. Ana wu uwwai alabari a na a usa ta̱ Akpati a Nzuwulai a̱ A̱sula̱ na alabari a̱ a̱sha̱wa̱le na̱ vali va̱ yi a̱ kuwa̱ ta̱, ɗaɗa mɓa̱la̱ m limatan n reme niyi, reve u da̱nu teri a̱vu u matsan. <verse eid="1SA 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 4:20" />A̱yi azama u kuwa̱, a̱vu a̱ma̱ci a na a̱ ri uɓa̱nu na̱ a̱yi a damma yi, &lt;&lt;She vu uwwa wovon wan, vu matsan ta̱ ulobo.&gt;&gt; Agba u usu ko u ka̱mbuwa̱ ugbozu shi.<verse eid="1SA 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 4:21" />Reve u ca ulobo'o aala Ikabo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Urevu wi idanshi i nda na̱ Tsuyahuda a̱ yi ɗa &lt;&lt;Tsugbain tsa lo shi.&gt;&gt;</char></note>, a dansa, &lt;&lt;Tsugbain tsa kasa ta̱ na̱ Isra'ila.&gt;&gt; Adama a na a usa ta̱ Akpati a Nzuwulai a̱ A̱sula̱ a̱ tyo we e iɗa yo omocin nu ukwa̱ wa̱ a̱sha̱wa̱le na̱ vali va̱ yi. <verse eid="1SA 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 4:22" />A̱vu u damma, &lt;&lt;Tsugbain tsa kasa ta̱ na̱ Isra'ila, adama a na a usa ta̱ Akpati a Nzuwulai a̱ A̱sula̱ a̱ tyo we e iɗa yo omocin.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 4:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1SA 5" />
  <para style="s">Akpati a Nzuwulai a̱tsuma̱ a Ashido na̱ Ekuron</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 5:1" />Ana aza a Filistiya a usai Akpati a Nzuwulai a̱ A̱sula̱'a̱, a̱vu a tara yi diga Ebeniza a̱ tyo Ashido. <verse eid="1SA 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 5:2" />A̱vu a uwa to Akpati a Nzuwulai a̱ A̱sula̱'a̱, o u'wa u ma̱sula̱ ma Dagon, a̱vu a zuwa yi zuzu na̱ Dagon. <verse eid="1SA 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 5:3" />Ana aza a Ashido a̱ 'yoyin na̱ wasasa usana a matawaa a̱vu a cina Dagon riya̱ ma̱kpa̱ɓa̱ e iɗa elime a Akpati a Nzuwulai a̱ A̱sulazuva. A̱vu a̱ 'ya̱sa̱n Dagon a̱ ka̱mbuwa̱ yi uba̱ta̱ u na u shi. <verse eid="1SA 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 5:4" />Amma ana usana u tawisai na̱ wasasa ana a̱ 'yoyin, reve a cina Dagon riya̱ ma̱kpa̱ɓa̱ e iɗa elime a Akpati a Nzuwulai a̱ A̱sulazuva. A̱vu aaci a̱ yi ne ekere a̱ yi suru o koɗuloi reve u da̱na̱ nven o una̱ wu una̱ntsutsu, lipu va̱ yi ɗa goon shi buwai. <verse eid="1SA 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 5:5" />A̱yi ɗa i zuwai hali na ana'an babu ganu va Dagon ko aza a na a uwusa o u'wa ma̱sula̱ ma Dagon a̱tsuma̱ a Ashido a na u tsu dasa una̱ wu una̱ntsutsu wa Dagon.<verse eid="1SA 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 5:6" />A̱vu ukere wu ume wa̱ A̱sulazuva u ga̱la̱ aza a Ashido, oɓolo na̱ mulyuci n na a̱ ri uka̱nda̱ruwu ne ele na̱ meleshe ma̱ a̱bunda̱ ma amicin. <verse eid="1SA 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 5:7" />Ana ama a Ashido enei ne, ɗaɗa a dammai, &lt;&lt;She tsu lyawai Akpati a Nzuwulai a̱ ma̱sula̱ a aza a Isra'ila ma̱ da̱na̱ pa oɓolo na̱ a̱tsu wan! Adama a na ukere wu ume wa̱ A̱sulazuva u ta̱ a̱ nla̱ngi na̱ tsu lon, oɓolo na̱ Dagon ma̱sula̱ ma̱ a̱ tsu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 5:8" />A̱vu ama a Ashido a̱ lyunguwa̱ a azagbain a Filistiya suru na̱ nlingata o ɓoloto, reve e ece le, &lt;&lt;Nye i ɗa tsaa yuwain na Akpati a Nzuwulai a̱ ma̱sula̱ ma aza a Isra'ila?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 5:8">Reve a̱ usu, &lt;&lt;Tarai Akpati a Nzuwulai a̱ ma̱sula̱ ma a aza a Isra'ila a̱ tyo a̱ lyuci va Gat.&gt;&gt; Ɗaɗa a tarai Akpati a Nzuwulai a̱ ma̱sula̱ ma a aza a Isra'ila a̱ tyo Gat.<verse eid="1SA 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 5:9" />Agba ana a tara niyi a̱ tyo ɗe, a̱vu ukere wu ume wa̱ A̱sulazuva u ga̱la̱ lyuci'i, a̱vu wu da'waton le lon. A̱vu u lyunguwa̱ ama a̱ lyuci'i na̱ mɓa̱la̱ ma amici. Zagbain na̱ mawun suru e reme ta̱ amici'in.<verse eid="1SA 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 5:10" />Ɗaɗa a tarai Akpati a Nzuwulai a̱ A̱sula̱ a̱ tyo Ekuron. Ana Akpati a Nzuwulai a̱ A̱sula̱'a̱ a uwai pe, a̱vu a aza a Ekuron o ɓosho na̱ yisali, a damma, &lt;&lt;A̱ ta̱wa̱ ta̱ na Akpati a Nzuwulai a̱ ma̱sula̱ ma a aza a Isra'ila pa ya̱'a̱ tsu adama wu una tsu oɓolo na ama a̱ tsu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 5:11" />A̱vu a̱ lyunguwa̱ azagbain a aza a Filistiya suru na̱ nlingata reve o ɓoloto le, reve a damma, &lt;&lt;Tarai Akpati a Nzuwulai a̱ ma̱sula̱ ma a aza Isra'ila a̱ ka̱mba̱ uba̱ta̱ u na wu uta̱i, ta̱wa̱ wu una tsu na ama a̱ tsu suru wan.&gt;&gt; Adama a na lyuci'i u shiwan ta̱ na̱ wovon wu ukwa̱ lon, adama a na ukere wu ume wa̱ A̱sulazuva u ga̱la̱ le ta̱ uga̱lu lon. <verse eid="1SA 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 5:12" />Ozo o ro a̱tsuma̱ lyuci'i a̱ kuwa̱ ta̱ ɗe, waru akapi a na a buwai a̱ ta̱ pe a̱tsuma̱lima̱ adama a amicin a na a̱ ri nle a̱ lipu. A̱vu suru nle e showen ma̱sula̱ ma̱ le adama u kamba le.<verse eid="1SA 5:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="1SA 6" />
  <para style="s">Aza a Filistiya a̱ ka̱mbuwa̱ ta̱ Akpati a Nzuwulai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 6:1" />Akpati a Nzuwulai a̱ A̱sulazuva a yuwan ta̱ woto cindere e iɗa ya Filistiya. <verse eid="1SA 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 6:2" />Reve aza a Filistiya e ɗe nan ganu na̱ a̱za̱ a̱ yindi a̱vu a damma le, &lt;&lt;Nye i ɗa tsaa yuwan na Akpati a Nzuwulai a̱ A̱sulazuva? Damma ntsu cine tsa̱a̱ ka̱mbuwa̱ yi uba̱ta̱ u na wu uta̱i.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 6:3" />Reve a̱ usu, &lt;&lt;Na̱ ya̱a̱ ka̱mbuwa̱ Akpati a Nzuwulai a̱ ma̱sula̱ ma aza a Isra'ila, she i ka̱mbuwa̱ yi lya̱nga̱ wan, amma i ta lyungu yi oɓolo na̱ kucci makuɗa ma̱ wila̱. Ne ɗa ya̱a̱ ka̱mba̱ gbaga, waru i te reve ili i na i zuwai ukere wa̱ A̱sulazuva a̱a̱ ga̱ga̱la̱ nɗu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 6:4" />A̱vu aza a Filistiya a yuwan yeci, &lt;&lt;Cu'un kucci makuɗa ma̱ wila̱ u ne ɗa tsa̱a̱ lyunguwa̱ yi?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 6:4">Reve a̱ usu, &lt;&lt;Yuwayin uma'an wa amicin a zinariya o ton na̱ a̱ga̱ɗa̱ o ton a zinariya, o una̱ wa̱ a̱bunda̱ azagbain wa aza a Filistiya, adama a na cu'un vu mɓa̱la̱ n ta̱ n ɗa n reme nɗu na̱ azagbain a̱ ɗu. <verse eid="1SA 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 6:5" />Yuwain amicin na̱ a̱ga̱ɗa̱ a na a̱ tsu lyungususa̱ iɗa i ɗu. Na̱ ne ɗa yaa ca ma̱sula̱ ma aza a Isra'ila tsugbain. U ta gura yuwan u tawa oforo a aci a̱ ɗu na̱ musula̱ n ɗu ni iɗa i ɗu. <verse eid="1SA 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 6:6" />Nye i zuwai yaa yuwusan aciyogbamu cine aza a Masar na̱ Firi'awuna yuwain? She na A̱sula̱ ma aza a Isra'ila mo o'wo to nle ili yu ulamu ɗaɗa u lyawa nle a̱ ka̱ra̱i shi?<verse eid="1SA 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 6:7" />&lt;&lt;Gogo she i yuwan keke vi inan sa'avu, na̱ a̱na̱wun e inan e re aza a na a matsain usa'avu, waru aza a na koto a̱ nla̱ le a̱gba̱la̱ e keke vi inan shi. Yi nla̱ ina'an e keke sa'avu'u, amma i takatsuwa na̱ muwu'un a̱vu i gutsu le o u'wa. <verse eid="1SA 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 6:8" />I tara Akpati a Nzuwulai a̱ A̱sulazuva a̱vu i zuwa yi e keke, na akpati o ro vu uma'a wa̱ a̱ga̱ɗa̱ na̱ aza a amicin a zinariya zuzu na̱ a̱ yi, za na ya̱a̱ lyungu wa̱ yi o una̱ u kucci makuɗa ma̱ wila̱. A̱vu i lyawa le a̱ ka̱ra̱. <verse eid="1SA 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 6:9" />Amma yi idana uba̱ta̱ u na a saɓa. Na̱ a̱ kuru agawan a̱ tyo o upasu wa̱ yi a̱ tyo Bet Shemesh, wo o'wo ta̱ A̱sula̱ a aza a Isra'ila a ɗa ma̱ lyunguwa̱a̱ ntsu a̱tsuma̱lima̱ a gbain a nda. Amma na a yuwan ne shi, tsu ta̱ reve a na ukere wa̱ yi u ɗa u lapa ntsu shi, mɓa̱la̱ n ɗa goon n ta̱wa̱ ntsu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 6:10" />Reve ama'a a yuwan cine a damma nle. A̱vu a zami inan i re a̱vu a̱ nla̱a̱ le keke vi inan, reve e reme muwu'un a̱ gutsu le o u'wa. <verse eid="1SA 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 6:11" />Reve a zuwa Akpati a Nzuwulai a̱ A̱sulazuva e keke'e oɓolo na akpati o ro o uma'an u zinariya va̱ a̱ga̱ɗa̱ nu uma'an wa amicin oɓolo na̱ yi. <verse eid="1SA 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 6:12" />A̱vu ina'an i kuru ure mejege a̱ tyo ugawun wu upasu wu utyo wa Bet Shemesh, a̱vu e reme ure na a sali o ure, agba a vadaluwa usa'ani ko ugula̱ shi. A̱vu azagbain a aza a Filistiya a̱ kuru le hali a̱ tyo wu upasu wu utyo wa Bet Shemesh.<verse eid="1SA 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 6:13" />A mantsa'a ama a Bet Shemesh a̱ da̱na̱ ta̱ o ugasa wo oroci a yitabo o uka̱ri. Ana a̱ 'ya̱sa̱in aaci e le reve e ene Akpati'i, a̱vu a uwa ma̱za̱nga̱ ma na e ene niyi. <verse eid="1SA 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 6:14" />Ana keke'e u rawai o uɗuma̱ wa̱ Josuwa va Bet Shemesh a̱vu wi isawan lo zuzu na aatali a gbain o ro. A̱vu ama'a a ɓatsa a̱gba̱la̱ a̱ keke'e reve a paɗa ina'an, a̱vu a yuwaan A̱sulazuva kucci vu ukula̱tosu na̱ le. <verse eid="1SA 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 6:15" />Ama o ugundo wa̱ Levi a̱ shi ta̱ ɗe a̱ cipa̱to Akpati a Nzuwulai a̱ A̱sulazuva'a zuva keke'e, oɓolo na akpati a na a̱ ri nu uma'an u zinariya. A̱vu a zuwa le a aatali a gbai'in. O urana u ndolo ama a Bet Shemesh a ca ta̱ kucci vu ukula̱tosu na̱ kucci ro uba̱ta̱ wa̱ A̱sulazuva. <verse eid="1SA 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 6:16" />Ana azagbain o ton a aza a Filistiya enei ili i na suru i farai reve a gitsa o urana u ndolo'o a̱ ka̱mba̱ Ekuron.<verse eid="1SA 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 6:17" />Apa nda uma'an u zinariya wa amicin na aza a Filistiya a̱ lyunguyi adama wo o'wo kucci makuɗa ma̱ wila̱ uba̱ta̱ wa̱ A̱sulazuva. Za ta̱ adama e ilyuci ya Ashido, za ta̱ adama a Gaza, za ta̱ adama a Ashikelon, za ta̱ adama a Gat, za ta̱ waru adama a Ekuron. <verse eid="1SA 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 6:18" />A̱bunda̱ a̱ a̱ga̱ɗa̱ o uma'an u zinariya'a u da̱na̱ ta̱ una̱ta̱ na̱ a̱bunda̱ e ilyuci ya azagbain o ton ndolo a Filistiya. Ilyuci'i o ɓolo ta̱ ni ilyuci i na a suwayi kari vu ucira oɓolo na̱ mulyuci ma̱ a̱bunda̱ n na n ri na̱ kari shi. Aatali a gbain a na a zuwai Akpati a Nzuwulai ma̱ A̱sulazuva ɗe, za na ri uba̱ta̱ o uɗuma̱ wa̱ Josuwa vuma va Bet Shemesh u ta̱ lo o una̱ wu urotsu hali na ana'an.<verse eid="1SA 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 6:19" />A̱vu A̱sula̱ o una ama kupocindere aza a Bet Shemesh adama a na a̱ ka̱lyuwa̱ ta̱ a̱tsuma̱ Akpati a Nzuwulai a̱ A̱sulazuva'a. Reve ama a yuwan nden n wiruta̱ lon adama a ama a̱ a̱bunda̱ a na A̱sulazuva a lapa nle i ɗa. <verse eid="1SA 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 6:20" />A̱vu aza a Bet Shemesh a damma, &lt;&lt;Zane ɗa a gura isawan elime a̱ A̱sulazuva, A̱sula̱ a akiza a nda? Uba̱ta̱ wa̱ zane u ɗa tsa̱a̱ lyunguwa̱ Akpati a Nzuwulai a̱ A̱sulazuva tsa̱ra̱ wu kasa na̱ a̱tsu?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 6:21" />A̱vu a̱ lyungu nlingata a̱ tyo uba̱ta̱ wa ama a Kiriyat Jeyarim ana, &lt;&lt;Aza a Filistiya a̱ ka̱mbuwa̱ ta̱ Akpati a Nzuwulai a̱ A̱sulazuva. Cipa̱i i tara yi a̱ tyo uba̱ta̱ u ɗu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 6:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="1SA 7" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 7:1" />Reve ama a Kiriyat Jeyarim a̱ cipa̱ a tara a gawan Akpati a Nzuwulai a̱ A̱sulazuva a̱ tyo o u'wa wa Abinada za na ri a aagaɗi. A̱vu a tawa Eliyaza ulobo wa̱ yi u yuwan ipiri ya Akpati a Nzuwulai a̱ A̱sulazuva'a.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:1-2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 6:2-4">2 Sam 6:2-4</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 13:5-7">1 Alb 13:5-7</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="1SA 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sama'ila lyuwa ta̱ aza a Filistiya a Mizfa nu uvon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 7:2" />Akpati a Nzuwulai'i a jima ta̱ a̱ lyuci va Kiriyat Jeyarim hali a'wan ushin. A̱tsuma̱ a mantsa mo ndolo, reve aza a Isra'ila suru e showen A̱sulazuva adama u kamba le. <verse eid="1SA 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 7:3" />Reve Sama'ila damma suru u'wa wa Isra'ila, &lt;&lt;Na̱ ya̱a̱ ka̱mba̱ uba̱ta̱ wa̱ A̱sulazuva no okolo a̱ ɗu suru, to, yoo oco musula̱ mo omocin a na a̱ ri a̱tsuma̱ a̱ ɗu na̱ a̱ma̱li a Ashitore. Reve i ca aciya̱ɗu suru e ekere a̱ A̱sulazuva, reve waru i yuwaan yi a̱ga̱nda̱ goon. Ne ɗa waa wawa ɗu e ekere a aza a Filistiya.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 7:4" />Reve aza a Isra'ila o oco a̱ma̱li a Ba'al na̱ a Ashitore, reve a yuwaan A̱sulazuva goon a̱ga̱nda̱.<verse eid="1SA 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 7:5" />Reve Sama'ila damma, &lt;&lt;Ɓolotoi aza a Isra'ila suru ɗe Mizfa, n ta pati A̱sulazuva adama a̱ ɗu ɗe.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 7:6" />Ana o ɓolotoi ɗe Mizfa, reve e kene mini a̱vu o oco yi e iɗa a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ A̱sulazuva. Reve a yuwan akuli o urana u ndolo ma̱ɓula̱ reve a damma, &lt;&lt;Tsu yuwaan ta̱ A̱sulazuva unusu.&gt;&gt; Reve Sama'ila yuwan tsugbain tsa a aza a Isra'ila a Mizfa.<verse eid="1SA 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 7:7" />Ana azagbain aza a Filistiya a uwwai a na aza a Isra'ila o ɓoloto ta̱ a Mizfa, reve azagbain aza a Filistiya o uta̱ a gawan tsa̱ra̱ a̱ riya̱a̱ le nu uvon. Reve ana aza a Isra'ila a uwwai a̱ ta̱ lo a̱ ta̱wa̱, a uwwa ta̱ wovon wa aza a Filistiya. <verse eid="1SA 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 7:8" />Reve aza a Isra'ila a damma Sama'ila, &lt;&lt;Lyuwa elime na̱ mesun a̱ tyo e ekere a̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ tsu, tsa̱ra̱ u wawa tsu e ekere aza a Filistiya.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 7:9" />Reve Sama'ila paɗa mokyokyon, reve u ca kucci vu ukula̱tosu suru a̱ tyo ekere a̱ A̱sulazuva. Reve u pati A̱sulazuva a kamba aza a Isra'ila, reve gba u usu avasa a̱ yi.<verse eid="1SA 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 7:10" />A̱yi a̱tsuma̱ o casu kucci vu ukula̱tosu'u, reve aza a Filistiya a rawa adama a yuwan uvon na aza a Isra'ila. Amma o urana u ndolo gba reve A̱sulazuva a yuwan tsata tsu ucira a aci aza a Filistiya, reve u zuwa le a̱ ra̱pula̱. Ɗaɗa u lyuwa nle nu uvon, elime aza a Isra'ila. <verse eid="1SA 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 7:11" />Reve aza a Isra'ila o uta̱ ni ilaɗi diga Mizfa, reve o lo le o unusa le o ure hali a rawa uba̱ta̱ u ro zuzu na̱ Bet Ka.<verse eid="1SA 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 7:12" />Reve Sama'ila shuwa̱ aatali a gbain e memere ma Mizfa na̱ Shen. Reve u ca aataliꞌi aala Ebeniza,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:12 </char><char style="ft">A̱yi aala &lt;&lt;Ebeniza&gt;&gt; urevu wa̱ yi u ɗa &lt;&lt;Aatali e Ikambi&gt;&gt; na̱ Tsuyahuda.</char></note> adansa, &lt;&lt;A̱sulazuva a ɗa a kamba n tsu hali acina gogo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 7:13" />Ne ɗa a lyuwai aci a aza a Filistiya, waru a̱ da̱shi uwa upasu wi iɗa wa aza a Isra'ila shi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 7:13">Suru a mantsa ma wuma wa Sama'ila, ukere wa̱ A̱sulazuva u da̱na̱ ta̱ a̱ nla̱ngi na aza a Filistiya. <verse eid="1SA 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 7:14" />Reve a̱ ka̱mbuwa̱a̱ aza a Isra'ila ilyuci i le aza a na aza a Filistiya a usa nle i ɗa, diga Ekuron a̱ tyo Gat. Aza a Isra'ila gba a wawa ta̱ pasu vi ilyuci i le suru diga e ekere a aza a Filistiya. Waru a̱tsura̱ ta̱ asuvu nden ekere aza a Isra'ila na̱ aza a Amoriya.<verse eid="1SA 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 7:15" />Ne ɗa Sama'ila lyuwai elime na̱ tsugbain tsa aza a Isra'ila hali ukosu u wuma wa̱ yi. <verse eid="1SA 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 7:16" />A aa'wan suru, u tsu 'ya̱wa̱ ta̱ a̱ka̱nda̱riya̱ diga Betel a̱ tyo Gilga na̱ Mizfa ba̱ta̱ na u da̱na̱i za vu uge'etosu wa a aza a Isra'ila. <verse eid="1SA 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 7:17" />Amma u tsu ka̱mbisa̱ ta̱ Rama a̱ lyuci va̱ yi, uba̱ta̱ u na u tsu yuwusaan fo aza a Isra'ila uge'etosu. Waru u suwaa ta̱ A̱sulazuva masa'a ɗe a Rama.<verse eid="1SA 7:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="1SA 8" />
  <para style="s">Aza a Isra'ila a pati ta̱ a ca le mogono</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 8:1" />Ana Sama'ila kutsai, reve wo o'woto olobo a̱ yi a̱za̱ o uge'etosu aciya a aza a Isra'ila. <verse eid="1SA 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 8:2" />Aala o ulobo wu ufaru wa̱ yi u ɗa Juwe, aala aza ire waru Abija. A̱da̱na̱ ta̱ o ulinga wu uge'etosu a̱ lyuci va Biyasheba. <verse eid="1SA 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 8:3" />Agba ele a̱ da̱na̱ cine dada le da̱na̱i shi, a̱ shi ta̱ a̱ ka̱mbuwa̱ ugbozu u le e icigi yi ikebe lon. A̱ ushishi ta̱ utowusu wu una̱, a yuwusan uge'etosu u sa'ani shi.<verse eid="1SA 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 8:4" />Reve mbara ma aza a Isra'ila o ɓoloto, a̱vu a̱ 'ya̱wa̱ uba̱ta̱ wa Sama'ila ɗe Rama. <verse eid="1SA 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 8:5" />Reve a damma yi, &lt;&lt;Gogo vu kutsa ta̱, waru olobo a̱ wu a̱ ri cine vu ri shi. Adama o ndolo vu ca tsu mogono za na e ge'eto tsu waru u rono tsu aɗanga cine akapi a nɗa a̱ ri.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 8:6" />Ana a damma niyi, &lt;&lt;Ca tsu mogono za na e ge'eto tsu waru u rono tsu aɗanga,&gt;&gt; Sama'ila uwwa uyoꞌo shi ko ke'en. Reve u yuwan avasa a̱ tyo uba̱ta̱ wa̱ A̱sulazuva. <verse eid="1SA 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 8:7" />Reve A̱sulazuva a damma Sama'ila, &lt;&lt;Zuwa atsuvu e ili i na aa dansa wu suru. Adama a na a̱vu ɗa a̱ 'yuwain shi amma a̱mu ɗa a 'yuwain mo o'wo mogono me ele. <verse eid="1SA 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 8:8" />Cine a yuwain diga urana u na mu uta̱a̱ nle diga Masar hali a̱ tyo ana'an a lyawa numu ta̱ reve a yuwaan musula̱ n ro a̱ga̱nda̱. Waru ne ɗa aa yuwusaan wu. <verse eid="1SA 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 8:9" />To, gogo vu zuwaa le atsuvu, amma gba vu rono le atsuvu lon e ili i na mogono ma na maa yuwan tsugbain a aci e le waa yuwan ne ele.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tsuɓari tsa Sama'ila adama o tsugono</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 8:10" />Reve Sama'ila ka̱mbuwa̱ ama a na a patishi niyi mogono ili i na A̱sulazuva a dammai suru. <verse eid="1SA 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 8:11" />A̱vu u damma le, &lt;&lt;Nda ili i na mogono ma na maa yuwan tsugbain a aci a̱ ɗu waa yuwan na̱ a̱ɗu. U ta tara o olobo a̱ ɗu u zuwa le o'wo a̱soja a̱ yi, o ozo o ro o to o'wo a̱za̱ o ulinga ni ikeke yi ido yu uvon ya̱ yi, ozo o ro waru a ta kumba ido ya̱ yi, ozo o ro waru o to o'wo aza a na aa suma elime e ikeke yi ido yu uvon. <verse eid="1SA 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 8:12" />Ozo o ro waru u ta zuwa le o'wo yali a̱ a̱soja ukpakukupa (1,000) na̱ a̱soja kupoton, ozo o ro waru a ta yuwan iluma yu uɗuma̱ wa̱ yi, a̱vu a gasa ishina ya̱ yi, a̱vu a rumaa yi itana yu uvon oɓolo ni itana yu ulinga adama e ikeke yi ido ya̱ yi. <verse eid="1SA 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 8:13" />U ta tara esheli a̱ ɗu u zuwa le mayan ma mani'in ma̱ ma̱guru, na̱ mpondo, nu ukangalu. <verse eid="1SA 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 8:14" />U ta usa pasu va̱ a̱ɗuma̱ a̱ ɗu a na a la'ai ulobonu, na̱ a̱ɗuma̱ a̱ ina̱bi a̱ ɗu, na̱ za vu ɗanga zetun u ca azagbain a̱ yi. <verse eid="1SA 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 8:15" />U ta usa za ta̱ a̱tsuma̱ a kupa vi itana yu una i ɗu, na̱ a̱za̱ a̱ ina̱bi a̱ ɗu, reve u ca azagbain o ukobu wa̱ yi oɓolo na akapi azagbain a̱ yi. <verse eid="1SA 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 8:16" />U ta usa agbashi a̱ ɗu aza a ali na̱ a̱za̱ a̱ a̱ma̱ci, ni inan i ɗu aza a na a la'ai u ulobonu, na̱ nloli n nɗu, adama a yuwusaan yi ulinga. <verse eid="1SA 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 8:17" />U ta usa za ta̱ a̱tsuma̱ a kupa vo oɓolo e ikyon i ɗu. Waru a̱ɗu na aciya̱ɗu i to o'wo agbashi a̱ yi. <verse eid="1SA 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 8:18" />Nu uranu u ndolo u ta̱wa̱, i ta̱ shon adama o mogono ma na i ɗangulayi aciya̱ɗu, agba A̱sulazuva a̱ usu ɗu shi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 8:19" />Agba ama'a a zuwaa Sama'ila atsuvu e ili i na u damma nle shi. Reve a damma, &lt;&lt;Ko na̱ ne, tsu ciga ta̱ mogono ma na moo rono tsu aɗanga. <verse eid="1SA 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 8:20" />Ne ɗa tsoo o'wo cine akapi a nɗa a̱ ri. A̱yi ɗa woo o'wo tsu zagbain zana e ge'eto tsu waru a̱yi ɗa woo rono a̱ tsu aɗanga a̱ tyo uba̱ta̱ o uvon.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 8:21" />Ana Sama'ila uwwai ili i na ama'a a dammai suru, reve u cuɗuwa A̱sulazuva. <verse eid="1SA 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 8:22" />A̱vu A̱sulazuva a damma, &lt;&lt;Vu zuwaa le atsuvu a̱vu vu ca le mogono.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 8:22">A̱vu Sama'ila damma aza a Isra'ila, &lt;&lt;Vuma suru ka̱mba̱ a̱ lyuci va̱ yi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 8:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="1SA 9" />
  <para style="s">Sama'ila tsuwa̱n ta̱ Shawulu mani'in</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 9:1" />A yuwan ta̱ vuma gbain vu utsuru u ro diga o ugundo wa Banyami, za na da̱na̱i na aala Kish ulobo wa Abiyel ulobo wa Zero ulobo wa Bekora, ulobo wa Afiya za vu ugundo wa Banyami. <verse eid="1SA 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 9:2" />U ta̱ nu ulobo u na a̱ tsu ɗe Shawulu, babu za va Isra'ila na la'a niyi ulobonu. U la'a ta̱ ama a Isra'ila suru uga'an.<verse eid="1SA 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 9:3" />Urana u ro, reve a̱na̱wun o nloli ma̱ Kish dada va Shawulu m puwa̱n, reve u damma Shawulu, &lt;&lt;Tara aagbashi a̱ ta̱ oɓolo na̱ a̱vu, tsa̱ra̱ i 'ya̱wa̱ i zami i le.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 9:4" />Reve a̱ kuru a̱ tyo e iɗa ya agaɗi ya Ifiramu ni iɗa ya Shalisha, agba a̱ tsura̱ e ene nloli'i shi. Reve a̱ ka̱ra̱ a̱ 'ya̱wa̱ e iɗa ya Sha'alim, agba nloli'i mu ɗe shi. Reve fo a̱ ka̱ra̱ a̱ tyo e iɗa ya Banyami, agba suru a̱ tsura̱ e ene le shi.<verse eid="1SA 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 9:5" />Ana a rawai e iɗa ya Zuf reve Shawulu damma aagbashi a na a̱ ri oɓolo na̱ a̱yi, &lt;&lt;Tsu ka̱mba̱ o u'wa fa. Na̱ ne ɗa shi, dada va̱ ta lyawa udamu wa̱ a̱na̱wun o nloli reve u reme udamu adama a̱ tsu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 9:6" />Amma a̱vu aagbashi'i a̱ usu yi u damma, &lt;&lt;Ka̱lyuwa̱ a̱ ta̱ pa na̱ vuma va̱ A̱sula̱ o ro a̱tsuma̱ a̱ lyuci nda za na a casu tsugbain lon, adama a na suru ili i na u dammai u tsu shiwan ta̱. Tsu ka̱ra̱ a̱ tyo uba̱ta̱ wa̱ yi gogo, u ta gura wo o'wo u damma tsu uba̱ta̱ u na tsoo toni.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 9:7" />Reve Shawulu ece aagbashi a̱ yi, &lt;&lt;To, na̱ tsu 'ya̱wa̱ uba̱ta̱ wa̱ yi nye i ɗa tsaa ca yi? Ilyalya i na tsu ri na̱ a̱yi a̱tsuma̱ e itsa̱n o koto ta̱, agba tsu ri ni ili i na tsaa ca yi shi. Ko tsu ta̱ na̱ i ili i ro i na tsa ca yi?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 9:8" />Reve aagbashi'i a̱ usuwisa̱ Shawulu u damma, &lt;&lt;Ka̱lyuwa̱, n ta̱ pa ni ikebe i azurufa ke'en. N ta ca vuma va̱ A̱sula̱'a̱ adama u damma tsu uba̱ta̱ u na tsoo toni.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 9:9" />Cine u shi a̱tsuma̱ a Isra'ila na̱ vuma ciga we ece A̱sula̱, u tsu damma ta̱, &lt;&lt;Ta̱wa̱ tsu 'ya̱wa̱ uba̱ta̱ wu za yindi,&gt;&gt; adama a na za na a̱ tsu ɗe vumava̱sula̱ ana'an, a̱ shi ta̱ a̱ tsu ɗe yi za yindi.<verse eid="1SA 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 9:10" />Reve Shawulu damma aagbashi a̱ yi, &lt;&lt;U lobono ta̱, ta̱wa̱ tsu ka̱ra̱.&gt;&gt; A̱vu e reme ure a̱ tyo a̱ lyuci na vuma va̱ A̱sula̱ da̱na̱i.<verse eid="1SA 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 9:11" />A mantsa ma na a̱ da̱na̱i a kumbusa aagaɗi a̱ tyo a̱ lyuci'i, reve a ga'an ne esheli a na a̱a̱ 'ya̱wa̱ o ooko'o adama e kene mini, reve e ece e le, &lt;&lt;Za yindi ta̱ pa nda'a?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 9:12" />Reve a̱ usu a damma, &lt;&lt;U ta̱ pa, u ta̱ ɗe elime a̱ ɗu. Jika̱i adama a na gogo ɗa u uwai a̱tsuma̱ a̱ lyuci'i, adama a na ana'an ama a̱ ta̱ na̱ kucci uba̱ta̱ wa̱ a̱ga̱nda̱. <verse eid="1SA 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 9:13" />A̱ɗu a ma'uwaa a̱ lyuci'i i ta cina yi babu u ka̱ra̱ a̱ tyo uba̱ta̱ wa̱ a̱ga̱nda̱ a na wa lyuwa ilyalya. Adama a na ama aa lyuwa ilyalya shi she nu u ta̱wa̱, adama a na she nu u zuwaa kucci'i aba'un. Na̱ a̱yi ndolo koto, a̱vu aza a na a banuyi a lyuwa ilyalya. Ka̱ra̱i a gawan gogo, adama a na gogo ɗa mantsa ma na ya̱ tsura̱ ye enei.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 9:14" />A̱vu a̱ ka̱ra̱ a̱ tyo a̱ lyuci. Ele a ma'uwaa ma̱ lyuci'i, reve e ene Sama'ila a̱ mota̱a̱ ana a ga'ansa na̱ a̱yi a̱ 'ya̱wa̱ a gawan uba̱ta̱ wa̱ a̱ga̱nda̱.<verse eid="1SA 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 9:15" />Urana u ta̱ kafu urana u na Shawulu a̱ 'ya̱wa̱, A̱sulazuva o roco ta̱ ɗe Sama'ila ili i nda u damma, <verse eid="1SA 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 9:16" />&lt;&lt;Nfa'an a mantsa ma nda n ta̱ lyungu wa̱ wu vuma diga o ugundo wa Banyami. Vu tsuwa̱n yi mani'in wo o'wo zagbain va ama a̱ va̱, aza a Isra'ila. U ta wawa ama a̱ va̱ e ekere a aza a Filistiya. Me ene ta̱ a̱tsuma̱lima̱ a na ama a̱ va̱ aa uwwusa, adama a na mu uwwa ta̱ mesun me le.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 9:17" />Ana Sama'ila enei Shawulu, ɗaɗa A̱sulazuva a damma niyi, &lt;&lt;Apa vuma na ma̱a̱ ka̱mbuwusa̱ a̱ wu'u. A̱yi ɗa waa yuwan tsugono tsa a ama a̱ va̱, aza a Isra'ila.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 9:18" />Reve Shawulu rawa ya Sama'ila o una̱ntsu u lyuci, a̱vu we ece, &lt;&lt;Vu ta̱ yuwan ankuri vu damma mu uba̱ta̱ u na u'wa wu za yindi u ri?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 9:19" />Reve Sama'ila usu Shawulu, &lt;&lt;A̱mu ɗaɗa za yindi'i! Walai elime a̱ va̱ a̱ tyo uba̱ta̱ wa̱ a̱ga̱nda̱. Ana'an i ta lyuwa oɓolo na̱ a̱mu. Nfa'an nu usana n ta̱ usu yeci ya̱ wu suru, a̱vu n lyawa ɗu i ka̱ra̱ a̱ ka̱mba̱. <verse eid="1SA 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 9:20" />She u ɓa̱la̱ wu adama a̱na̱wun o nloli n na puwa̱yin rana ta'atsu na ka̱ra̱i wan, adama a na a̱ tsura̱ le ta̱ ɗe. Suru ili i na okolo aza a Isra'ila a cigai a̱vu ɗa nu umatsun wa dada va̱ wu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 9:21" />Reve Shawulu usu, &lt;&lt;Amma a̱mu za vu ugundo wa Banyami u ɗa, za na la'ai uka̱la̱mu suru suru a̱tsuma̱ o gundo wa aza a Isra'ila! Waru umatsun u tsu u ɗa u la'ai uka̱la̱mu a̱tsuma̱ o ugundo tsu! Cine vu yuwaan numu cu'un va adanshi a nda?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 9:22" />Reve Sama'ila uwa na̱ Shawulu na aagbashi a̱ yi a aasula a gbain, a̱vu u zuwa le a̱ da̱nu elime uba̱ta̱ u na aza a na a banuyi a̱ ri, a ta rawa ama mata'atsu. <verse eid="1SA 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 9:23" />Reve Sama'ila damma za na a yuwusan ilyalya, &lt;&lt;Ta̱wa̱a̱ mu na apaɗi a nama a na n ca nuwu, za na n damma nuwu, &lt;Zuwa yi ko'o.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 9:24" />Reve za na a yuwusan ilyalya'a ta̱wa̱a̱ na aagutsu a mani'in u zuwa yi a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma Shawulu. A̱vu Sama'ila damma yi, &lt;&lt;A̱yi nda a̱yi ɗa inama i na a zuwai adama a̱ wu. Vu tama, adama a na a tawa yi ta̱ la̱nga̱ adama a̱ wu a̱buki a nda, a mantsa ma na n dammai n ta̱ na̱ aza a na n banuyi.&gt;&gt; A̱tsuma̱ o uranu u ndolo Shawulu lyuwa ta̱ oɓolo na̱ Sama'ila.<verse eid="1SA 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 9:25" />A mantsa ma na a̱ cipa̱i diga uba̱ta̱ wa̱ a̱ga̱nda̱ a̱ tyo a̱ lyuci, a̱vu Sama'ila yuwan adanshi na̱ Shawulu ɗe zuva va aasula<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:25 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">zuva va aasula </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Cine aza a Isra'ila a tsu yuwan usaa u le a tsu suwa yi ta̱ a̱vu a̱ ru'wa̱ zuva'a cine vuma a gura von ɗe, u yuwan ɗe avasa ko u yuwan ɗe u'yetsusu ko a yuwan ɗe fo n dammulai.</char></note> a̱ yi. <verse eid="1SA 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 9:26" />Reve a̱ 'yon na̱ wasasa, a̱vu Sama'ila ɗe Shawulu ɗe a aasula, &lt;&lt;Foɓo, n ta lyawa wu vu ka̱ra̱.&gt;&gt; Ana Shawulu foɓoi, ɗaɗa a̱yi na̱ Sama'ila a̱ ka̱ra̱i oɓolo. <verse eid="1SA 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 9:27" />A mantsa ma na a̱ da̱na̱i a cina ukosu u lyuci, a̱vu Sama'ila damma Shawulu, &lt;&lt;Vu damma aagbashi a̱ wu u ka̱ra̱ elime a̱ tsu.&gt;&gt; Ana a aagbashi'i u ka̱ra̱i elime'e, reve Sama'ila damma yi, &lt;&lt;Vu puro pa ne'e adama n ca wu ikaka diga uba̱ta̱ wa̱ A̱sula̱.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 9:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="1SA 10" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 10:1" />Reve Sama'ila tara meden ma mani'in, a̱vu u tsuwa̱n Shawulu a aaci. Reve u katala yi ɗaɗa u dammai, &lt;&lt;A̱sulazuva a̱ tsuwa̱a̱n wu ta̱ mani'in tsa̱ra̱ voo oꞌwo zagbain va a ama agadu a̱ yi. <verse eid="1SA 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 10:2" />Mantsa ma na vu kasai na̱ a̱mu ana'an, vu ta ga'asan na ali e re zuzu na ason a Rahila a Zeliza upasu wu utyo wa Banyami. A ta damma wu, &lt;A̱ tsura̱ ta̱ a̱na̱wun o nloli'i na vu uta̱i izami'i. Gogo dada ɗu lyawa ta̱ udamu adama e le, u fara ta̱ udamu adama a̱ ɗu. U da̱na̱ ta̱ a̱ yeci, &lt;&lt;Cine maa yuwan adama n bunga̱ o ulobo u va̱?&gt;&gt; &gt;<verse eid="1SA 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 10:3" />&lt;&lt;A̱vu vu lyuwa elime na̱ mmalu diga lo hali she na̱ vu rawa o uɗanga wo oku wa Tabo. Ama a ta'atsu a ta ga'asan na̱ a̱vu lo a gawan a̱ tyo uba̱ta̱ wa̱ a̱ga̱nda̱ wa̱ A̱sula̱ a̱tsuma̱ e Betel. Za ta̱ ta̱ da̱na̱ utanuwu na̱ mugbgbele n ta'atsu, za ta̱ waru ta̱ da̱na̱ na akpatali a ta'atsu o opopofu, za ta̱ waru na̱ itsa̱n vu kwan masayan ma̱ ina̱bi. <verse eid="1SA 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 10:4" />A̱ ta̱ ca̱sa̱ wu, a̱vu a cawu akpatali o opopofu ejere, a̱vu vu ushi le o ukere u le.<verse eid="1SA 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 10:5" />&lt;&lt;Reve vu ka̱ra̱ a̱ tyo aagaɗi a̱ A̱sula̱ a Gibiya uba̱ta̱ u na aza a Filistiya a̱ ri nu uva̱la̱ta̱ wo oɓolo a̱ a̱soja. A̱vu a marawaa a̱ lyuci'i, vu ta cina iɓolo ya ama̱sula̱ a̱ cipusa̱ diga uba̱ta̱ wa̱ a̱ga̱nda̱ a wa'asa igaraya na̱ muganga ni igbala ni ikumburu. Waru a̱ ta̱ da̱na̱ a yuwusan adanshi e ikaka ya̱ A̱sula̱. <verse eid="1SA 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 10:6" />Ruhu va̱ A̱sulazuva ta̱ cipa̱a̱ wu nu ucira, a̱vu vu yuwan adanshi e ikaka ya̱ A̱sula̱ oɓolo ne ele, vu ta vadala vo o'wo vuma ro ko'o. <verse eid="1SA 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 10:7" />Ni iroci i ndolo i shiwan, a̱vu vu yuwan ili i na ve enei i lobonoi. Adama a na A̱sula̱ a̱ ta̱ oɓolo na̱ a̱vu.<verse eid="1SA 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 10:8" />&lt;&lt;Reve vu zura̱ a̱ tyo Gilga elime a̱ va̱ vu puro mu. Na amayun n ta̱ ta̱wa̱ ya̱'a̱ wu n yuwan kucci vu ukula̱tosu na̱ kucci muwwulai, amma ko vu ciga ko vu 'yuwan vu ta̱ puro mu lo hali rana cindere hali n ta̱wa̱ n damma wu ili i na vaa yuwan.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Shawulu o'wo ta̱ mogono</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 10:9" />Mantsa ma na Shawulu vadalai a na wa̱a̱ ka̱ra̱ u lyawa Sama'ila, a̱vu A̱sula̱ a vadala okolo a Shawulu, a̱vu iroci i na suru Sama'ila dammai a shiwan o urana u ndolo. <verse eid="1SA 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 10:10" />Ana Shawulu oɓolo na a aagbashi a̱ yi a rawai Gibiya, a̱vu iɓolo ya ama̱sula̱ a cina yi, a̱vu Ruhu va̱ A̱sula̱ cipa̱a̱ yi nu ucira, a̱vu u uwa a yuwusan adanshi e ikaka ya̱ A̱sula̱ oɓolo ne ele. <verse eid="1SA 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 10:11" />Ana suru aza a na e reve niyi nu ujumu a cina ana'an e ene niyi a yuwusan adanshi e ikaka ya̱ A̱sula̱ oɓolo na ama̱sula̱, reve e ecelei, &lt;&lt;Nye i ɗa i tsura̱i ulobo wa̱ Kish? Shawulu fo u ta̱ a̱tsuma̱ a ama̱sula̱?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 10:12" />A̱vu vuma na ri lo na̱ nden usu, &lt;&lt;Akapi i gba nan dada le fo ama̱sula̱ a ɗa?&gt;&gt; A̱yi nda wo o'wo ta̱ avandaru a adanshi, &lt;&lt;Shawulu fo u ta̱ pe a̱tsuma̱ a ama̱sula̱?&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ka̱lyuwa̱: 1 Sam 19:24.</char></note> <verse eid="1SA 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 10:13" />Ana Shawulu kotoi a yuwusan adanshi e ikaka ya̱ A̱sula̱'a̱, a̱vu u ka̱ra̱ a̱ tyo uba̱ta̱ wa̱ a̱ga̱nda̱.<verse eid="1SA 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 10:14" />A̱vu dada ke'en va̱ yi ece yi na̱ aagbashi a̱ yi, &lt;&lt;A̱ te ɗa i 'ya̱wa̱i?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 10:14">Reve u usu, &lt;&lt;Tsu 'ya̱wa̱ ta̱ izami ya̱ a̱na̱wun o nloli. Ana tse ene nle shi, ɗaɗa tsu 'ya̱wa̱i ya Sama'ila.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 10:15" />A̱vu dada ke'en va Shawulu damma, &lt;&lt;Damma numu ili i na Sama'ila damma nɗu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 10:16" />Reve Shawulu usu yi, &lt;&lt;U damma tsu ta̱ na amayun a na a̱ tsura̱ ta̱ ɗe a̱na̱wun o nloli'i.&gt;&gt; Agba u damma dada ke'en va̱ yi ili i na Sama'ila damma niyi adama o tsugono shi.<verse eid="1SA 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 10:17" />Reve Sama'ila ɗe ama a Isra'ila suru, tsa̱ra̱ a ga'asan a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ A̱sulazuva a Mizfa. <verse eid="1SA 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 10:18" />Ana a ta̱wa̱i a̱vu Sama'ila damma le, &lt;&lt;Apa ili i na A̱sulazuva, A̱sula̱ a aza a Isra'ila a dammai, &lt;Mu uta̱a̱ ta̱ aza a Isra'ila diga e iɗa ya Masar, reve n wawa ɗu e ekere a aza a Masar na̱ tsugono tsa na tso ɓongishi nɗu suru.&gt; <verse eid="1SA 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 10:19" />Amma gogo i 'yuwan ta̱ A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu za na wawa nɗu a̱tsuma̱ e meleshe na addama suru. Reve i damma, &lt;Ko na̱ ne, vu ca tsu mogono.&gt; Gogo ta̱wa̱i, ɓolotoi aciya̱ɗu a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ A̱sulazuva o una̱ wu gundo na̱ matsun ɗu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 10:20" />Reve Sama'ila ta̱wa̱to aza a Isra'ila suru zuzu a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ A̱sulazuva gundo gundo, reve a ɗangwa ugundo wa Banyami na̱ mazuwa ma agita. <verse eid="1SA 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 10:21" />Waru, a̱vu Sama'ila ta̱wa̱a̱ nu ugundo wa̱ Banyami, umatsun umatsun, a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ A̱sulazuva, reve a ɗangwa umatsun wa Matiri. O ukosu reve a ɗangwa Shawulu ulobo wa̱ Kish. Agba ana a zami niyi a̱ tsura̱ ene yi shi. <verse eid="1SA 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 10:22" />Reve e ece A̱sulazuva, &lt;&lt;Koto vuma'a u rawa pa shi?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 10:22">Reve A̱sulazuva a damma, &lt;&lt;U ta̱ ɗe upa'awun e itana ya̱ a̱soja.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 10:23" />Reve ama a suma a̱ 'ya̱wa̱ a̱ ta̱wa̱ na̱ a̱yi, reve ana wi isawain e memere ma ama u la'a za suru uga'an. <verse eid="1SA 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 10:24" />Reve Sama'ila damma ama'a, &lt;&lt;Apa vuma na A̱sulazuva a ɗangwai. Babu tsa̱ yi a̱tsuma̱ a ama suru.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 10:24">Reve ama'a a saala, &lt;&lt;Wuma wa̱ wu u jima, mogono!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 10:25" />Reve Sama'ila cuɗuwa ama ili i na mogono ma na maa yuwan tsugbain a aci e le waa yuwan ne ele. Reve u ɗana le suru a̱tsuma̱ a aatagada o ukutsulusu, a̱vu u zuwa yi a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ A̱sulazuva. Reve Sama'ila bete'we ama suru a̱ ka̱mba̱ a 'wa le.<verse eid="1SA 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 10:26" />Shawulu fo u ka̱mba̱ ta̱ o u'wa wa̱ yi a Gibiya, oɓolo na ali o ukadu aza a na A̱sula̱ a̱ ju'wa̱in okolo e le e shewun yi ta̱. <verse eid="1SA 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 10:27" />Amma ama a vama a damma ta̱, &lt;&lt;Cine tsa ɗa vuma nda aa gura wawa tsu?&gt;&gt; A̱vu o goro yi a 'yuwan a̱ ta̱wa̱a̱ yi nu une'e. Amma a̱yi gba u rungwa̱ ta̱ kpen.<verse eid="1SA 10:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="1SA 11" />
  <para style="s">Shawulu wawa ta̱ lyuci va Jabesh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 11:1" />Ana a jimanuyi, reve Nahash mogono ma aza a Amon ma̱ ka̱nda̱ruwa̱ lyuci va Jabe Giliyadu adama uriya̱ yi nu uvon. A̱vu suru ali a Jabe a damma yi, &lt;&lt;Yuwan nzuwulai na̱ a̱tsu, tsu ta yuwaan wu a̱ga̱nda̱.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 11:2" />Amma Nahash va Amon usu le ta̱, &lt;&lt;N ta yuwan nzuwulai na̱ a̱ɗu adama e ili i ta̱, a̱yi ɗa n kongoro esu o usa'ani a̱ ɗu suru adama yo o'wo ili yi izo'oshi uba̱ta̱ wa aza a Isra'ila suru.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 11:3" />A̱vu mbara ma Jabe n damma yi, &lt;&lt;Ca tsu rana cindere tsa̱ra̱ tsu lyungu nlingata a̱ tyo upasu wa aza a Isra'ila suru. Na̱ babu za na aa wawa tsu, reve tsu caa aciya̱tsu ya̱'a̱ wu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 11:4" />Ana nlingata'a n rawai Gibiya lyuci na Shawulu ri, a̱vu a cuɗuwa ama adanshi a nda. Reve ama'a suru a shon na̱ yisali lon. <verse eid="1SA 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 11:5" />A mantsa'a a gba wuntsa ta̱ Shawulu a̱ ka̱mba̱ diga o uɗuma̱ ni inan yi iluma ya̱ yi elime. A̱vu we ece, &lt;&lt;Nye i ɗa i tsura̱i ama a na a̱ ri e mesun?&gt;&gt; A̱vu a̱ ka̱mbuwa̱ yi ili i na ama a Jabe a dammai.<verse eid="1SA 11:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 11:6" />Ana Shawulu uwwai adanshi e le, a̱vu Ruhu va̱ A̱sula̱ cipa̱a̱ yi nu ucira, a̱vu wu uwwa upan lon. <verse eid="1SA 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 11:7" />A̱vu wu paɗa inan i re apaɗi apaɗi, ɗaɗa u cayi nlingata a̱ 'ya̱wa̱ ne ele uba̱ta̱ suru a̱tsuma̱ a Isra'ila, a dansa, &lt;&lt;Suru za na uta̱i u kuruyi Shawulu na̱ Sama'ila shi, ne ɗa a yuwan ni inan ya̱ yi.&gt;&gt; Ɗaɗa wovon wa̱ A̱sulazuva u remei ama a Isra'ila lon. Reve ali o uta̱ nu uta̱. <verse eid="1SA 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 11:8" />Ana Shawulu ɓoloto nle ɗe Beze, ama ukpakukupa ukpakuta'atsu (300,000) diga Isra'ila, ama ukpakukupa mata'atsu (30,000) waru diga Yahuda.<verse eid="1SA 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 11:9" />Reve a damma nlingata n na n ta̱wa̱i'i, &lt;&lt;Dammayi ama a Jabe Giliyadu, &lt;Kafu urana u suɗuwa nfa'an, i ta̱ tsura̱ iwawi.&gt; &gt;&gt; Ana nlingata'a n 'ya̱wa̱i nu udammu uba̱ta̱ wa ama a Jabe a̱vu a yuwan ma̱za̱nga̱. <verse eid="1SA 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 11:10" />A̱vu a damma aza a Amon, &lt;&lt;Nfa'an tsu ta ca aciya̱tsu e ekere a̱ ɗu, reve i yuwan na̱ a̱tsu ili i na ye enei u lobono nɗu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 11:11" />Na ayin o ndolo reve Shawulu ne'eshen ama a̱ yi oɓolo a ta'atsu. A̱vu a̱ 'ya̱wa̱ va̱la̱ta̱ va aza a Amon nu uvon diga ili ya ayin a̱ tyo wasasa. Reve a uwa mona me le hali urana u rawa a aci. A̱vu e bete'we aza a na a la'ai, babu aza a na e gerei ama e re re.<verse eid="1SA 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">A̱ usu ta̱ Shawulu o'wo mogono</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 11:12" />A̱vu ama a Isra'ila a damma Sama'ila, &lt;&lt;A̱ te ɗa aza a na a dammai, &lt;Cine aa yuwan Shawulu yuwan tsugono tsa̱ tsu?&gt; Ta̱wa̱a̱ ntsu na ama'a tsu una le.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 11:13" />Amma Shawulu damma ta̱, &lt;&lt;Babu ko vuma ta̱ na o una ana'an. Adama a na urana wa ana'an u ɗa A̱sulazuva a yuwayin aza Isra'ila iwawi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 11:14" />A̱vu Sama'ila damma ama'a, &lt;&lt;Ta̱wa̱i tsu 'ya̱wa̱i Gilga adama tsu da̱shi usu Shawulu mogono ma̱ tsu ɗe.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 11:15" />Ɗaɗa ama'a suru a̱ 'ya̱wa̱i ɗe Gilga a̱vu a kucinato Shawulu mogono a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ A̱sulazuva. Ɗe ɗa a cayi kucci muwwulai a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ A̱sulazuva. Reve Shawulu na ama a Isra'ila suru a yuwan ma̱za̱nga̱ ma̱ a̱bunda̱.<verse eid="1SA 11:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="1SA 12" />
  <para style="s">Adanshi o ukosu a Sama'ila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 12:1" />A̱vu Sama'ila damma ama a Isra'ila suru, &lt;&lt;To, mu uwwa ta̱ suru ili i na i damma numu, a̱vu n ca ɗu mogono. <verse eid="1SA 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 12:2" />Gogo i ta̱ na̱ mogono zagbain ɗu. A̱mu gba, n kutsa ta̱ na̱ yono, waru olobo a̱ va̱ a̱ ta̱ lo oɓolo na̱ a̱ɗu. Mo o'wo ta̱ zagbain ɗu diga a̱mu o ulobo hali a cina ana'an. <verse eid="1SA 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 12:3" />A̱mu ɗa nda elime a̱ ɗu. Damma numu a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ A̱sulazuva, oɓolo na̱ zana u tsuwa̱n yi mani'in. Zane ɗa n usai nan ko mololi? Zane ɗa n paalai ko n ɓongi yi? Zane ɗa n kuɗa̱i a yuwaan mejege? O ukere wa zane ɗa n ushiyi utowusu wu una̱ adama m ɓa̱ru esu a̱ va̱? Na̱ n yuwan ta̱ za ta̱ a̱tsuma̱ e le, i damma mu tsura̱ n ka̱mbuwa̱a̱ yi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 12:4" />A̱vu a̱ usu, &lt;&lt;Vu paala tsu shi waru vu ɓongi tsu shi. Vu ushi ko ili i ta̱ o ukere u vuma shi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 12:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 12:5" />Reve Sama'ila damma le, &lt;&lt;A̱sulazuva oɓolo na̱ mogono ma na u tsuwa̱yin mani'in ana'an, ele ɗa lyusu va̱ ekere a̱ ɗu, a na i tsura̱i ili i ro o ukere u va̱ shi.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 12:5">A̱vu a̱ usu, &lt;&lt;A̱sulazuva a ɗa lyusu tsu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 12:6" />Reve Sama'ila yuwan adanshi na ama'a u damma, &lt;&lt;A̱sulazuva a ɗa a ɗangulai Musa na̱ Haruna, za a na o uta̱yi nkaya n ɗu e iɗa ya Masar.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ka̱lyuwa̱: Mta̱ 6:16. </char></note> <verse eid="1SA 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 12:7" />Gogo she yi isawan pa a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ A̱sulazuva, adama n cuwaan ɗu na̱ linga va̱ a̱ɓula̱ na A̱sulazuva a yuwaan nɗu na̱ nkaya n ɗu.<verse eid="1SA 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 12:8" />&lt;&lt;Mantsa ma na Yakubu ka̱ra̱i a̱ tyo Masar, nkaya n ɗu n showen ta̱ A̱sulazuva. A̱vu A̱sulazuva a̱ lyungu Musa na̱ Haruna aza a na o uta̱yi nkaya n ɗu diga e iɗa ya Masar a̱vu a̱ ta̱wa̱to le uba̱ta̱ u nda a̱ da̱nu.<verse eid="1SA 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 12:9" />&lt;&lt;Amma gba a̱vu e icina na̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ e le. Ɗaɗa u zuwa nle e ekere a Sisera, yali a̱ a̱soja ya Hazo, ne ekere a aza a Filistiya, na̱ mogono ma Mowa, aza a na a yuwain uvon ne ele.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ka̱lyuwa̱: A̱.Ug 4:2; A̱.Ug 13:1; A̱.Ug 3:12.</char></note> <verse eid="1SA 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 12:10" />Reve a̱ showen A̱sulazuva a̱vu a damma, &lt;Tsu yuwan ta̱ unusu, tsu lyawa ta̱ A̱sulazuva, reve tsu ka̱ra̱ a yuwusaan a̱ma̱li a Ba'al na̱ Ashitore a̱ga̱nda̱. Amma gogo wawa tsu e ekere a n'yuwatan n tsu, tsu ta yuwaan wu a̱ga̱nda̱.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ka̱lyuwa̱: A̱.Ug 10:10-15</char></note>&gt; <verse eid="1SA 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 12:11" />Ɗaɗa A̱sulazuva a̱ lyungu Jeruba'al za na a̱yi ɗa Gidiyon, na̱ Barak na̱ Japuta na̱ a̱mu Sama'ila.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ka̱lyuwa̱: A̱.Ug 7:1; A̱.Ug 4:6; A̱.Ug 11:29; 1 Sam 3:20.</char></note> A̱vu u wawa ɗu e ekere a n'yuwatan n ɗu upasu suru, adama i yuwan nden gbaga.<verse eid="1SA 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 12:12" />&lt;&lt;Amma a na ye enei Nahash mogono ma Amon ma̱ ta̱ ta̱wa̱a̱ ɗu nu uvon, reve i damma mu, &lt;Ko na̱ ne, tsu ciga ta̱ mogono ma na ma yuwan tsugono tsa̱ tsu,&gt; ko na wo o'woi A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu a ɗa a̱ shi mogono ma̱ ɗu. <verse eid="1SA 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 12:13" />Gogo nda mogono ma na i ɗangulai, zana i pati ta̱ adama a̱ yi, gogo a̱yi ɗa nda A̱sulazuva a ca nɗu a̱ yi. <verse eid="1SA 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 12:14" />Na̱ yu uwwa wovon wa̱ A̱sulazuva, a̱vu i yuwaan yi a̱ga̱nda̱, na̱ tsutoni, agba i yuwan aciyogbamu e ekere a̱ wila̱ wa̱ yi shi, waru na̱ a̱ɗu na̱ mogono ma na maa yuwusan tsugono tsa̱ ɗu i kuru A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu, u to lobono ɗu. <verse eid="1SA 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 12:15" />Amma ni i 'yuwan a na yaa yuwan tsutoni na̱ A̱sulazuva reve i yuwan aciyogbamu e ekere a̱ wila̱ wa̱ yi, ukere wa̱ A̱sulazuva a ta yuwan nla̱ngi na̱ a̱ɗu, cine u da̱na̱i ɗe na̱ nkaya nɗu.<verse eid="1SA 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 12:16" />&lt;&lt;Gogo isawain ye ene ili i gbain ya asalama i na A̱sulazuva a yuwan e esu a̱ ɗu. <verse eid="1SA 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 12:17" />Gogo mantsa me e ikani yo oroci a yitabo i ɗa shi? Waru mantsa me iro'i i ɗa shi. N ta pati A̱sulazuva u lyungu na̱ tsata ni iro'i. Waru i reve ili yu uwuyanu i gbain i na i yuwain e esu a̱ A̱sulazuva a na i pati niyi u ca ɗu mogono.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 12:18" />A̱vu Sama'ila pati A̱sulazuva, o urana u ndolo a̱vu A̱sulazuva a̱ lyungu na̱ tsata ni iro'i. Ɗaɗa ama suru a uwwai wovon wa̱ A̱sulazuva na̱ Sama'ila.<verse eid="1SA 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 12:19" />Reve ama suru a damma Sama'ila, &lt;&lt;Yuwan ipati adama a̱ tsu a agbashi a̱ wu uba̱ta̱ wa̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ wu, adama tsu kuwa̱ wan. Adama a na tsu da̱shi ta̱ unusu u tsu suru iwuya, uba̱ta̱ e ipati i na aa ca tsu mogono.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 12:20" />Reve Sama'ila damma, &lt;&lt;She yu uwwa wovon wan, ko na wo o'woi i yuwan ta̱ iwuya i nda suru. Suru na̱ ne she i vadala ucina̱ i lyawa itoni ya̱ A̱sulazuva wan, amma i yuwaan yi a̱ga̱nda̱ no okolo a̱ ta̱. <verse eid="1SA 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 12:21" />She i vadala a̱ tyo uba̱ta̱ u musula̱ me pere wan. Adama a na aa yuwaan ɗu isa'ani shi, ko a wawa ɗu shi, adama a na a̱ ri nu urana shi. <verse eid="1SA 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 12:22" />Adama a ala a gbain a̱ yi, A̱sulazuva aa vari ama a̱ yi shi. Adama a na u yo'ono ta̱ A̱sulazuva wo o'wo to ɗu ama a̱ yi. <verse eid="1SA 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 12:23" />A̱mu na aciya̱va̱ gba, A̱sulazuva aa para n yuwaan yi unusu uba̱ta̱ o ulambu u mayan ma avasa adama a̱ ɗu. Waru n to roco ɗu ure u na u ri mejege nu ulobonu. <verse eid="1SA 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 12:24" />Agba i reve yu uwwa ta̱ wovon wa̱ A̱sulazuva, a̱vu i yuwaan yi a̱ga̱nda̱ na amayun no okolo a̱ ta̱. I cuwan na̱ ili i gbain ya asalama i na u yuwaan nɗu. <verse eid="1SA 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 12:25" />Amma ni i lyuwa elime nu unusu, a̱ɗu na̱ mogono ma̱ ɗu a̱ ta̱ e iza̱ a̱ ɗu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 12:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="1SA 13" />
  <para style="s">Shawulu yuwaan ta̱ A̱sula̱ aciyogbamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 13:1" />Shawulu na a'wan mata'atsu ɗaɗa wo o'woi mogono, waru u yuwan ta̱ tsugono tsa Isra'ila a'wan amunga ne ejere.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Na̱ Tsuyahuda a ɗana ta̱ ana, &lt;&lt;Shawulu ulobo wa a'wan a̱ ta̱, waru u yuwan ta̱ tsugono a a'wan e re.&gt;&gt; A̱ ri nu urevu wa amayun wa̱ a̱bunda̱ wa a'wa'an shi. Ozo o ro a na a ɗana niyi ɗe nu ujumu adamma ta̱ Shawulu da̱na̱ ta̱ na a'wan mata'atsu. Ozo o ro waru a cuɗuwa ta̱ a'wan e re a ɗa Shawulu yuwain o tsugono kafu uvon, amma Ajiya 13:21 damma ta Shawulu yuwan ta̱ tsugono a'wan amunga.</char></note><verse eid="1SA 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 13:2" />Reve Shawulu ɗangulaa aciya̱yi ama ukpakukupa uta'atsu (3,000) a̱tsuma̱ a ama a Isra'ila. Ama ukpakukupa ure (2,000) a̱ da̱nu ta̱ na̱ yi ɗe Mikimash, oɓolo na̱ iɗa ya agaɗi ya Betel. Waru ukpakukupa (1,000) u da̱na̱ ta̱ na̱ Jonata ɗe Gibiya upasu wa Banyami. Akapi a ama gba Shawulu lyawa le ta̱ a̱ ka̱mba̱ a 'wa le.<verse eid="1SA 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 13:3" />Jonata riya̱a̱ ta̱ va̱la̱ta̱ va aza a Filistiya nu uvon ɗe Geba, waru aza a Filistiya a uwwa ta̱ a ɗa e ili i na i farai. A̱vu Shawulu lyungu ee ivula̱ aavana e iɗa suru a̱vu a damma, &lt;&lt;Lyawa Mmaci ma Ibrahim mu uwwa!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 13:4" />A̱vu aza a Isra'ila suru a uwwa alabari a na Shawulu riya̱a̱ ta̱ va̱la̱ta̱ vo oɓolo a̱soja a Filistiya nu uvon, a̱vu gba aza a Isra'ila o o'wo ili yi idaba uba̱ta̱ wa aza a Filistiya. A̱vu e ɗe ama o uta̱, reve a ga'an na̱ Shawulu ɗe Gilga.<verse eid="1SA 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 13:5" />Reve aza a Filistiya o ɓoloto tsa̱ra̱ a yuwan uvon na aza a Isra'ila. A̱vu o uta̱ ni ikeke yi ido yu uvon ukpakukupa o uta'atsu (3,000) na akumbi e ido ukpakukupa uta̱li (6,000) na̱ oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a̱ a̱bunda̱ lon tsa̱ wuyun e ikyun i mala. A̱vu a gawan a̱ ya̱wa̱ a̱ va̱la̱ a Mikimash asana a Bet Aven. <verse eid="1SA 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 13:6" />Ana a̱soja a Isra'ila enei a̱ ta̱ pe a̱tsuma̱lima̱, waru a̱soja a Filistiya a̱ ga̱la̱ le ta̱ uga̱lu, reve a̱soja'a a pa'aton aciya̱le, ozo o ro a̱ da̱na̱ ta̱ pe a̱ba̱nu, ozo o ro awanda, ozo o ro a atali, waru ozo o ro a̱nci, ozo o ro o oko'o. <verse eid="1SA 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 13:7" />Reve Mmaci ma Ibrahim n ro n pasalai mavada ma̱ o Uɗolu wa̱ Urudu a̱ tyo upasu wi iɗa ya Gadu nu upasu wa Giliyadu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 13:7">Shawulu gba u da̱na̱ ta̱ pe Gilga, waru suru aza a na a̱ ri oɓolo na̱ a̱yi e teme ta̱ meje'en ma̱ lipu adama o wovon. <verse eid="1SA 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 13:8" />Wi isawan ta̱ hali a cina rana cindere, mantsa ma na Sama'ila zuwaa niyi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ka̱lyuwa̱: 1 Sam 10:8.</char></note> Amma Sama'ila ta̱wa̱ Gilga shi. A̱vu ama a Shawulu a̱ ka̱ra̱ e bete'wishe. <verse eid="1SA 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 13:9" />Ɗaɗa Shawulu dammai, &lt;&lt;Ta̱wa̱a̱ numu na̱ kucci vu ukula̱tosu na̱ kucci muwwulai.&gt;&gt; A̱vu Shawulu yuwan kucci vu ukula̱tosu. <verse eid="1SA 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 13:10" />A̱yi u koto ucasu u kucci vu ukula̱tosu she gba Sama'ila a marawaa. Reve Shawulu 'ya̱wa̱ u cina yi u ca̱sa̱ yi.<verse eid="1SA 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 13:11" />A̱vu Sama'ila ece, &lt;&lt;Nye i ɗa vu yuwain?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 13:11">Reve Shawulu usu u damma, &lt;&lt;Ana me enei ama e bete'wishe agba vu ta̱wa̱ a mantsa'a shi, waru aza a Filistiya o to ɓolotosu ɗe Mikimash, <verse eid="1SA 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 13:12" />a̱vu n yuwan majiyan, &lt;Gogo aza a Filistiya a̱ ta̱ ta̱wa̱a̱ mu nu uvon pa nda Gilga waru koto m pati isa'ani ya̱ A̱sulazuva shi.&gt; Ɗaɗa n zuwai aciya̱va̱ nu ucira n yuwan kucci vu ukula̱tosu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 13:13" />Reve Sama'ila damma Shawulu, &lt;&lt;Vu yuwan ta̱ tsulo lon. Vu kuru wila̱ wa̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ wu shi za na u damma nuwu vu yuwan shi. Na̱ vu shi vu kuru wila̱'a̱, u shi ta̱ a zuwa tsugono tsa̱ wu tsa lyuwa elime e ekere a aza a Isra'ila babu ukosu. <verse eid="1SA 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 13:14" />Amma gogo tsugono tsa̱ wu tsaa lyuwa elime shi. A̱sulazuva a̱ bunga̱ ta̱ vuma na okolo a̱ yi a cigai a̱vu u zuwa yi zagbain va ama a̱ yi,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ka̱lyuwa̱: Ajy 13:22.</char></note> adama a na vu kuru wila̱ wa̱ A̱sulazuva shi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 13:15" />Ɗaɗa Sama'ila lyawai Gilga a̱vu u ka̱ra̱ a̱ tyo Gibiya va Banyami. A̱vu Shawulu kece akapi a ama a na a buwai oɓolo na̱ a̱yi. A̱vu a̱ tsura̱ a̱bunda̱ a ama ukpakuta̱li (600).<verse eid="1SA 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Aza a Isra'ila babu itana yu uvon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 13:16" />Shawulu na̱ ulobo wa̱ yi Jonata na ama a na a̱ ri oɓolo ne ele a̱ da̱nu ta̱ Geba va Banyami. Reve aza a Filistiya a yuwan uva̱la̱ta̱ u le a Mikimash. <verse eid="1SA 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 13:17" />A̱vu oɓolo a ta'atsu a̱ a̱soja a Filistiya o uta̱ diga o uva̱la̱ta̱ u le adama o uvon. Reve oɓolo a̱ ta̱ a̱ 'ya̱wa̱ Ofura, a̱tsuma̱ o upasu wa Shuwal, <verse eid="1SA 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 13:18" />oɓolo o ro a̱ tyo ta̱ Bet Horon oɓolo o ro waru a̱ tyo o ta̱ ukosu wi iɗa i na ya̱a̱ ka̱lyuwusa̱ uka̱ri wa Zeboyim a̱ nka̱la̱la̱i zuzu na̱ a̱tsumona.<verse eid="1SA 13:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 13:19" />A mantsa ma nda babu maruma ma na a̱ tsura̱i a̱tsuma̱ e iɗa ya Isra'ila suru, adama a na aza a Filistiya a damma ta̱, &lt;&lt;Na̱ shi tsu lyawa le, Mmaci ma Ibrahim a̱ shi ta̱ aa yuwaan aciya̱le mutsun mu pe'eni ni ibata!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 13:20" />Ɗaɗa aza a Isra'ila suru a saɓai a̱cipa̱ a̱ tyo uba̱ta̱ wa aza a Filistiya adama e tewe elentsu a̱ a̱ba̱ri e le, na agalatsu e le, na aɓau na̱ ogonu le. <verse eid="1SA 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 13:21" />Waru atsupu'u ikebe i azurufa re ɗa a̱tsuma̱ a aza a ta'atsu vu utewishe wa̱ a̱ba̱ri e le na agalatsu e le. Atsupu o utewishe wa aɓau e le na̱ kune gbain va akatsu a ta'atsu e le na̱ aaɗanga a̱ ma̱gba̱ra̱ me inan i le, ikebe i azurufa ta̱ ɗa a̱tsuma̱ a aza a ta'atsu.<verse eid="1SA 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 13:22" />Ne ɗa o urana wu uvon u ndolo babu soja va Shawulu na̱ Jonata a na a̱ shi na̱ matsun me pe'eni ko ibata o ukere wa̱ yi, Shawulu na̱ Jonata ulobo wa̱ yi u ɗa goon a̱ shi ne ele.<verse eid="1SA 13:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jonata 'ya̱wa̱a̱ ta̱ aza a Filistiya nu uvon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 13:23" />Reve oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a aza a Filistiya o uta̱ a̱ tyo o upasata wa Mikimash.<verse eid="1SA 13:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="1SA 14" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 14:1" />Urana u ro reve Jonata ulobo wa Shawulu u damma ulobo u na wa̱a̱ guzusa̱a̱ yi itana yu uvon, &lt;&lt;Ta̱wa̱, tsu 'ya̱wa̱ upasalai wa̱ oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a Filistiya, upasu u ndeɗe.&gt;&gt; Agba u damma dada va̱ yi shi.<verse eid="1SA 14:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 14:2" />Shawulu da̱na̱ ta̱ nden o ukosu wa Gibiya za̱la̱ vu uɗanga u muwun peme a̱tsuma̱ a Migiron. Ama a na a̱ da̱na̱i oɓolo na̱ a̱yi a rawa ta̱ ama ukpaku uta̱li (600), <verse eid="1SA 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 14:3" />oɓolo na̱ Ahija ganu zana da̱na̱i wotowu na̱ epo. A̱yi ulobo wa Ahitu ɗa mawun ma a̱na̱wun ma Ikabo olobo a Finiha, ulobo wa̱ Eli, ganu va̱ A̱sulazuva a̱tsuma̱ a Shilo. Agba ko za reve a na Jonata ka̱ra̱i shi.<verse eid="1SA 14:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 14:4" />O upasata u masasan ma na Jonata cigai u kuruwa̱a̱ a̱ tyo o oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a Filistiya atali o uga'an a̱ shi ta̱ lo a̱ mɓa̱nga̱ suru. Aala a za ta̱ Boze, za va ire waru Sene. <verse eid="1SA 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 14:5" />Aatali a̱ ta̱ e isawan ta̱ ugana a̱ ka̱lyuwusa̱ eleme a Mikimash, za ta̱ waru uyagi elime a Geba.<verse eid="1SA 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 14:6" />Reve Jonata damma ulobo u na wa̱a̱ guzusa̱a̱ yi itana yu uvon, &lt;&lt;Ta̱wa̱ tsu 'ya̱wa̱ o uva̱la̱ta̱ wa̱ a̱ a̱soja a Filistiya a aza a na a paɗai uryumbu shi. U ta gura o'wo A̱sulazuva a yuwan ulinga adama a̱ tsu. Babu ili i na yaa putsa A̱sulazuva ni iwawi, u ta̱ tsura̱ u lyuwu wa aci ko na ali o uvon a̱bunda̱ ko na̱ ri uka̱la̱mu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 14:7" />Reve za na a̱a̱ guzusa̱a̱ yi itana yu uvo'on u damma yi, &lt;&lt;Yuwan ili i na i ri o okolo a̱ wu suru. Yuwan cine vu cigai, o okolo a̱ va̱ o to oɓolo na̱ a̱vu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 14:8" />Reve Jonata damma, &lt;&lt;Lyawa tsu pasa a̱ 'ya̱wa̱ uba̱ta̱ wa ama'a adama tsu roco aciya̱tsu uba̱ta̱ u le. <verse eid="1SA 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 14:9" />Na a damma tsu, &lt;Puroyi hali she na̱ tsu ta̱wa̱ ya̱'a̱ ɗu,&gt; tsu te isawan uba̱ta̱ u na tsu ri, tsa̱a̱ 'ya̱wa̱ gawan le shi. <verse eid="1SA 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 14:10" />Amma na a damma, &lt;Ta̱wa̱i gawan tsu,&gt; tsu ta kumba a gawan, adama a na a̱yi nda u to o'wo tsu iroci i na A̱sulazuva a ca le ta̱ e ekere a̱ tsu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 14:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 14:11" />Ɗaɗa ele ra o rocoi aciyele uba̱ta̱ wa̱ o oɓolo a̱soja a Filistiya. Reve aza a Filistiya a damma, &lt;&lt;Ka̱lyuwa̱i! Mmaci ma Ibrahim n te e ika̱ta̱pu o uta̱sa̱ a̱ a̱nci uba̱ta̱ u na a pa'aton yi aciya̱le.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 14:12" />Reve o oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a aza a Filistiya a salaa Jonata na̱ ulobo u na wa̱a̱ guzusa̱a̱ yi itana yu uvo'on, &lt;&lt;Gawain a̱ ta̱wa̱ uba̱ta̱ u tsu, tsu ta yuwan a̱guma̱ a̱ ɗu.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 14:12">Ɗaɗa Jonata dammai ulobo u na wa̱a̱ guzusa̱a̱ yi itana yu uvo'on, &lt;&lt;Gawan o oɓolo na̱ a̱mu, A̱sulazuva a ca le ta̱ o ukere wa aza a Isra'ila.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 14:13" />Reve Jonata kumba ne ekere a̱ yi na ana, waru ulobo u na wa̱a̱ guzusa̱a̱ yi itana yu uvon a̱ca̱pa̱ a̱ yi. Jonata una ta̱ ozo o ro ne ekere a̱ yi, reve za na aa guzusa̱a̱ yi itana yu uvon una ozo ro e le a̱ca̱pa̱ a̱ yi. <verse eid="1SA 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 14:14" />O uvon wu ufaru reve Jonata na̱ ulobo u na wa̱a̱ guzusa̱a̱ yi itana yu uvon o una ama ushin a agalaci a washin a na a rawai uɓatsulai wu uɗuma̱ u na inan yi iluma yaa luma urana u ta̱.<verse eid="1SA 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 14:15" />Reve wovon u reme a̱ a̱soja a Filistiya a na a̱ ri o uva̱la̱ta̱ suru, na a aza a na a̱ ri ya aa alanga, hali fo na̱ o oɓolo a̱ a̱soja, na a aza a na a̱ tsu 'ya̱wa̱a̱ nu uvon. Reve suru n le a uwwa wovon lon. Reve iɗa i jinga̱ɗa̱. A̱sula̱ a ɗa a̱ lyunguyi na̱ wovon u ndolo.<verse eid="1SA 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Aza a Isra'ila a lyuwa ta̱ aza a Filistiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 14:16" />Ana a̱za̱ e ipiri ya Shawulu a̱tsuma̱ a Gibiya va Banyami a̱ ka̱lyuwa̱i, reve e ene o oɓolo a̱soja a aza a Filistiya e bete'we za suru saɓa ure wa̱ yi. <verse eid="1SA 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 14:17" />Reve Shawulu damma ama a na a̱ ri oɓolo na̱ a̱yi, &lt;&lt;Kecei a̱soja tsura̱ i reve a aza a na a̱ ri pa oɓolo na̱ a̱tsu shi.&gt;&gt; Ana e kecei, Jonata na̱ ulobo u na wa̱a̱ guzusa̱a̱ yi itana yu uvon ɗa a̱ ri lo shi.<verse eid="1SA 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 14:18" />Ɗaɗa Shawulu dammai Ahija, &lt;&lt;Ta̱wa̱ na Akpati a Nzuwulai a̱ A̱sula̱ pa nda.&gt;&gt; Adama a na a mantsa mo ndolo u da̱na̱ ta̱ ekere a aza a Isra'ila. <verse eid="1SA 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 14:19" />Shawulu a yuwusaan adanshi na̱ ganu'u, reve utogbolyuwu a̱tsuma̱ o uva̱la̱ta̱ wa aza a Filistiya u ka̱ra̱ a̱ da̱shishi. Ɗaɗa Shawulu dammai ganu, &lt;&lt;She u damaton wu wan.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 14:20" />Ɗaɗa Shawulu na ama a̱ yi suru o ɓolotoi reve a̱ ka̱ra̱ a̱ tyo uba̱ta̱ o uvon. A cina ta̱ aza a Filistiya utogbolyuwu lon, a munulai can le na̱ mutsun mu pe'eni. <verse eid="1SA 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 14:21" />Mmaci ma Ibrahim n na n ri oɓolo na aza a Filistiya, waru a̱ ka̱ra̱i a gawan oɓolo ne ele o uva̱la̱ta̱, a̱ ka̱mba̱ ta̱ a̱ tyo uba̱ta̱ wa aza a Isra'ila aza a na a̱ ri oɓolo na̱ Shawulu na̱ Jonata. <verse eid="1SA 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 14:22" />Ana aza a Isra'ila suru a na a̱ shi a pa'ain a̱tsuma̱ e iɗa ya agaɗi ya Ifiramu a uwwai a na aza a Filistiya e te ilaɗi, ele fo a saɓa le ta̱ a̱ca̱pa̱ nu uvon. <verse eid="1SA 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 14:23" />Ne ɗa A̱sulazuva a wawai aza a Isra'ila o urana u ndolo, waru uvon u lyuwa ta̱ elime hali u ka̱ra̱ Bet Aven.<verse eid="1SA 14:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jonata pupeɗe ta̱ ishiki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 14:24" />O urana u ndolo a̱ a̱soja a Isra'ila a uwa ta̱ a̱tsuma̱lima̱, adama a na Shawulu tara ta̱ akucunu na ama a dansa, &lt;&lt;Una̱ u ta̱ reme vuma na suru lyuwai ilyalya babu na ulivu u yuwain, babu na n tsupayi aciya̱va̱ e ekere a n'yuwatan n va̱!&gt;&gt; Ne ɗa gba babu vuma na peɗei ilyalya.<verse eid="1SA 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 14:25" />Ana a̱ a̱soja'a suru a uwai a̱ a̱a̱rumbu, a̱vu a cina ishiki e iɗa. <verse eid="1SA 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 14:26" />Waru ana a uwai a̱ a̱a̱rumbu'u, a̱vu a cina pe ishiki a̱ ɗa̱wusa̱, agba babu za na zuwai aakatsu u peɗei, adama a na ama a ta uwwusa wovon wa akucunu'u. <verse eid="1SA 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 14:27" />Agba Jonata reve a na dada va̱ yi yuwain akucunu na ama'a shi, ɗaɗa u sapiyi combo va a aaɗanga a na a̱ ri o ukere wa̱ yi reve u tsupu yi a abaji e ishiki'i. Reve u 'ya̱sa̱n ukere wa̱ yi a̱ tyo o una̱ wa yi, a̱vu esu a̱ yi a̱ kpa̱tu'wa̱. <verse eid="1SA 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 14:28" />Reve za ta̱ a̱tsuma̱ a ama'a u damma yi, &lt;&lt;Dada va̱ wu yuwaan ta̱ ama akucunu o usa̱n, u damma, &lt;Una̱ u ta̱ reme vuma na suru lyuwai ilyalya ana'an!&gt; A̱yi ɗa i zuwai ama a̱ ri uta̱ka̱lyuwu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 14:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 14:29" />Ɗaɗa Jonata dammai, &lt;&lt;Dada va̱ ta̱wa̱a̱ ta̱ iɗa na addama. Ka̱lyuwa̱ cine esu a̱ va̱ a̱ kpa̱tu'wa̱i a na m peɗei ishiki i nda ke'en. <verse eid="1SA 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 14:30" />U shi a la'a na̱ a̱ shi a damma a lyawa ta̱ ama a lyuwa ilyalya fa̱a̱n ana'an diga a̱tsuma̱ e ilyalya i na a̱ pura̱i uba̱ta̱ wu n'yuwatan n le. Aza a Filistiya a na tsu shi o una a̱ shi a la'a nda shi?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 14:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1SA 14:31" />O urana u ndolo o una ta̱ aza a Filistiya diga Mikimash a̱ tyo Ajalon, waru ama a̱ta̱ka̱lyuwu ta̱ lon. <verse eid="1SA 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1SA 14:32" />Reve a ama a̱ ga̱da̱ra̱ azaza e itana yu uvon i na a̱ pura̱i. A̱vu a̱ pura̱ ikyon ni inan, na̱ mudindim a̱vu a paɗa le e iɗa, reve a tama le oɓolo na̱ mpasa n le. <verse eid="1SA 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1SA 14:33" />Reve ama a damma Shawulu, &lt;&lt;Ka̱lyuwa̱i, a̱yi ɗa nda ama a yuwusan unusu e ekere a̱ A̱sulazuva a tamusa inama na̱ mpasa.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:33 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ka̱lyuwa̱: Ufr 9:4; N.Gn 7:26-7; N.Gn 17:10-14; N.Gn 19:26; U.Wl 12:16; U.Wl 12:23; U.Wl 15:23.</char></note></para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 14:33">Reve u damma, &lt;&lt;I kuɗa ta̱ wila̱. Bunda̱la̱i aatali a gbain a̱ ta̱wa̱ pa nda gogo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 14:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1SA 14:34" />Reve u dammisa, &lt;&lt;Ka̱ra̱i o uta̱ uba̱ta̱ wa ama a̱vu i damma le, &lt;Lyawa vuma suru ta̱wa̱ na̱ nan va̱ yi ko kyon va̱ yi, a̱vu a paɗa le pa a tama le. She i yuwusan unusu uba̱ta̱ wa̱ A̱sulazuva i tama inama na̱ mpasa n le wan.&gt; &gt;&gt; Ne ɗa za suru ta̱wa̱i na̱ nan va̱ yi ayin o ndolo reve a paɗa le ɗe aatali'i. <verse eid="1SA 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1SA 14:35" />Ɗaɗa Shawulu suwayi A̱sulazuva masa'a, a̱yi ɗa masa'a mo ufaru ma na u suwayi A̱sulazuva.<verse eid="1SA 14:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1SA 14:36" />Reve Shawulu damma, &lt;&lt;Lyawa tsu cipa̱i za̱la̱ tsu 'ya̱wa̱a̱ aza a Filistiya nu uvon na ayin a̱vu waru tsu pura̱ le itana hali she usana, waru tsaa lyawa za ro le wuma shi.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 14:36">Reve a̱ usu, &lt;&lt;Yuwan ili i na ve enei u lobono wu ta̱ suru.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 14:36">Amma ganu damma ta̱, &lt;&lt;Lyawa tse ecei A̱sula̱ pa nda.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 14:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="1SA 14:37" />A̱vu Shawulu ece A̱sula̱, &lt;&lt;N ka̱ra̱ a̱cipa̱ a na ma̱ 'ya̱wa̱a̱ aza a Filistiya nu uvon? Vu ta ca le e ekere a aza a Isra'ila?&gt;&gt; Agba A̱sula̱ a̱ usu yi o urana u ndolo shi.<verse eid="1SA 14:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="1SA 14:38" />Reve Shawulu damma, &lt;&lt;Ta̱wa̱yi pa nda, suru nɗu azagbain a̱ a̱soja, reve tsu zamiyi cu'un vu unusu u na a yuwain ana'an. <verse eid="1SA 14:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1SA 14:39" />N kucuna ta̱ na̱ A̱sulazuva a na a̱ ri wuma za na wawai Isra'ila, ko na̱ u shi u bura ta̱ ulobo u va̱ Jonata, she nu u kuwa̱.&gt;&gt; Amma babu za na yuwain adanshi a̱tsuma̱ a ama a na a̱ da̱na̱i lo.<verse eid="1SA 14:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="1SA 14:40" />Reve Shawulu damma aza a Isra'ila suru, &lt;&lt;Yi isawan ndeɗe, waru a̱mu na̱ Jonata ulobo u va̱ tsu te isawan pa nda.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 14:40">A̱vu ama'a a̱ usu Shawulu, &lt;&lt;Yuwan ili i na ve enei u lobono nuwu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 14:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1SA 14:41" />Reve Shawulu yuwan avasa a̱ tyo uba̱ta̱ wa̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a Isra'ila, &lt;&lt;Nye i zuwai vu usu yi aagbashi a̱ wu ana'an shi? Na̱ unusu u va̱ u ɗa, ko za vu ulobo u va̱ Jonata, vu usu na̱ Urim, amma nu unusu wa ama a Isra'ila ɗa,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:41 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Nye i zuwai vu usu yi aagbashi a̱ wu ana'an shi? Na̱ unusu u va̱ u ɗa, ko za vu ulobo u va̱ Jonata, vu usu na̱ Urim, amma nu unusu wa ama a Isra'ila ɗa </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A̱za̱ e iɗana o ro o ufaru na̱ Tsuheleni ele ɗa a̱ ri na̱ idanshi i nda.</char></note> vu usu na̱ Tumim.&gt;&gt; Reve mazuwa ma agita mo roco Jonata na̱ Shawulu ɗa, reve ama'a o o'wo babu unusu. <verse eid="1SA 14:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1SA 14:42" />Reve Shawulu damma, &lt;&lt;Zuwayi agita e ekere va̱ na̱ Jonata ulobo u va̱.&gt;&gt; A̱vu a tawa Jonata.<verse eid="1SA 14:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="1SA 14:43" />Ɗaɗa Shawulu dammai Jonata, &lt;&lt;Damma mu ili i na vu yuwain.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 14:43">Ɗaɗa Jonata damma niyi, &lt;&lt;M peɗe ta̱ ishiki wa'a nu combo va aaɗanga a na a̱ ri o ukere u va̱. Gogo n ta gura kuwa̱.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 14:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="1SA 14:44" />A̱vu Shawulu damma Jonata, &lt;&lt;Lyawa A̱sula̱ a ca a̱mu a̱tsuma̱lima̱ lon, na̱ o una wu shi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 14:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="1SA 14:45" />Reve ama a damma Shawulu, &lt;&lt;Cine Jonata a̱a̱ kuwa̱, za na yuwain a̱ba̱jini o ulinga wi iwawi a̱tsuma̱ a Isra'ila? A̱sulazuva a para! Tsu kucuna ta̱ na̱ a̱ A̱sulazuva a na a̱ ri wuma, babu ko a̱nji a aaci a̱ yi za ta̱ na a̱ riya̱ e iɗa, adama a na u yuwan ta̱ ili i nda ana'an ni ikambi ya̱ A̱sula̱.&gt;&gt; Ne ɗa ama'a a papai Jonata, agba o una yi shi.<verse eid="1SA 14:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="1SA 14:46" />Ɗaɗa Shawulu lyawai magbagba ma aza a Filistiya, a̱vu aza a Filistiya a̱ ka̱mba̱ a̱ tyo e iɗa i le.<verse eid="1SA 14:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="1SA 14:47" />Ana Shawulu tarai tsugono ekere aza a Isra'ila u yuwan ta̱ uvon na̱ n'yuwatan n le uba̱ta̱ suru: A̱za̱ a̱ Mowa, na aza a Amon na̱ a̱za̱ a̱ Edom, na̱ ngono n Zoba na aza a Filistiya. Uba̱ta̱ u na u yuwain uvon suru u tsu lyuwa ta̱ aci. <verse eid="1SA 14:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="1SA 14:48" />U yuwan ta̱ uvon nu ukadu lon, reve u lyuwa aza a Amaleka nu uvon. Waru u wawa ta̱ aza a Isra'ila e ekere a aza a na a̱ pura̱ nle itana.<verse eid="1SA 14:48" /></para>
  <para style="s">U'wa wa Shawulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="1SA 14:49" />Olobo a Shawulu ele ɗa Jonata, na̱ Ishvi na̱ Malkishuwa. Waru e esheli e re a̱ yi ele ɗa, Mera zakpara, Mikal zawa'a. <verse eid="1SA 14:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="1SA 14:50" />Ala a ka va̱ yi ɗa Ahinowam usheli wa Ahima'az. Ala a yali ya̱ a̱soja a̱ yi a̱yi ɗa Abna ulobo wa Ner, waru Ner dada ke'en va Shawulu ɗa. <verse eid="1SA 14:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="1SA 14:51" />Kish ɗa dada va Shawulu, waru Ner dada va Abna, Kish na̱ Ner olobo a Abiyel a ɗa.<verse eid="1SA 14:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="1SA 14:52" />A̱tsuma̱ a wuma wa Shawulu suru, u yuwan ta̱ uvon wu usuɗuwu na aza a Filistiya. Na̱ we ene za vu ucira ko zana ri na̱ ukadu lon, reve wo o'woto yi soja va̱ yi.<verse eid="1SA 14:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="1SA 15" />
  <para style="s">A̱sulazuva a 'yuwan ta̱ Shawulu waru na̱ tsugono</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 15:1" />Sama'ila damma ta̱ Shawulu, &lt;&lt;A̱mu ɗa A̱sulazuva a̱ lyungu yi a na ma̱ tsuwa̱n wu mani'in vo o mogono ekere ama a̱yi a aza a Isra'ila.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ka̱lyuwa̱: 1 Sam 10:1.</char></note> Gogo vu polo atsuvu vu uwwa ikaka i na yu uta̱i uba̱ta̱ wa̱ A̱sulazuva. <verse eid="1SA 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 15:2" />Apa ili na A̱sulazuva o oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a zuva a dammai: &lt;N ta tawa aza a Amaleka adama e ili i na a yuwayin aza a Isra'ila, ana a̱ riya̱a̱ n le nu uvon a mantsa ma na o uta̱i e iɗa ya Masar.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ka̱lyuwa̱: Mta̱ 17:8-14; U.Wl 25:17-19.</char></note> <verse eid="1SA 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 15:3" />Gogo i ka̱ra̱ a̱ ꞌya̱wa̱ i riya̱a̱ aza a Amaleka, a̱vu i kototo ili i na a̱ ri na̱ a̱yi suru suru. Ko ili i ta̱ she i lyawa wuma wan. Yu una ali na̱ a̱ma̱ci na̱ muwun, na̱ nreɓu ni inan ni ikyon na arakumi, na̱ nloli.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 15:4" />Avu Shawulu ɗe ama a na u ɓolotoi ɗe Telem, a̱soja a ana a na a̱ da̱na̱i a ana ukpakukupa ukpakure (200,000), nu ukpakukupa kupa (10,000) diga Yahuza. <verse eid="1SA 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 15:5" />Reve Shawulu 'ya̱wa̱ a̱ lyuci va Amaleka a̱vu u vawan a̱ a̱tsuma̱ o uka̱ri. <verse eid="1SA 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 15:6" />Reve u damma aza a Kena, &lt;&lt;Walai, i jika̱ yu uta̱ i lyawa aza a Amaleka ta̱wa̱ n kototo ɗu oɓolo ne ele wan, adama a na i roco ta̱ aza a Isra'ila suru isa'ani ya amayun a mantsa ma na a gawain o uta̱ diga Masar.&gt;&gt; Ɗaɗa aza a Kena o uta̱i diga a̱tsuma̱ a aza a Amaleka.<verse eid="1SA 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 15:7" />A̱vu Shawulu lyuwa aza a Amaleka nu uvon, diga Havila a̱ tyo Shur za na a̱ ri asana a Masar. <verse eid="1SA 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 15:8" />Reve u reme Aga mogono ma Amaleka wuma wa̱ yi, reve gba u kototo ama a̱ yi suru suru na̱ matsun me pe'eni. <verse eid="1SA 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 15:9" />Amma a̱yi na ama a̱ yi a lyawa ta̱ Aga wuma, na̱ mgbele ni inan na̱ mudindim na̱ mukyokyon, i na suru i la'ai ulobonu. Ele nda suru a ciga o kototo le suru suru shi. Amma ili i na suru a tarai ili ya̱ a̱ɓula̱ shi ko babu ucira ele ɗa o kototoi suru suru.<verse eid="1SA 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 15:10" />A̱vu A̱sulazuva a yuwan adanshi na̱ Sama'ila ana, <verse eid="1SA 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 15:11" />&lt;&lt;N yuwan ta̱ a̱tsumola̱ngu a na n ɗangwai Shawulu wo o'wo mogono, adama a na u vadalaa mu ta̱ ucina̱, waru u 'yuwan ta̱ a na wa yuwan tsutoni na̱ udammu u na n ca niyi.&gt;&gt; Sama'ila yuwan ta̱ upan, reve u showen A̱sulazuva ayin ma̱ɓula̱.<verse eid="1SA 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 15:12" />Na̱ wasasa, reve u 'ya̱wa̱ uba̱ta̱ wa Shawulu. Reve a damma yi, &lt;&lt;Shawulu 'ya̱wa̱ ta̱ a̱ lyuci va Kame, reve u shuwa̱ aciya̱yi aatsura a na a̱ ri n cuwusan na̱ a̱yi ɗe. Reve u vadala u ka̱ra̱ a̱ cipa̱ a̱ tyo Gilga.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 15:13" />Ana Sama'ila cina niyi, reve Shawulu damma, &lt;&lt;Lyawa A̱sulazuva a zuwaa wu abaꞌun! N yuwan ta̱ tsutoni nu udammu wa̱ A̱sulazuva!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 15:14" />A̱vu Sama'ila ece yi, &lt;&lt;N na amayun ɗa wu, ili i ne i ɗa maa uwwusa tsa mesun me mgbele oɓolo ni inan?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 15:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 15:15" />A̱vu u usu, &lt;&lt;Ama a̱ ta̱wa̱ ta̱ ne ele diga uba̱ta̱ wa aza a Amaleka, a lyawa ta̱ mgbele ni inan i na i la'ai ulobonu wuma adama a yuwaan A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ wu kucci. Amma tsu kototo ta̱ suru suru akapi e ili i na i buwai.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 15:16" />A̱vu Sama'ila damma Shawulu, &lt;&lt;Isawan! N ta damma wu ili i na A̱sulazuva a dammai na ayin o yon.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 15:16">Reve Shawulu usu, &lt;&lt;Damma mu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 15:17" />Reve Sama'ila usu yi, &lt;&lt;Ko na wo o'woi ɗe a̱ca̱pa̱ vu shi tara aciya̱wu ili i ro shi, a̱vu ɗa zagbain vu gundo va a aza a Isra'ila gogo shi? Waru A̱sulazuva a̱ tsuwa̱n wu ta̱ mani'in vo oꞌwo mogono ma aza a Israꞌila. <verse eid="1SA 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 15:18" />Waru u lyungu wu ta̱ adansa, &lt;'Ya̱wa̱ vu kototo ama a avama o ndolo suru suru, aza a Amaleka. Vu yuwan uvon ne ele hali she na̱ vu kototo le.&gt; <verse eid="1SA 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 15:19" />Adama a̱ nye i ꞌyuwain a na ya yuwan tsutoni na̱ A̱sulazuva? Adama a̱ nye i ga̱da̱ra̱i azaza e itana yu uvon i na i pura̱i? Nye i zuwai i yuwain ili i wuya a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ A̱sulazuva?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 15:20" />A̱vu Shawulu usu u damma Sama'ila, &lt;&lt;Amma n yuwan ta̱ tsutoni na̱ A̱sulazuva. Adama a na n ka̱ra̱ ta̱ n 'ya̱wa̱ yuwan ulinga u na u lyungu numu n yuwan. N ta̱wa̱ ta̱ na̱ Aga mogono ma aza a Amaleka, reve waru n kototo akapi a aza a Amaleka suru suru. <verse eid="1SA 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 15:21" />Ama a tara ta̱ mgbele ni inan i na i la'ai ulobonu i na a̱ pura̱i uba̱ta̱ wu uvon na a tawai adama o ukototosu, adama a yuwaan A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ wu kucci ne ele a̱tsuma̱ a Gilga.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 15:22" />Reve Sama'ila usu u damma,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 15:22">&lt;&lt;Nye i la'a yo'onotoi A̱sulazuva okolo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 15:22">kucci vu ukula̱tosu na̱ kucci,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 15:22">ko tsutoni ni ili i na u dammai?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 15:22">A yuwaan yi tsutoni u la'a ta̱ kucci,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 15:22">waru o polo atsuvu u la'a ta̱ abaji a mani'in ma̱ a̱giri'i.<verse eid="1SA 15:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 15:23" />Aciyogbamu u ta̱ va damma unusu u yindi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 15:23">Ulambu u ma uwwa ma adanshi u ta̱ va damma iwuya ya̱ a̱ga̱nda̱ a̱ tyo a̱ a̱ma̱li.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 15:23">Adama a na vu 'yuwain a yuwaan tsutoni na adanshi a̱ A̱sulazuva,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 15:23">u 'yuwan wu ta̱ a na vaa lyuwa elime na̱ tsugono.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 15:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 15:24" />Reve Shawulu damma Sama'ila, &lt;&lt;N yuwan ta̱ unusu n ka̱ra̱ ta̱ uɗuma̱ ni icu'un. N yuwan tsutoni ni ili i na A̱sulazuva a zuwai n yuwan nu udammu wa̱ yi oɓolo ni ili i na vu dammai shi. N da̱na̱ ta̱ a uwwusa wovon wa ama, ɗaɗa i zuwai n yuwain tsutoni ni ili i na a dammai. <verse eid="1SA 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 15:25" />Gogo gba n te ipati ya̱ wu, vu yuwaan mu gafura vu unusu u va̱. A̱vu vu ka̱mba̱ na̱ a̱mu, adama n yuwaan A̱sulazuva a̱ga̱nda̱.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 15:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 15:26" />A̱vu Sama'ila damma Shawulu, &lt;&lt;Ma̱a̱ ka̱mba̱ na̱ a̱vu shi. A̱vu ɗa vu ꞌyuwain adanshi a̱ A̱sulazuva, ɗaɗa gba u 'yuwan nuwu a na vaa lyuwa elime na̱ tsugono tsa a ama a Isra'ila!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 15:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 15:27" />Ana Sama'ila vadalai a na wa̱a̱ ka̱ra̱, reve Shawulu reme iwa̱sa̱ ye elentsu o utugu wa̱ yi a̱vu u kara yi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:27-28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ka̱lyuwa̱: 1 Sam 28:17.</char></note> <verse eid="1SA 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 15:28" />A̱vu Sama'ila damma yi, &lt;&lt;A̱sulazuva a kara ta̱ tsugono tsa ama a Isra'ila ekere a̱ wu anaꞌan. A̱vu u ca moron ma̱ wu za na laꞌa nuwu. <verse eid="1SA 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 15:29" />A̱yi za na a̱yi ɗa Tsugbain tsa aza a Isra'ila u tsu yuwan epen shi, waru u tsu vadala okolo a̱ yi shi. Adama a na a̱yi vuma ɗa shi, na waa vadala okolo a̱yi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 15:30" />Reve Shawulu damma, &lt;&lt;N yuwan ta̱ unusu. Amma yuwan ankuri ca mu tsugbain elime a mbara ma ama a̱ va̱ ne elime aza a Isra'ila. Vu ka̱mba̱ oɓolo na̱ a̱mu adama n yuwaan A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ wu a̱ga̱nda̱.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1SA 15:31" />Reve Sama'ila ka̱mba̱ oɓolo na̱ Shawulu, a̱vu Shawulu yuwaan A̱sulazuva a̱ga̱nda̱.<verse eid="1SA 15:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1SA 15:32" />Reve Sama'ila damma, &lt;&lt;Ta̱wa̱a̱ numu na̱ Aga mogono ma aza a Amaleka pa nda.&gt;&gt; A̱vu Aga ta̱wa̱ ya̱'a̱ yi na asuvu nden a majiyan, &lt;&lt;Amayun ili i ro yi lo shi, meleshe mo ukwa̱ ma̱ ka̱ra̱ ta̱.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1SA 15:33" />Amma a̱vu Sama'ila damma, &lt;&lt;Cine matsun me pe'eni ma̱ wu ma̱ ka̱mbuwa̱i a̱ma̱ci babu muwun, ne ɗa fo mma va̱ wu o'wo babu muwun a̱ a̱tsuma̱ a̱ a̱ma̱ci.&gt;&gt; A̱vu Sama'ila yuwan Aga mukoɗi mukoɗi a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ A̱sulazuva a Gilga.<verse eid="1SA 15:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1SA 15:34" />A̱vu Sama'ila ka̱ra̱ a̱ ka̱mba̱ a̱ wa̱ta̱ wa̱ yi lyuci va Rama, amma Shawulu ka̱ra̱ ta̱ a̱ ka̱mba̱ o u'wa wa̱ yi a̱ lyuci va Gibiya. <verse eid="1SA 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1SA 15:35" />Sama'ila da̱shi ga'asan na̱ Shawulu waru shi a rana wuma wa̱ yi suru, amma Sama'ila yuwan ta̱ a̱tsumola̱ngu lon adama a Shawulu. Waru A̱sulazuva a yuwan ta̱ a̱tsumola̱ngu a na u zuwai Shawulu mogono ma aza a Isra'ila.<verse eid="1SA 15:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="1SA 16" />
  <para style="s">Sama'ila tsuwa̱n ta̱ Da̱wuda mani'in wo o'wo mogono</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 16:1" />A̱vu A̱sulazuva a damma Sama'ila, &lt;&lt;Hali mantsa ma̱ ne va̱a̱ da̱na̱ a̱tsumola̱ngu adama a Shawulu? N 'yuwain ta̱ a na wa̱a̱ da̱na̱ mogono ma aza a Isra'ila. Gogo vu shito aavana a̱ wu na̱ mani'in, reve vu reme ure a̱ tyo Batalami. Vu zami ɗe vuma n na a̱ tsu ɗe Yese, n ɗangula ta̱ vuma ta̱ a̱tsuma̱ a̱ olobo a̱yi za na oo o'wo mogono.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 16:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 16:2" />Amma a̱vu Sama'ila damma, &lt;&lt;Adama a̱ nye maa yuwan ne? Shawulu ta uwwa alabari, reve wu una mu.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 16:2">Reve A̱sulazuva a̱ usu yi, &lt;&lt;Vu tara a̱na̱wun a manan a̱ 'ya̱wa̱, reve vu damma, &lt;N ta̱wa̱ ta̱ tsa̱ra̱ n ca A̱sulazuva kucci.&gt; <verse eid="1SA 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 16:3" />A̱vu vu banu Yese uba̱ta̱ u na vaa yuwan kucci. Waru n ta lyawa wu vu reve ili i na vaa yuwan. Vu ta̱ tsuwa̱a̱n mu ulobo u na waru n damma nu wu mani'in.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 16:4" />A̱vu Sama'ila yuwan cine A̱sulazuva a damma niyi u yuwan. Ana u rawai Batalami, a̱vu mbara n lyuci n ga'an toyi na̱ meje'en ma̱ lipu adama o wovon.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 16:4">Reve e ece yi a damma, &lt;&lt;Lafiya ɗa ta̱wa̱to nuwu pa ko?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 16:5" />Reve Sama'ila usu, &lt;&lt;Ee, lafiya ɗa uta̱wu u va̱. N ta̱wa̱ ta̱ tsa̱ra̱ n yuwaan A̱sulazuva kucci. I tawa aciya̱ɗu yo o'wo na akiza, reve i ta̱wa̱ uba̱ta̱ u kucci'i oɓolo na̱ a̱mu.&gt;&gt; A̱vu u zuwa Yese no olobo a̱ yi a tawa aciyele na akiza. A̱vu u banu le fo a̱ tyo uba̱ta̱ u na a yuwan kucci.<verse eid="1SA 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 16:6" />Ana a rawai, ana Sama'ila enei Eliyabu ulobo wa Yese, a̱vu u jiyan, &lt;&lt;Adanshi o ro o lo shi, vuma na ri nda mishin a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ A̱sulazuva a̱yi ɗa u tsuwa̱a̱n yi mani'in.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 16:7" />Amma gba A̱sulazuva a damma yi ta̱, &lt;&lt;Sama'ila, she vi indana uruma wa̱ yi, ko uga'an wa̱ yi wan, adama a na n 'yuwan yi ta̱. Waru a̱mu A̱sulazuva n tsu indana ili i na vuma tsi indana shi. Vuma tsu ka̱lyuwa̱ ta̱ uruma u vuma goon, amma a̱mu n tsu ka̱lyuwa̱ ta̱ okolo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 16:8" />Reve Yese ɗe Abinada ulobo wa̱ yi, a̱vu u zuwa yi u ka̱ra̱la̱i elime a Sama'ila. Amma a̱vu Sama'ila damma, &lt;&lt;A̱sulazuva a ɗangwa yi fo shi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 16:9" />A̱vu Yese zuwa Shama ka̱ra̱la̱i. Reve Sama'ila damma, &lt;&lt;A̱sulazuva a ɗangula a̱yi nda fo shi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 16:10" />Yese zuwa ta̱ olobo e cindere a̱tsuma̱ olobo a̱ yi a̱ ka̱ra̱la̱i a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma Sama'ila. Amma Sama'ila damma yi ta̱, &lt;&lt;A̱sulazuva a ɗangula aza a nda shi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 16:11" />Reve Sama'ila ece yi, &lt;&lt;Vu buwa na̱ olobo o ro shi?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 16:11">A̱vu Yese usu, &lt;&lt;Mokosoto ma ɗa ma buwai, agba u ta̱ ɗe a aguɓa e mgbele.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 16:11">Ɗaɗa Sama'ila dammai, &lt;&lt;Lyungu e ɗe yi u ta̱wa̱, adama a na tse ene nden n na tsa̱ da̱nu tsu lyuwa shi she nu u ta̱wa̱.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 16:12" />A̱vu Yese lyungu a̱ 'ya̱wa̱ a̱ ta̱wa̱a̱ na̱ a̱yi. U da̱na̱ ta̱ nu uruma u sa'ani, na̱ gbaga lipu, waru muwun me e esu ma̱ yi n ta̱ ulobonu wa̱ a̱ka̱nla̱.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 16:12">Ɗaɗa A̱sulazuva a dammai, &lt;&lt;Vuma ɗaɗa nda'a! 'Yon vu tsuwa̱n yi mani'in a aaci.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 16:13" />Ɗaɗa Sama'ila tarai aavana a mani'in a̱vu u tsuwa̱n Da̱wuda a aaci e esu a azakpakpara a̱ yi. Diga o urana u ndolo a̱ 'ya̱wa̱, reve Ruhu va̱ A̱sulazuva a̱ cipa̱a̱ Da̱wuda nu ucira. Reve Sama'ila ka̱ra̱ a̱ ka̱mba̱ o u'wa a Rama.<verse eid="1SA 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Da̱wuda yuwaan ta̱ Shawulu a̱ga̱nda̱</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 16:14" />Gogo Ruhu va̱ A̱sulazuva lyawa ta̱ Shawulu, a̱vu ruhu vama diga uba̱ta̱ wa̱ A̱sulazuva u casu yi a̱tsuma̱lima̱ na̱ wovon lon. <verse eid="1SA 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 16:15" />Reve agbashi a Shawulu a damma yi, &lt;&lt;A̱yi ɗa nda ruhu vama diga uba̱ta̱ wa̱ A̱sula̱ u ta casu wu a̱tsuma̱lima̱ na̱ wovon lon. <verse eid="1SA 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 16:16" />Lyawa zagbain tsu zuwa agbashi a̱ yi a̱ 'ya̱wa̱ a zami vuma na gurai tsuwe'e tsa kumburu. U ta̱ wa'a a mantsa ma na ruhu vama diga uba̱ta̱ wa̱ A̱sula̱ cipa̱a̱ nuwu, reve gba u ugbozu wa̱ wu u von.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 16:17" />Reve Shawulu damma agbashi a̱ yi, &lt;&lt;'Ya̱wa̱i i zami za na gurai tsuwe'e i ta̱wa̱a̱ mu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 16:18" />A̱vu za ta̱ a̱tsuma̱ a agbashi'i u damma, &lt;&lt;N reve ta̱ ulobo wa̱ Yese va Batalami za na revei cine a tsu waꞌa kumburu. Vuma ɗa na ri nu ukadu lon, za na gurai uvon, u tsu yuwan ta̱ adanshi nu ugbozu, waru u ta̱ ulobonu lon, A̱sulazuva o to oɓolo na̱ a̱yi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 16:19" />Reve Shawulu lyungu nlingata a̱ 'ya̱wa̱ ya̱ Yese, a̱vu a damma, &lt;&lt;Vu lyunguwa̱ mu nu ulobo wa̱ wu Da̱wuda, za na aa guɓusaa wu mgbele.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 16:20" />Ɗaɗa Yese tarai mololi utanuwu no opopofu, na̱ tsa̱n vu ukwan masayan ma̱ ina̱bi na̱ megbgbele, a̱vu u lyungu le oɓolo nu ulobo wa̱ yi Da̱wuda a̱ tyo ya Shawulu.<verse eid="1SA 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 16:21" />Reve Da̱wuda ta̱wa̱ uba̱ta̱ wa Shawulu reve u teme a yuwusaan yi a̱ga̱nda̱. Shawulu ciga yi ta̱ lon, a̱vu u zuwai za na a̱a̱ da̱na̱ a̱ guzusa̱a̱ yi itana yu uvon. <verse eid="1SA 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 16:22" />Reve Shawulu lyunguwa̱ Yese na adanshi, adansa, &lt;&lt;Lyawa Da̱wuda da̱nu u lyuwa elime u yuwusan mu a̱ a̱ga̱nda̱, adama a na u tsura̱ ta̱ isa'ani e ekere a̱ va̱.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 16:23" />Ne ɗa na̱ ruhu vama diga uba̱ta̱ wa̱ A̱sula̱ cipa̱a̱ Shawulu biti, Da̱wuda tsu tara ta̱ kumburu va̱ yi reve u reme tsuwe'e. A̱vu ruhu vama'a u lyawai, reve ugbozu wa Shawulu u von.<verse eid="1SA 16:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="1SA 17" />
  <para style="s">Goliya yuwaan ta̱ aza a Isra'ila ulamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 17:1" />A̱soja a Filistiya o foɓo ta̱ adama o uvon, a̱vu o ɓoloto a̱ lyuci va Soko a̱tsuma̱ e iɗa ya Yahuda. A̱ shuwa̱ ta̱ uva̱la̱ta̱ a Efes Damim, e memere mo Soko na̱ Azeka. <verse eid="1SA 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 17:2" />A̱vu Shawulu na̱ ali o uvon a Isra'ila oɓoloto a̱ va̱la̱ o uka̱ri wa Ela, reve e gere adama a na aa yuwan uvon na̱ a̱soja a aza a Filistiya. <verse eid="1SA 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 17:3" />Aza a Filistiya a̱ da̱na̱ ta̱ a masasan ma̱ ta̱ ugeru, aza a Isra'ila waru a za ire, nu uka̱ri e memere me ele.<verse eid="1SA 17:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 17:4" />A yuwan ta̱ vuma ro na la'a gurai uvon na a̱ tsu ɗe Goliya, diga a̱ lyuci va Gat, wu uta̱ ta̱ o uva̱la̱ta̱ wa aza a Filistiya. Uga'an wa̱ yi u la'a ta̱ ana kucci. <verse eid="1SA 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 17:5" />U da̱na̱ ta̱ na̱ melezu mo uvon ma̱ rumushili a aaci a̱ yi reve waru wo oto utugu wu uɗavu wu rumushili wu uvon a na ume wa̱ yi u dembe ta̱ ume u kilo kupoton na̱ a̱za̱ cindere. <verse eid="1SA 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 17:6" />Reve wo oto waru a̱a̱ra̱ga̱ a̱ rumushili a ana a̱ yi a na a tsu pala ana, reve u wo'o mabata ma̱ rumushili o ucina̱ wa̱ yi. <verse eid="1SA 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 17:7" />Ugba̱mu wi ibata ya̱ yi u ta̱ tsu ushin, waru ume wa aaci a̱ rumu wi ibata'a u rawa ta̱ uritowu kilo cindere wu rumu. Soja da̱na̱ ta̱ elime a̱ yi uguzu na̱ a̱a̱ra̱ga̱ a̱ yi.<verse eid="1SA 17:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 17:8" />A̱vu Goliya isawan mishin, reve wo oruwoo ali o uvon o ugeru a Isra'ila, &lt;&lt;Nye i ɗa i zuwai i ta̱wa̱i, reve i gere tsa̱ra̱ i yuwan uvon na̱ a̱tsu? A̱mu za va Filistiya ɗa shi, waru a̱ɗu agbashi a Shawulu a ɗa shi? Ɗangulai vuma ta̱ a̱tsuma̱ a̱ ɗu adama u cipa̱ u yuwan nla̱ngi na̱ mu! <verse eid="1SA 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 17:9" />Nu u gura yuwan nla̱ngi na̱ mu reve wu una mu, tsu to o'wo agbashi a̱ ɗu, agba na̱ n la'a yi ucira reve mu una yi, i to o'wo agbashi a̱ tsu a̱vu i yuwaan tsu tsugbashi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 17:10" />Reve za va Filistiya'a u damma, &lt;&lt;Ana'an n ta yuwusan oɓolo ali o uvon a Isra'ila ulamu! Ɗangulaa numu vuma ta̱ tsu yuwan nla̱ngi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 17:11" />Ana Shawulu na aza a Isra'ila suru a uwwai ili i na za va Filistiya dammai, reve a kuɗa okolo a uwwa wovon lon.<verse eid="1SA 17:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yese lyungu ta̱ Da̱wuda o uva̱la̱ta̱ wa Shawulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 17:12" />Da̱wuda gba ulobo wa̱ Yese ɗa, vuma va Efarata, diga a̱ lyuci va̱ Batalami a̱tsuma̱ a Yahuda. Yese da̱na̱ ta̱ no olobo kunla̱. Waru a mantsa ma na Shawulu da̱na̱i o tsugono, Yese kutsa ta̱ ɗe, waru u da̱na̱ ta̱ na a'wan lon. <verse eid="1SA 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 17:13" />Olobo a ta'atsu a kpakpara a̱ Yese, ele ɗa Eliyabu na̱ Abinada na̱ Shama, a̱ shi ta̱ oɓolo ukere na̱ ali o uvon a Shawulu adama a yuwan uvon na aza a Filistiya. <verse eid="1SA 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 17:14" />Da̱wuda ɗa le mokosoto. Azakpakpara a ta'atsu'u a̱da̱na̱ ta̱ oɓolo na ali o uvon a Shawulu. <verse eid="1SA 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 17:15" />Amma Da̱wuda 'ya̱wusa̱ ta̱ nu u ka̱mbi uba̱ta̱ wa Shawulu adama u guɓusa mgbele ma dada va̱ yi a Batalami.<verse eid="1SA 17:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 17:16" />A̱vu Goliya za va Filistiya ka̱ra̱ o uta̱ wi isawan o ronuso una̱ wa ali o uvon a Isra'ila usana nu ulivu suru hali rana amunga.<verse eid="1SA 17:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 17:17" />Urana u ro reve Yese damma ulobo wa̱ yi Da̱wuda, &lt;&lt;Taraa azakpakpara a̱ wu makundatsu kupa ne ejere vi ishina yu uzuwun i nda na akpatali kupa o opopofu, vu jika̱, vu 'ya̱wa̱a̱ le o uva̱la̱ta̱. <verse eid="1SA 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 17:18" />Waru vu taraa yali ya̱ a̱soja e le wara vi inan kupa. Vu reve cine a̱za̱ a̱ wu a̱ ri a̱vu vu ta̱wa̱a̱ mu ni ili i ro i na yoo roco cine a̱ ri ɗe.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 17:19" />Azakpakpara a̱ Da̱wuda a̱da̱na̱ ta̱ ɗe oɓolo na̱ Shawulu na ali o uvon a Isra'ila suru o uka̱ri wa Ela a yuwusan uvon na aza a Filistiya.<verse eid="1SA 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 17:20" />Na̱ wasasa a̱vu Da̱wuda lyawa oɓolo e mgbele ekere a za va aguɓa o ro, reve u tara itana u ka̱ra̱ cine dada va̱ yi Yese damma niyi. U rawa ta̱ o uva̱la̱ta̱'a̱ a mantsa ma na ali o uvon a Isra'ila a̱ ri a̱ mota̱a̱ a̱ 'ya̱wa̱ e gere, a yisali yu uvon. <verse eid="1SA 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 17:21" />Aza a Isra'ila na aza a Filistiya e isawan ta̱ ugeru adama o uvon, waru a̱da̱na̱ ta̱ a̱ nka̱la̱la̱i. <verse eid="1SA 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 17:22" />A̱vu Da̱wuda lyawa itana'a e ekere a soja na aa ka̱lyuwusa̱ itana, reve u suma a̱ tyo uba̱ta̱ u na e gerei adama o uvon tsa̱ra̱ u ca̱sa̱ azakpakpara a̱ yi. <verse eid="1SA 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 17:23" />A̱yi a̱tsuma̱ a adanshi ne ele, reve Goliya za na la'a gurai uvon va aza a Filistiya'a vuma va Gat, u ka̱ra̱ uta̱ diga o uva̱la̱ta̱ wa aza a Filistiya a̱vu u yuwan adanshi tsu ufaru. Da̱wuda gba a uwusai.<verse eid="1SA 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 17:24" />Ana ali o uvon a Isra'ila enei Goliya, a̱vu a sumaa yi adama o wovon lon. <verse eid="1SA 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 17:25" />Aza a Isra'ila a̱ shi ta̱ a dansa va̱ni le, &lt;&lt;Ye ene ta̱ cine vuma nda o utusa̱? Suru urana u ta̱ utusa̱ adama u yuwan aza a Isra'ila ulamu. Mogono ma damma ta̱ u ta ca vuma na suru unai vuma nda utsuru wa̱ a̱bunda̱. Waru u ta ca yi usheli wa̱ yi lolo, waru u'wa wa dada va̱ yi wa tsupa utafa a̱tsuma̱ a Isra'ila shi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 17:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 17:26" />Ɗaɗa Da̱wuda ecei ali o uvon a na a̱ da̱na̱i mishin zuzu na̱ a̱yi, &lt;&lt;Nye i ɗa aa yuwaan vuma na unai vuma va Filistiya nda, nu u tawa wono u nda uba̱ta̱ wa aza a Isra'ila? Zane ɗa za babu upaɗu wu uryumbu va Filistiya nda, na waa yuwusaan ali o uvon A̱sula̱ a wuma ulamu?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 17:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 17:27" />Reve a̱ ka̱mbuwa̱ yi ili i na a̱ ri a dansa va̱ni le, a damma yi, &lt;&lt;Ne ɗa aa yuwaan vuma na una niyi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 17:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 17:28" />Ana Eliyabu zakpara nan Da̱wuda suru suru uwwa niyi a adanshi na ama'a, reve u yuwan upan na̱ a̱yi lon, a̱vu we ece, &lt;&lt;Adama a̱ nye vu ta̱wa̱i pa? Waru zane vu lyawayi mgbele n wa'a i ndolo a̱tsumona? N reve ta̱ cine vu ri nu uvaɗu na akpaka, vu ta̱wa̱ ta̱ adama vu ka̱lyuwa̱ uvon.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 17:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 17:29" />A̱vu Da̱wuda damma, &lt;&lt;To, nye n yuwain? Yeci ɗa goon ma yuwusan!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 17:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 17:30" />Ɗaɗa u lyawa niyi reve u vadala ya nanza, a̱vu u yuwisan yi cu'un yeci'i, a̱vu u usu yi tsu ufaru. Suru ali o uvo'on za na we ecei biti, a̱vu usu yi tsu ufaru. <verse eid="1SA 17:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1SA 17:31" />Ali o uvon o ro a uwwa ta̱ ili i na Da̱wuda dammai, reve a damma Shawulu, a̱vu u zuwa e ɗe yi.<verse eid="1SA 17:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Da̱wuda una ta̱ Goliya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1SA 17:32" />A̱vu Da̱wuda damma Shawulu, &lt;&lt;She nanza dada'wan adama a vuma va Filistiya nda wan. Aagbashi a̱ wu a̱ ta̱ 'ya̱wa̱ u yuwan nla̱ngi na̱ a̱yi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 17:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1SA 17:33" />Reve Shawulu usu Da̱wuda, &lt;&lt;Vaa gura yuwan uvon na̱ za va Filistiya nda hali vu lyuwa aciya̱yi shi! A̱vu ulobo u ɗa vu buwai. Agba Goliya gura ta̱ uvon a̱yi o ulobo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 17:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1SA 17:34" />Amma Da̱wuda damma ta̱ Shawulu, &lt;&lt;N ta guɓusaa dada va̱ mgbele. A mantsa ma na kamu ko a̱ba̱jini a nama vu una na a̱ tsu ɗe biya remei kyon diga o oɓolo, <verse eid="1SA 17:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1SA 17:35" />n tsu saɓa yi ta̱ n faba yi, reve n wawa kyon va̱ diga o una̱ wa̱ yi. Waru nna̱ kamu'u ko biya'a u piri, n tsu gbagbala ta̱ eleme a̱ yinlu yi, reve n faba yi e iɗa mu una yi. <verse eid="1SA 17:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1SA 17:36" />Aagbashi a̱ wu o una ta̱ ikamu na̱ nan biya. Vuma babu upaɗu wu uryumbu nda fo u ta̱ o'wo tsa za ta̱ le, adama a na u yuwaan ta̱ ali o uvon A̱sula̱ a wuma ulamu. <verse eid="1SA 17:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1SA 17:37" />A̱sulazuva a na wawa numu diga a̱ a̱kpa̱ta̱ e ikamu na̱ nan biya, a̱yi ɗa waru waa wawa mu e ekere a vuma va Filistiya nda.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 17:37">A̱vu Shawulu damma Da̱wuda, &lt;&lt;Wala, lyawa A̱sulazuva a̱ da̱na̱ oɓolo na̱ a̱vu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 17:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="1SA 17:38" />Reve Shawulu oto yi itana yu uvon ya̱ yi. A̱vu wo oto yi melezu mo uvon ma̱ rumushili a aaci, reve wo oto yi utugu wu uɗavu wu rumushili. <verse eid="1SA 17:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1SA 17:39" />A̱vu Da̱wuda nla̱ matsun me pe'eni o utugu'u, a̱vu u rito dasu adama a na koto u yuwan ulinga ne ele shi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 17:39">A̱vu u damma Shawulu, &lt;&lt;Maa gura dasu na̱ nda shi, adama a na koto n yuwan ulinga ne ele shi.&gt;&gt; Reve wu foɗo itana yu uvo'on. <verse eid="1SA 17:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1SA 17:40" />A̱vu u tara aaɗanga a aguɓa a̱ yi, reve wu ta̱ɗa̱ mugbodolu ma atali n ton a̱tsuma̱ o moɗolu, a̱vu u zuwa le a̱ tsa̱n va aguɓa va̱ yi oɓolo na̱ a̱bitsutsu a̱ yi ufoɓu o ukere, reve u ka̱ra̱ o uta̱ u ga'an na̱ Goliya.<verse eid="1SA 17:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1SA 17:41" />A mantsa'a fo za va Filistiya'a u zurusa̱ ta̱ Da̱wuda. Vuma na ri uguzu na̱ a̱a̱ra̱ga̱ a̱ yi u da̱na̱ ta̱ elime a̱ yi. <verse eid="1SA 17:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1SA 17:42" />Ana za va Filistiya ndolo petelyuwei Da̱wuda ulobonu, reve we ene ulobo u ɗa nu uruma u sa'ani, na̱ gbaga lipu, reve u goro yi. <verse eid="1SA 17:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1SA 17:43" />A̱vu Goliya ece yi, &lt;&lt;Vu ta a majiyan a̱mu musa̱n ma ɗa? A̱yi ɗa i zuwai vu ta̱wa̱i ya̱'a̱ va̱ na aaɗanga?&gt;&gt; Reve wi isululai Da̱wuda na aala a̱ musula̱ ma a aza a Filistiya. <verse eid="1SA 17:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1SA 17:44" />Ɗaɗa za va Filistiya'a wa saala Da̱wuda, &lt;&lt;Ta̱wa̱ pa nda, n ta ca asala ni inama yu una inama ya̱ wu!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 17:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="1SA 17:45" />A̱vu Da̱wuda damma yi, &lt;&lt;Vu ta̱wa̱ ta̱ tsa̱ra̱ vu yuwan nla̱ngi na̱ a̱mu na̱ matsun me pe'eni oɓolo ni ibata na̱ mabata. A̱mu gba shi, n ta̱wa̱ ta̱ n yuwan nla̱ngi na̱ a̱vu a̱tsuma̱ a ala a̱ A̱sulazuva o oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a zuva. A̱yi ɗa A̱sula̱ a̱ a̱soja a Isra'ila, za na vu yuwan yi ulamu. <verse eid="1SA 17:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1SA 17:46" />Ana'an A̱sulazuva a ta ca mu a̱vu e ekere a̱ va̱. N ta o una wu, waru n to koɗo aaci a̱ wu. Ana'an n ta ca asala ni inama yu una a̱kwa̱kwa̱ ali o uvon a Filistiya, reve uvaɗi ma̱ɓula̱ u reve a na A̱sula̱ a̱ ta̱ a̱tsuma̱ a Isra'ila na amayun! <verse eid="1SA 17:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1SA 17:47" />Aza a na a̱ ri uɓolotowu pa suru e te reve a na na̱ matsun me pe'eni ma ɗa ko ni ibata i ɗa A̱sulazuva a tsu wawa shi, adama a na uvon za va̱ A̱sulazuva a ɗa, waru u ta ca suru nɗu e ekere a̱ tsu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 17:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="1SA 17:48" />Ana Goliya da̱shi zura̱ niyi zuzu, a̱vu Da̱wuda zarana a rawa uba̱ta̱ u na a̱soja a Filistiya a̱ ri yu ugeru adama u ga'asan na̱ yi. <verse eid="1SA 17:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="1SA 17:49" />A̱vu Da̱wuda tara aatali a̱ ta̱ a̱tsuma̱ a̱ tsa̱n va̱ yi, reve u zuwa yi a̱ a̱bitsutsu a̱ yi a̱vu u vuta̱la̱ yi. Reve aatali'i a vara Goliya a̱ cin, reve u ka̱ra̱ a uwa pe a̱ cin va̱ yi, a̱vu u riya̱ ma̱kpa̱ɓa̱.<verse eid="1SA 17:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="1SA 17:50" />Ne ɗa Da̱wuda lyuwai aci a za va Filistiya na̱ a̱bitsutsu na aatali a̱ ta̱, a na u vara niyi u riya̱i. Waru u da̱na̱ na̱ matsun me pe'eni o ukere wa̱ yi shi. <verse eid="1SA 17:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="1SA 17:51" />A̱vu Da̱wuda suma u rawa uba̱ta̱ wa̱ yi. Reve u tala matsun me pe'eni ma Goliya a̱tsuma̱ e ibici ya̱ yi, reve wu unai u koɗo aaci a̱ yi na̱ matsun me pe'eni'i.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 17:51">Ana aza a Filistiya e enei za vu uvon vu ucira le kuwa̱ ta̱, reve a vadala a suma. <verse eid="1SA 17:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="1SA 17:52" />Reve ali o uvon a Isra'ila na aza a Yahuda a̱ 'yon na̱ yorori reve a gbagba aza a Filistiya a̱ tyo o una̱ntsu wa Gat nu una̱ntsu wa Ekuron. Aza a Filistiya a na amatoyin na̱ a̱kwa̱kwa̱ e le ocusho ta̱ o ure diga Sha'arayim hali a̱ tyo Gat na̱ Ekuron. <verse eid="1SA 17:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1SA 17:53" />Ana ali o uvon a Isra'ila a̱ ka̱mba̱i diga uba̱ta̱ u magbagba ma aza a Filistiya, a̱vu a̱ pura̱ uva̱la̱ta̱ u le. <verse eid="1SA 17:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="1SA 17:54" />Reve Da̱wuda tara aaci a Goliya a̱vu u tyewoto yi Urishelima, a̱vu u zuwa itana yu uvon ya Goliya o oogodo a̱ yi.<verse eid="1SA 17:54" /></para>
  <para style="s">A̱ 'ya̱wa̱to ta̱ Da̱wuda ya Shawulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="1SA 17:55" />A mantsa ma na Shawulu enei Da̱wuda a̱ 'ya̱wa̱ uba̱ta̱ wa Goliya, reve we ece Abna, yali ya a̱soja, &lt;&lt;Abna, ulobo wa̱ zane u ɗa ulobo u nda'a?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 17:55">A̱vu Abna damma, &lt;&lt;N kucina ta̱ na̱ a̱vu, mogono, n reve shi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 17:55" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="1SA 17:56" />Reve mogono ma damma, &lt;&lt;E ece ko ulobo wa̱ zane ɗa ulobo u nda'a.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 17:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="1SA 17:57" />Ana Da̱wuda ka̱mba̱i diga uba̱ta̱ u mona ma Goliya, a̱vu Abna tara yi, reve u tyewoto yi a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma Shawulu a̱yi uguzu na aaci a Goliya o ukere wa̱ yi.<verse eid="1SA 17:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="1SA 17:58" />Reve Shawulu ece yi, &lt;&lt;A̱vu ulobo wa̱ zane ɗa, ulobo?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 17:58">A̱vu Da̱wuda damma, &lt;&lt;A̱mu ulobo wa aagbashi a̱ wu Yese va Batalami ɗa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 17:58" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="1SA 18" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 18:1" />Ana Da̱wuda kotoi adanshi na̱ Shawulu, a̱vu Jonata ulobo wa Shawulu uwwa okolo a̱ yi e icigi ya̱ Da̱wuda lon. A̱vu u ciga yi tsa wuma wa̱ yi. <verse eid="1SA 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 18:2" />Diga o uranu u ndolo Shawulu ɓana ta̱ Da̱wuda, waru u lyawa yi u ka̱mba̱ o u'wa wa dada va̱ yi shi. <verse eid="1SA 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 18:3" />Reve Jonata yuwan nzuwulai na̱ Da̱wuda, adama a na u ciga yi ta̱ tsa wuma wa̱ yi. <verse eid="1SA 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 18:4" />Reve Jonata foɗo utugu u na u ri na̱ a̱yi wotowu, a̱vu u ca Da̱wuda, ni itana yu uvon ya̱ yi, na̱ matsun me pe'eni ma̱ yi, nu utan nu ujin wa̱ yi, na̱ gbakala va̱ yi.<verse eid="1SA 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 18:5" />Waru Da̱wuda tsu 'ya̱wa̱ ta̱ u lyuwa aci uba̱ta̱ u na Shawulu lyungu niyi uvon biti, reve Shawulu zuwa yi yali ya̱ a̱soja o uvon a̱ yi. Waru ili'i u yo'ono ta̱ ali o uvon suru, oɓolo na̱ nan yali yu uvon a Shawulu.<verse eid="1SA 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tsushu'un tsa Shawulu a̱ tyo ya̱ Da̱wuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 18:6" />Ana ali o uvon a Isra'ila a̱ ri a̱ ma̱ ka̱mba̱ o u'wa, mantsa ma na Da̱wuda ka̱mba̱i diga uba̱ta̱ u na wu unai Goliya, a̱vu a̱ma̱ci o uta̱ e ilyuci ya Isra'ila suru, adama a ga'asan na̱ Shawulu mogono, na̱ muganga ni ikumburu a̱ ma̱za̱nga̱ e ishipa nu uje'en. <verse eid="1SA 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 18:7" />Ele o uje'en a̱vu a cana,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ka̱lyuwa̱: 1 Sam 21:11; 1 Sam 29:5.</char></note></para>
  <para style="b" vid="1SA 18:7" />
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 18:7">&lt;&lt;Shawulu una ta̱ kpaku kupa va̱ yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 18:7">waru Da̱wuda una ta̱ ukpakukupa kupa va̱ yi va̱ a̱bunda̱.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 18:8" />Reve Shawulu yuwan upan lon, a̱vu udammu u ndolo u damaton yi. A̱vu u damma, &lt;&lt;A cuwa ta̱ Da̱wuda na̱ ukpakukupa kupa va̱ a̱bunda̱ a̱mu gba shi kpaku kupa goon. Nye i ɗa i buwa niyi a na wa̱a̱ tsura̱ she tsugono goon ko?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 18:9" />Waru diga a mantsa mo ndolo a̱ ka̱ra̱ a̱vu Shawulu reme tsushu'un na̱ Da̱wuda.<verse eid="1SA 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 18:10" />O urana we ire a̱vu ruhu vama diga uba̱ta̱ wa̱ A̱sula̱ cipa̱a̱ Shawulu nu ucira, a̱vu wo o'wo a yuwusan adanshi e ikaka ya̱ A̱sula̱ a̱tsuma̱ o u'wa wa̱ yi tsa vuma vu ujaru, a mantsa mo ndolo gba Da̱wuda wa'asaa yi ta̱ kumburu, cine u tsu yuwusan. Shawulu gba da̱na̱ ta̱ ni ibata o ukere wa̱ yi. <verse eid="1SA 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 18:11" />A̱vu u sari yi, a majiyan okolo a̱yi, &lt;&lt;N ta sapalai Da̱wuda nu uɓaɓu.&gt;&gt; Amma Da̱wuda kanzu'usa ta̱ toto ure.<verse eid="1SA 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 18:12" />Shawulu uwwa ta̱ wovon wa̱ Da̱wuda adama a na A̱sulazuva o to oɓolo na̱ yi, amma A̱sulazuva a vadalaa ta̱ Shawulu ucina̱. <verse eid="1SA 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 18:13" />Ɗaɗa Shawulu tawa niyi a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ yi reve u zuwa yi yali ya̱ a̱soja ukpakukupa (1,000) adama u walaa le elime uba̱ta̱ o uvon.<verse eid="1SA 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 18:14" />A̱tsuma̱ e ili i na Da̱wuda yuwain suru u tsa̱ra̱ ta̱ ulyuwu wa aci, adama a na A̱sulazuva o to oɓolo na̱ a̱yi. <verse eid="1SA 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 18:15" />Waru ana Shawulu enei Da̱wuda ta̱ tsura̱sa̱ ulyuwu wa aci lon, a̱vu wu uwwa wovon wa̱ yi lon. <verse eid="1SA 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 18:16" />Amma aza a Isra'ila na aza a Yahuda suru a ciga ta̱ Da̱wuda, adama a na u ta̱ ronuso le aɗanga ulobonu uba̱ta̱ o uvon.<verse eid="1SA 18:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Da̱wuda zuwa ta̱ usheli wa Shawulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 18:17" />Ele lo reve Shawulu damma Da̱wuda, &lt;&lt;Apa usheli u kpara u va̱ Mera, n ta ca wu a̱yi lolo, vu yuwaan mu a̱ga̱nda̱ na̱ ukadu goon, waru vu yuwan uvon wa̱ A̱sulazuva.&gt;&gt; Adama a na Shawulu jiyan ta̱ a asuvu a̱ yi, &lt;&lt;Ma̱a̱ ya̱sa̱n ukere u va̱ ju'wa̱in shi, amma lyawa aza a Filistiya o una yi!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 18:18" />Da̱wuda damma ta̱ Shawulu, &lt;&lt;Zane ɗa n ri waru zane ɗa mmaci n va̱ ko umatsun wa dada va̱ a̱tsuma̱ a Isra'ila, hali a na mo o'wo toto mogono?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 18:19" />Amma a na mantsa ma rawai a na Shawulu a ca usheli wa̱ yi Mera lolo ekere Da̱wuda, reve u ca Adriye vuma va Mehola.<verse eid="1SA 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 18:20" />Mikal gba usheli wa Shawulu u ta̱ e icigi ya̱ Da̱wuda. Ana a dammai Shawulu aɗa a̱ yi, reve wu uwwa uyo'o lon. <verse eid="1SA 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 18:21" />Reve u jiyan o okolo a̱ yi, &lt;&lt;N ta ca yi a̱yi adama wo o'wo yi maza waru adama aza a Filistiya a̱tsura̱ o una yi.&gt;&gt; Ɗaɗa Shawulu dammai Da̱wuda we ire, &lt;&lt;Gogo vu to o'wo toto va̱.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 18:22" />A̱vu Shawulu damma agbashi a̱yi, &lt;&lt;Yuwain adanshi na̱ Da̱wuda usokowu i damma, &lt;A̱yi ɗa nda mogono ma ta uwwusa na̱ a̱vu, waru suru agbashi a̱yi a ciga wu ta̱. Gogo nye yaa putsa a̱ wu a na va̱ usu a na voo o'wo toto va̱ yi?&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 18:23" />Reve agbashi a Shawulu a̱ ka̱mbuwa̱ Da̱wuda adanshi a nda usokowu. A̱vu Da̱wuda damma, &lt;&lt;I ta majiyan ili yu uro i ɗa a na moo o'wo toto mogono? A̱mu za vu ulambu ɗa waru ili i ro ɗa shi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 18:24" />Ana agbashi a Shawulu a̱ ka̱mbuwa̱ niyi ili i na Da̱wuda dammai, <verse eid="1SA 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 18:25" />reve Shawulu damma, &lt;&lt;Dammai Da̱wuda, &lt;Mogono ma ciga atsupu e ili i tsutoto i ro shi na a̱ ka̱ra̱i kwan vu ryumbu ukpaku (100) wa aza a Filistiya shi, adama u tsupa n'yuwatan ma̱ yi.&gt; &gt;&gt; Majiyan ma Shawulu a̱yi ɗa adama Da̱wuda kuwa̱ e ekere aza a Filistiya.<verse eid="1SA 18:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 18:26" />Ana agbashi'i a dammai Da̱wuda adanshi a nda a̱vu Da̱wuda uwwa uyo'o lon a na wo o'wo toto mogono. Kafu mantsa ma atsupu e ikebe i lolo'o i rawa, <verse eid="1SA 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 18:27" />reve Da̱wuda 'yon oɓolo na̱ a̱soja a̱ yi, reve o una aza a Filistiya ukpakure (200). A̱vu Da̱wuda ta̱wa̱ na̱ kwan vu ryumbu le, a̱vu u ca mogono ele suru, adama wo o'wo toto mogono. Reve Shawulu ca yi usheli wa̱ yi Mikal lolo.<verse eid="1SA 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 18:28" />Ana Shawulu enei A̱sulazuva o to oɓolo na̱ Da̱wuda, waru usheli wa̱ yi Mikal ciga ta̱ Da̱wuda, <verse eid="1SA 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 18:29" />reve Shawulu da̱shi uwwa wovon wa̱ Da̱wuda, a̱vu wo o'wo ma'yuwatan ma̱ yi a akapi arana wuma wa̱ yi.<verse eid="1SA 18:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 18:30" />Mantsa ma na suru nan yali yu uvon a Filistiya o uta̱i adama a yuwan uvon na aza a Isra'ila, Da̱wuda tsu lyuwa ta̱ aci e le, u la'a akapi a yali yu uvon ya Shawulu, reve aala a̱ yi a̱ uta̱ lon.<verse eid="1SA 18:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="1SA 19" />
  <para style="s">Shawulu zami ta̱ ure u na wa o una Da̱wuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 19:1" />Shawulu damma ta̱ Jonata ulobo wa̱ yi na agbashi a̱ yi suru o una Da̱wuda. Agba Jonata te icigi ya̱ Da̱wuda lon. <verse eid="1SA 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 19:2" />Reve Jonata damma Da̱wuda, &lt;&lt;Dada va̱ ta zamishi ure u na wa una wu. Vu yuwan ugbozu nfa'an nu usana, vu 'ya̱wa̱ o upa'atan vi isawan ɗe. <verse eid="1SA 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 19:3" />Waru n to uta̱ mi isawan zuzu na̱ dada va̱ a atsusa uba̱ta̱ u na vu ri upa'awun. N ta̱ a yuwan adanshi na̱ dada va̱ adama a̱ wu, a̱vu n damma wu suru ili i na u dammai.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 19:4" />A̱vu Jonata yuwan adanshi adama a ɗa Da̱wuda ulobonu uba̱ta̱ wa dada va̱ yi Shawulu, a̱vu u damma yi, &lt;&lt;She mogono ma yuwan unusu uba̱ta̱ aagbashi a̱ yi Da̱wuda wan, adama a na u yuwaan wu unusu shi, waru adama a na ili i na u yuwain u ta̱wa̱a̱ wu ta̱ ni i kambi shi na̱ a̱bunda̱. <verse eid="1SA 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 19:5" />Adama a na u ca ta̱ wuma wa̱ yi, reve wu una za va a Filistiya. Waru A̱sulazuva a ca ta̱ ulyuwu wa aci wa̱ a̱bunda̱ uba̱ta̱ wa̱ aza a Isra'ila suru, waru ve ene ta̱ reve vu yuwan ma̱za̱nga̱. Nye i zuwai vaa yuwan unusu uba̱ta̱ u vuma na ri nu unusu shi? She vu una Da̱wuda babu unusu u ro wan!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 19:6" />A̱vu Shawulu uwwa adanshi a Jonata a̱vu u yuwan akucunu, &lt;&lt;N kucuna ta̱ na̱ A̱sulazuva a na a̱ ri wuma, moo una yi shi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 19:7" />A̱vu Jonata ɗe Da̱wuda reve u damma yi adanshi a nda suru. A̱vu Jonata ta̱wa̱ na̱ Da̱wuda uba̱ta̱ wa Shawulu, a̱vu u da̱nu oɓolo na̱ yi tsu ufaru.<verse eid="1SA 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 19:8" />A̱vu waru uvon u 'yowisa̱n, reve Da̱wuda uta̱ a na waa yuwan uvon na aza a Filistiya, waru u kototo le ta̱ wa'a shi, ɗaɗa a sumai a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ yi.<verse eid="1SA 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 19:9" />Uranu u ro Shawulu da̱na̱ ta̱ nden o u'wa wa̱ yi, uguzu ni ibata o ukere wa̱ yi. A̱vu ruhu vama diga uba̱ta̱ wa̱ A̱sulazuva cipa̱ yi, Da̱wuda a wa'asa yi kumburu, <verse eid="1SA 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 19:10" />reve Shawulu zami ure u na̱ waa sapalai Da̱wuda ni ibata u ɓoloi nu uɓaɓu, amma a̱vu Da̱wuda kanzu'wa, ɗaɗa ibata i sapai uɓaɓu. A̱tsuma̱ a ayin o ndolo a̱vu Da̱wuda suma adama u la'a na̱ wuma wa̱ yi.<verse eid="1SA 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mikal wawa ta̱ wuma wa̱ Da̱wuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 19:11" />Shawulu lyungu ta̱ aza a matawa mo utyo adama a yuwan ipiri yu u'wa wa Da̱wuda, adama o una yi nu usana.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ka̱lyuwa̱: Ica 59 Aciya adanshi e ishipa.</char></note> Amma Mikal ka va̱ Da̱wuda, rono yi ta̱ atsuvu, &lt;&lt;Na̱ vu suma adama a wuma wa̱ wu na ayin a nda shi, nfa'an nda a̱ to una wu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 19:12" />Ɗaɗa Mikal ta̱telyuwetyoi Da̱wuda nu usowoto wu upepu wa asula, a̱vu u suma ɗaɗa u la'ai. <verse eid="1SA 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 19:13" />Reve Mikal tara a̱a̱ma̱li reve u voton yi a̱ a̱a̱ga̱da̱, a̱vu wu pala yi nu umuna a̱vu wo oto yi eleme e megbele a aaci.<verse eid="1SA 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 19:14" />Ana Shawulu lyunguwisa̱i aza a matawa mo utyo e reme Da̱wuda, reve Mikal damma le, &lt;&lt;Wu uwwa uyo'o shi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 19:15" />Reve Shawulu da̱shi lyunguwisa̱ aza a matawa mo utyo'o a̱ ka̱mba̱ e ene Da̱wuda ne esu le, reve u damma le, &lt;&lt;Ta̱wa̱a̱ numu na̱ a̱yi a̱ a̱a̱ga̱da̱'a̱ tsura̱ mu una yi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 19:16" />Amma a na aza a matawa mo utyo'o a uwai o u'wa wa̱ Da̱wuda, reve a cina a̱a̱ma̱li a ɗa a̱a̱ga̱da̱'a̱, waru wo oto wu ne eleme e megbele a aaci.<verse eid="1SA 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 19:17" />Shawulu damma ta̱ Mikal, &lt;&lt;Nye i zuwai vu luluma̱ numu tsunda vu lyawai ma'yuwatan ma̱ va̱ ma̱ la'ai?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 19:17">A̱vu Mikal usu Shawulu, &lt;&lt;Da̱wuda damma mu ta̱ ana, na̱ n lyawai u ka̱ra̱ shi, u to una mu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 19:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 19:18" />Ana Da̱wuda sumai u la'ai, reve u tyo ya Sama'ila ɗe Rama, reve u damma yi suru ili i na Shawulu yuwaan niyi. A̱vu a̱yi na̱ Sama'ila a̱ 'ya̱wa̱ a̱ da̱nu uba̱ta̱ u na a̱tsu ɗe Nayo. <verse eid="1SA 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 19:19" />Reve udammu u ta̱wa̱ Shawulu, &lt;&lt;Da̱wuda ta̱ Nayo a̱tsuma̱ a Rama.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 19:20" />Ɗaɗa u lyunguyi aza a matawa mo utyo a̱ 'ya̱wa̱ e reme Da̱wuda. Amma a na e enei oɓolo a ama̱sula̱ a yuwusan adanshi e ikaka ya̱ A̱sula̱, oɓolo na̱ Sama'ila ɗe mishin elime e le o una̱ wu zagbain, reve Ruhu va̱ A̱sula̱ cipa̱a̱ aza a matawa mo utyo a Shawulu. Reve fo e teme adanshi e ikaka ya̱ A̱sula̱. <verse eid="1SA 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 19:21" />Ana a dammai Shawulu, a̱vu u da̱shi lyunguwisa̱ aza a matawa mo utyo o ro, a̱vu a̱ le fo e teme adanshi e ikaka ya̱ A̱sula̱. Reve Shawulu lyunguwisa̱ aza a matawa mo utyo wa ta'atsu, a̱vu e le fo a uwa adanshi e ikaka ya̱ A̱sula̱. <verse eid="1SA 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 19:22" />Ɗaɗa a̱yi na aciya̱yi u lapai a̱ tyo Rama. Ana u rawai o ooko'o a gbain a na a̱ ri Seku, reve we ece, &lt;&lt;Te ɗa Sama'ila na̱ Da̱wuda ri?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 19:22">Reve a damma yi, &lt;&lt;A̱ ta̱ ɗe Nayo a̱tsuma̱ a Rama.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 19:23" />Ɗaɗa Shawulu ka̱ra̱i a̱ tyo Nayo a̱tsuma̱ a Rama. Amma a̱vu fo Ruhu va̱ A̱sula̱ cipa̱a̱ yi, reve u yuwan adanshi e ikaka ya̱ A̱sula̱ a̱tsuma̱ o ure hali u rawa Nayo. <verse eid="1SA 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 19:24" />A̱vu wu foɗo a̱tugu a̱ yi u uwa fo adanshi e ikaka ya̱ A̱sula̱ a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma Sama'ila. A̱vu u von ataɓu urana suru na ayin. A̱yi ɗa i zuwai ama a dammai, &lt;&lt;Shawulu fo ta̱ pe a̱tsuma̱ a ama̱sula̱?&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ka̱lyuwa̱: 1 Sam 10:11-12.</char></note><verse eid="1SA 19:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="1SA 20" />
  <para style="s">Jonata kamba ta̱ Da̱wuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 20:1" />Reve Da̱wuda suma diga Nayo a̱tsuma̱ a Rama a̱vu u 'ya̱wa̱ ya Jonata we ece yi, &lt;&lt;Nye i ɗa n yuwain? Iwuya i ne ɗa n yuwain? Unusu ne ɗa n yuwaan yi dada va̱ a̱ wu, a na waa zama wu una a̱ mu?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 20:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 20:2" />A̱vu Jonata usu yi, &lt;&lt;A̱sulazuva aa para, va̱a̱ kuwa̱ shi! Ka̱lyuwa̱! Dada va̱ tsu yuwan ili i gbain ko ili i ke'en na u tsu kuɗa̱ a damma mu shi. Nye i zuwai wo soko mu za nda? Ne ɗa u ri shi!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 20:3" />Amma a̱vu Da̱wuda yuwan akucunu, u damma, &lt;&lt;Dada va̱ wu reve ta̱ lon a na n tsura̱i isa'ani e ekere a̱ wu, reve u jiyan okolo a̱ yi, &lt;Na̱ Jonata reve ili ya nda u ta yuwan a̱tsumola̱ngu lon.&gt; Ko na̱ ne n kucuna ta̱ na̱ A̱sulazuva a na a̱ ri wuma na̱ wuma wa̱ wu, udasuwu u ta̱ ɗa goon u ri e memere ma̱ va̱ nu ukwa̱.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 20:4" />Ɗaɗa Jonata dammai Da̱wuda, &lt;&lt;Suru ili i na vu cigai n yuwaan a̱ wu, n ta yuwaan a̱ wu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 20:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 20:5" />Reve Da̱wuda damma Jonata, &lt;&lt;A̱yi ɗa nda nfa'an urana wa̱ a̱buki o woto u sa'avu a ɗa, u lobono ta̱ n lyuwa oɓolo na̱ mogono, amma lyawa mu n 'ya̱wa̱ m pa'an a atsusa hali a cina santawa nu ulivu. <verse eid="1SA 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 20:6" />Na̱ dada va̱ wu lamba mu biti, reve vu damma, &lt;Da̱wuda pati mu ta̱ lon n lyawa yi u jika̱ u 'ya̱wa̱ a̱ lyuci vu umatsun wa̱ yi Batalami, adama a na a fara ta̱ kucci va aa'wan vu umatsun wa̱ yi suru.&gt; <verse eid="1SA 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 20:7" />Nu u damma, &lt;U lobono ta̱,&gt; aagbashi a̱ wu a ta la'a. Amma nu u la̱nga̱ a̱tsuma̱ lon, vu te reve a na u cigai wu una mu. <verse eid="1SA 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 20:8" />A̱vu gba shi, vu roco aagbashi a̱ wu icigi i na i tsu vadala shi, adama a na vu zuwa yi ta̱ u yuwain nzuwulai na̱ A̱sulazuva a̱ wu. Na̱ n yuwan ta̱ unusu, vu una mu na aciya̱wu! Nye i zuwai vaa ca mu ya dada va̱ wu adama wu una mu?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 20:9" />Reve Jonata usu, &lt;&lt;A̱sulazuva aa para! She vu yuwan adanshi ne wan, na̱ n reve ta̱ ko ke'en a na dada va̱ cigai wu una wu, maa damma wu shi?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 20:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 20:10" />Ɗaɗa Da̱wuda ecei Jonata, &lt;&lt;Zane ɗa a damma mu, na̱ dada va̱ wu usu wu nu upan?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 20:11" />Reve Jonata damma Da̱wuda, &lt;&lt;Ta̱wa̱, lyawa tsu lapa a̱ tyo a atsusa.&gt;&gt; Ɗaɗa ele ra a̱ ka̱ra̱i.<verse eid="1SA 20:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 20:12" />Reve Jonata damma Da̱wuda, &lt;&lt;N kucuna ta̱ na̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a Isra'ila, na̱ mantsa ma nda nfa'an ko santawa n ta yuwan adanshi'i na̱ dada va̱. Nu u ta̱ ni ifoɓi i sa'ani a̱ tyo ya̱'a̱ wu, n ta̱ lyungu a damma wu. <verse eid="1SA 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 20:13" />Amma na̱ dada va̱ ciga ta̱ na woo una wu, n ta̱ lyungu wa̱ wu adama a na va a la'a. Amma lyawa A̱sulazuva a ca mu a̱tsuma̱lima̱ lon na̱ n yuwan ne shi. Lyawa A̱sulazuva a̱ da̱na̱ oɓolo na̱ a̱vu cine u da̱na̱i na̱ dada va̱. <verse eid="1SA 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 20:14" />Na̱ m buwa ta̱ wuma, vu roco mu icigi i na i tsu vadala shi tsa̱ A̱sulazuva. Amma mantsa ma na n kuwa̱i, <verse eid="1SA 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 20:15" />she vu koɗo icigi i na i tsu vadala shi nu u'wa u va̱ wan hali hali,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ka̱lyuwa̱: 2 Sam 9:1.</char></note> ko n na̱ A̱sulazuva o kototo n'yuwatan ma̱ wu Da̱wuda diga o uvaɗi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 20:16" />Reve Jonata yuwan nzuwulai nu u'wa wa̱ Da̱wuda, u damma, &lt;&lt;Lyawa A̱sulazuva a ca wu oforo n na̱ vu kuɗa̱ o shiton nzuwulai n na tsu yuwain.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 20:17" />Adama e icigi i na Jonata a yuwusan Da̱wuda reve u zuwa yi u kucunisa, adama a na u ciga ta̱ Da̱wuda cine u cigai wuma wa̱ yi.<verse eid="1SA 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 20:18" />Ɗaɗa Jonata damma niyi, &lt;&lt;A̱yi ɗa nda nfa'an urana wa̱ a̱buki o woto u sa'avu a ɗa, waru e ene a̱ wu lo shi adama a na ootogu a̱ wu a̱ ta̱ da̱na̱ lya̱nga̱. <verse eid="1SA 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 20:19" />Santawa a cina ulivu, a̱vu vu 'ya̱wa̱ uba̱ta̱ u na vu shi vu pa'ain a mantsa ma na addama a nda a farai, waru vi isawan pe zuzu nu uba̱ta̱ o oɓolo atali. <verse eid="1SA 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 20:20" />Waru n ta̱ tewin iliya i ta'atsu a̱ nge'en ma̱ yi, she damma n te tewishin ili i ro. <verse eid="1SA 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 20:21" />Waru n ta̱ lyungu ulobo u na tsa̱ ta̱wa̱i ra reve n damma yi, &lt;'Ya̱wa̱ vu zami iliya i na n tewiyin.&gt; Na̱ n damma yi, &lt;Ka̱lyuwa̱, iliya i ta̱ lo a̱ nge'en nda ma̱ wu, ta̱wa̱ ne ele pa nda,&gt; reve vu ta̱wa̱, vu la'a ta̱, adama a na n kucuna ta̱ na̱ A̱sulazuva a na a̱ ri wuma, babu addama o ro. <verse eid="1SA 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 20:22" />Amma na̱ n damma ulobo'o, &lt;Ka̱lyuwa̱, iliya'a a̱ ta̱ ɗe elime a̱ wu ke'en,&gt; reve vu ka̱ra̱, adama a na A̱sulazuva a ciga wu ta̱ vu ka̱ra̱. <verse eid="1SA 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 20:23" />Waru adama aɗa a na tsu yuwain a̱mu na̱ a̱vu, a̱yi ɗa nda A̱sulazuva a ɗa esu a̱ tsu a̱mu na̱ a̱ vu hali hali.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 20:24" />Ɗaɗa Da̱wuda pa'ain a atsusa. Ana urana wa̱ a̱buki o woto u sa'avu a rawai, reve Shawulu Mogono ma̱ da̱nu adama u lyuwa ilyalya. <verse eid="1SA 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 20:25" />Reve mogono ma̱ da̱nu uba̱ta̱ u na u tsu da̱nusu nu uɓaɓu, a̱ nka̱la̱la̱i na̱ Jonata, reve Abna da̱nu o tono Shawulu, amma uba̱ta̱ wa̱ Da̱wuda u da̱na̱ ta̱ lya̱nga̱. <verse eid="1SA 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 20:26" />Shawulu damma ili i ro shi o urana u ndolo, adama a na u ta̱ majiyan, &lt;&lt;Ili i ro i cina ta̱ Da̱wuda a na u ka̱mbuwa̱ niyi za vi idaba, amayun za vi idaba ɗa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 20:27" />O urana we ire, wu urana u na u toni yi u urana wa̱ a̱buki o woto u sa'avu, uba̱ta̱ wa̱ Da̱wuda u da̱nisa̱ ta̱ lya̱nga̱. Reve Shawulu ece ulobo wa̱ yi Jonata, &lt;&lt;Nye i zuwai ulobo wa̱ Yese u ta̱wa̱i uba̱ta̱ wa alya e ilyalya yon na ana'an shi?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 20:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 20:28" />Reve Jonata usu Shawulu, &lt;&lt;Da̱wuda pati mu ta̱ lon n lyawa yi u 'ya̱wa̱ Batalami. <verse eid="1SA 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 20:29" />U damma ta̱, &lt;Lyawa mu n ka̱ra̱, adama a na umatsun u tsu u ta casu kucci a̱ lyuci, waru zakpara va̱ damma mu ta̱ n da̱na̱ ɗe. Na̱ n tsura̱ isa'ani e ekere a̱ wu, vu lyawa mu n 'ya̱wa̱ me ene a̱za̱ va̱.&gt; Adama a adanshi a nda ɗa u ta̱wa̱i a alya ilyalya oɓolo na̱ mogono shi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 20:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 20:30" />Reve Shawulu yuwan upan na̱ Jonata lon, a̱vu u damma yi, &lt;&lt;A̱vu mawun me pere na aciyogbamu u ɗa tsa mma va̱ wu! N reve ta̱ vu ta a kambusa ulobo wa̱ Yese, adama vu ca aciya̱wu wono na̱ mma na matsan nu wu. <verse eid="1SA 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1SA 20:31" />Nna̱ ulobo wa̱ Yese u ta̱ wuma o uvaɗi, wa lyawa tsugono tsa̱ wu tsa lyuwa elime a̱tsuma̱ e iɗa i nda shi. Gogo lyungu a̱ ta̱wa̱a̱ mu na̱ a̱yi, adama a na na a ciga a 'yuwan mu una yi!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 20:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1SA 20:32" />Reve Jonata usu dada va̱ yi Shawulu, &lt;&lt;Nye i zuwai oo una yi? Nye i ɗa u yuwain?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1SA 20:33" />Reve Shawulu sari ibata ya̱ yi adama wu una yi. Ɗaɗa Jonata revei dada va̱ yi ciga ta̱ a na woo una Da̱wuda.<verse eid="1SA 20:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1SA 20:34" />Reve Jonata 'yon nu upan lon diga a apada agba u lyuwa ilyalya o urana we ire, wu urana u na u toni u urana wa̱ a̱buki'i o woto u sa'avu shi, adama a na u ta̱ na̱ a̱tsumola̱ngu cine dada va̱ yi yuwain na̱ Da̱wuda a̱tsuma̱ o ulambu u wono.<verse eid="1SA 20:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1SA 20:35" />Nu usana a̱vu Jonata 'ya̱wa̱ a atsusa uba̱ta̱ u na aa zuwai a na a ga'asan na̱ Da̱wuda. U da̱na̱ ta̱ na̱ molobo oɓolo na̱ a̱yi. <verse eid="1SA 20:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1SA 20:36" />Reve u damma molobo'o, &lt;&lt;Suma vu zami iliya i na me tewin.&gt;&gt; Ana molobo'o u sumai, a̱vu u tewin liya elime a̱ yi ke'en. <verse eid="1SA 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1SA 20:37" />Ana molobo'o u rawai uba̱ta̱ wu liya n na Jonata teweyin, a̱vu Jonata ɗe yi reve u damma, &lt;&lt;Liya'a wu ɗe elime a̱ wu ke'en shi?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1SA 20:38" />Reve Jonata ɗe molobo'o, &lt;&lt;Jika̱! 'Ya̱wa̱ gogogo! She vi isawan wan!&gt;&gt; Ɗaɗa molobo'o u tarai liya'a a̱vu u ka̱mba̱ uba̱ta̱ wu zagbain va̱ yi. <verse eid="1SA 20:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1SA 20:39" />Amma molobo'o u reve ko nye i ɗa suru ili i nda'a shi, Jonata na̱ Da̱wuda ɗa goon revei. <verse eid="1SA 20:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1SA 20:40" />A̱vu Jonata ca molobo'o utan ni iliya ya̱ yi, a̱vu u damma yi, &lt;&lt;Wala, tara le a̱ tyo a̱ lyuci.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 20:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1SA 20:41" />Mantsa ma na molobo'o u ka̱ra̱i, a̱vu Da̱wuda 'yon diga upasu wu uyagi uba̱ta̱ wo o oɓolo atali'i, reve u kingyo u ka̱ɗa̱to urewesu wa̱ yi e iɗa a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma Jonata toto uta'atsu. A̱vu a katalalai ra reve a̱ shon, amma Da̱wuda la'a ta̱ shon.<verse eid="1SA 20:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="1SA 20:42" />Reve Jonata damma Da̱wuda, &lt;&lt;Ka̱ra̱ na asuvu nden, adama a na tsu yuwan ta̱ akucunu a̱ n'utsa̱ na ala a̱ A̱sulazuva, tsu damma, &lt;A̱sulazuva a ɗa esu a̱ va̱ na̱ a̱vu, waru esu a limatan va̱ wu na a limatan va̱ hali hali.&gt; &gt;&gt; Reve Da̱wuda 'yon u ka̱ra̱, a̱vu Jonata ka̱ra̱ a̱ ka̱mba̱ a̱ lyuci.<verse eid="1SA 20:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="1SA 21" />
  <para style="s">Da̱wuda a̱tsuma̱ a Nob</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 21:1" />Da̱wuda ka̱ra̱ ta̱ a̱ tyo Nob, uba̱ta̱ wa Ahimele ganu. A̱vu Ahimele ta̱wa̱ u ga'asan na̱ Da̱wuda e meje'en a̱vu we ece yi, &lt;&lt;Nye i zuwai vu ta̱wa̱i a̱ nde'en goon?&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ka̱lyuwa̱: Mat 12:3-4; Mak 2:25-26; Luk 6:3.</char></note><verse eid="1SA 21:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 21:2" />Reve Da̱wuda usu Ahimele ganu, &lt;&lt;Mogono ma ɗa ma̱ lyungu numu na aɗa o ro waru u damma mu ta̱, &lt;She vu lyawa za reve ili i ro adama aɗa a na n lyungu nuwu wan, waru ni ili i na n damma nuwu wan.&gt; Waru ali o uvon a̱ va̱, n damma le ta̱ uba̱ta̱ u na tsu zuwulai a na a ga'asan na̱ a̱mu. <verse eid="1SA 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 21:3" />Gogo, ilyalya i ne i ɗa vu ri na̱ a̱yi? Ca mu akpatali o opopofu ozo o ton, ko ili i ro i na vu ri na̱ a̱yi suru.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 21:4" />Reve ganu usu Da̱wuda, &lt;&lt;N ri pa no opopofu a ndana o ukere u va̱ shi, amma opopofu a akiza a ɗa a̱ ri pa, vu ta gura tama na ali o uvon a̱ wu a na asai na̱ a̱ma̱ci yon shi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 21:5" />Reve Da̱wuda usu ganu, &lt;&lt;Amayun a kasa tsu ta̱ na̱ a̱ma̱ci cine a tsu yuwusan nu ufaru suru mantsa ma na n 'ya̱wa̱i mmalu na ali o uvon a̱ va̱. Lipu va ali a̱ va̱ a aza a akiza a ɗa ko na̱ shi gba n mmalu ma ndana n ɗa. Te gba ana'an a na tsu uta̱i mmalu ma akiza!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 21:6" />Ɗaɗa ganu ca niyi opopofu a akiza adama a na babu lo opopofu o ro ko'o, she za na a tawai na ri a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ A̱sulazuva, a̱vu a kita'wan na̱ za vu usuɗuwu o urana u na a tawa niyi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ka̱lyuwa̱: N.Gn 24:5-9.</char></note><verse eid="1SA 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 21:7" />Waru o urana u ndolo aagbashi a Shawulu o ro da̱na̱ ta̱ lo, adama a na u ta̱ ni ili i na waa yuwan a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ A̱sulazuva. Ala a̱ yi a ɗa Dowe vuma va Edom, zagbain va aza a aguɓa a Shawulu.<verse eid="1SA 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 21:8" />Reve Da̱wuda ece Ahimele, &lt;&lt;Vu ri ni ibata ko matsun me pe'eni mo ro pa shi? Adama a na n ta̱wa̱ na̱ matsun me pe'eni ma̱ va̱ ko itana yu uvon i ro shi, adama a na udammu u mogono u ta̱wa̱ mu ta̱ uragazu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 21:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 21:9" />Reve ganu usu yi, &lt;&lt;Matsun me pe'eni ma Goliya vuma va Filistiya, na vu unai o uka̱ri wa Ela,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ka̱lyuwa̱: 1 Sam 17:51.</char></note> u ta̱ pa u tu ukatalu na aakashi o cina̱ wa̱ epo. Na̱ vu ciga yi vu tara, matsun me pe'eni mo ro ma pa shi she a̱yi.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 21:9">A̱vu Da̱wuda damma, &lt;&lt;Babu za ro tsa̱ yi, ca mu a̱yi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Da̱wuda a̱ lyuci va Gat</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 21:10" />A̱vu Da̱wuda 'yon u sumaa Shawulu o urana u ndolo, a̱vu u ka̱ra̱ a̱ tyo ya Akish mogono ma Gat e iɗa ya Filistiya.<verse eid="1SA 21:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 21:11" />A̱vu agbashi a Akish a damma yi, &lt;&lt;A̱yi nda a̱yi ɗaɗa Da̱wuda'a mogono me iɗa'a? A̱yi nda a̱ yi ɗa vuma'a na amayun na a canaa yi ishipa nu uje'en, a̱vu a cana,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="1SA 21:11" />
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 21:11">&lt;&lt; &lt;Shawulu una ta̱ kpaku kupa va̱ yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 21:11">waru Da̱wuda una ta̱ ukpakukupa kupa va̱ yi va̱ a̱bunda̱.&gt; &gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ka̱lyuwa̱: 1 Sam 18:7; 1 Sam 29:5.</char></note><verse eid="1SA 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 21:12" />A̱vu Da̱wuda zuwa adanshi'i o okolo a̱vu u ka̱ra̱ a uwwusa wovon wa Akish mogono ma Gat lon.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:12-13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ka̱lyuwa̱: Ica 56 na̱ Ica 34 Aciya adanshi e ishipa. </char></note> <verse eid="1SA 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 21:13" />Reve u vadala ugbozu wa̱ yi a yuwusan ili iwa̱u a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n me le, waru suru mantsa ma na a̱ ri u uguzu na̱ yi, reve u yuwan she damma u ri nu ugbozu wa̱ yi shi, u reme yironishi a̱ na̱ntsu vu u'uwata u lyuci waru ma̱tsa̱n a̱ ma̱la̱la̱ a̱ ntsuka̱ ma̱ yi.<verse eid="1SA 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 21:14" />Ɗaɗa Akish dammai agbashi a̱ yi, &lt;&lt;Ka̱lyuwa̱i vuma'a aajarata a ɗa! Nye i zuwai i ta̱wa̱a̱ numu na̱ a̱yi? <verse eid="1SA 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 21:15" />N lamba ta̱ ajarata a na i ta̱wa̱a̱ numu na̱ cu'un vuma nda, u yuwusaan mu tsulo a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ va̱? N cigai u ta̱wa̱ o u'wa u va̱ shi!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 21:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="1SA 22" />
  <para style="s">Da̱wuda a̱tsuma̱ a Adulam na̱ Mizfa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 22:1" />Da̱wuda lyawa ta̱ Gat a̱vu u suma a̱ tyo a̱ a̱a̱ba̱nu a Adulam.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ka̱lyuwa̱: Ica 57 na̱ Ica 142 Aciya adanshi e ishipa.</char></note> Ana a̱za̱ a̱ yi nu u'wa wa dada va̱ yi a uwwai ne suru, reve a lapa a̱ cipa̱ pe ya̱'a̱ yi. <verse eid="1SA 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 22:2" />Waru aza a na a̱ ri a̱tsuma̱lima̱ suru na aza a na o tono utan, na aza a na a̱ ri na adanshi o okolo, a̱vu oɓoloto uba̱ta̱ wa̱ yi, a̱vu wo o'wo zagbain le. Waru ama a na a̱ da̱na̱i oɓolo na̱ a̱yi a ta rawa ukpakuna̱shi (400).<verse eid="1SA 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 22:3" />Waru diga lo a̱vu Da̱wuda ka̱ra̱ a̱ tyo Mizfa a̱tsuma̱ a̱ Mowa a̱vu u damma mogono ma̱ Mowa, &lt;&lt;Vu ta yuwan ankuri vu lyawa dada va̱ na̱ mma va̱ a̱ ta̱wa̱ a̱ da̱nu oɓolo na̱ a̱vu hali she na̱ me ene ili i na A̱sula̱ aa yuwaan mu?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 22:4" />Ɗaɗa u lyawa nle oɓolo na̱ mogono ma̱ Mowa, reve a̱ da̱nu oɓolo na̱ a̱yi mantsa ma na suru Da̱wuda yuwain o upa'atan a masasan.<verse eid="1SA 22:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 22:5" />Amma Gadu vumava̱sula̱ damma ta̱ Da̱wuda, &lt;&lt;She vu da̱nu pe o upa'ata'an wan. Ka̱ra̱ a̱ tyo e iɗa ya Yahuda.&gt;&gt; Ɗaɗa Da̱wuda ka̱ra̱i a̱ tyo a̱ a̱a̱rumbu a Heret.<verse eid="1SA 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Shawulu una ta̱ nan ganu va Nob</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 22:6" />Shawulu uwwa ta̱ a na ene ta̱ Da̱wuda, oɓolo na ama a na a̱ ri oɓolo na̱ a̱yi. Shawulu da̱na̱ ta̱ nden ɗe Gibiya e ikyun yu uɗanga u na a̱ tsu ɗe tamari zuva va aagaɗi uɓa̱nu ni ibata ya̱ yi o ukere, waru azagbain a̱ yi suru a̱ da̱na̱ ta̱ mishin u ka̱nda̱ruwu na̱ a̱yi. <verse eid="1SA 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 22:7" />A̱vu Shawulu damma agbashi a̱ yi, &lt;&lt;Poloi atsuvu, ama a Banyami! Ulobo wa̱ Yese u ta ca ɗu atsusa oɓolo na̱ a̱ɗuma̱ a̱ ina̱bi suru? U ta zuwa ɗu yo o'wo yali vu ukpakukupa ko yali vu ukpaku ukpaku? <verse eid="1SA 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 22:8" />A̱yi ɗa i zuwai yoo foɓuso iwuya a aciya̱va̱ suru? Babu za na damma numu a na ulobo u va̱ u yuwan ta̱ nzuwulai nu ulobo wa̱ Yese. Ko za a̱tsuma̱ a̱ ɗu a yuwusan aɗa a̱ va̱ shi, ko u damma mu a na ulobo u va̱ u zuwai aagbashi a̱ va̱ adama u vawan mu, cine u yuwain ana'an shi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 22:9" />Reve Dowe vuma va Edom, za na da̱na̱i lo mishin oɓolo na azagbain a Shawulu u usu, &lt;&lt;Me ene ta̱ ulobo wa̱ Yese a̱ ta̱wa̱ Nob, uba̱ta̱ wa Ahimele ulobo wa Ahitu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ka̱lyuwa̱: 1 Sam 21:7-9; na̱ Ica 52 Aciya adanshi e ishipa.</char></note> <verse eid="1SA 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 22:10" />Ahimele ece yi ta̱ A̱sulazuva waru u ca yi ta̱ ilyalya na̱ matsun me pe'eni ma Goliya vuma va Filistiya.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 22:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 22:11" />Ɗaɗa mogono ma̱ lyunguyi a̱ ta̱wa̱a̱ yi na̱ Ahimele ganu, ulobo wa Ahitu nu u'wa wa dada va̱ yi suru, aza a na da̱na̱i nan ganu a Nob, a̱vu suru a̱ ta̱wa̱ uba̱ta̱ u mogono. <verse eid="1SA 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 22:12" />A̱vu Shawulu damma, &lt;&lt;Polo atsuvu, ulobo wa Ahitu.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 22:12">A̱vu u usu, &lt;&lt;Mpa mu nda zagbain va̱.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 22:13" />Reve Shawulu damma yi, &lt;&lt;Nye i zuwai i foɓoi iwuya adama a̱ va̱? A̱vu nu ulobo wa̱ Yese, vu ca niyi opopofu na̱ matsun me pe'eni, waru vu patiya niyi A̱sula̱, adama u yuwan nla̱ngi na̱ a̱mu, waru u vawan mu, cine u yuwain ana'an!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 22:14" />Reve Ahimele usu mogono'o, &lt;&lt;Zane ɗa a̱tsuma̱ a agbashi a̱ wu ri na̱ a̱ɓula̱ tsa̱ Da̱wuda, toto mogono, yali ya̱ a̱za̱ e ipiri ya̱ a̱ wu suru, za na aa casu tsugbain o u'wa wa̱ wu suru? <verse eid="1SA 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 22:15" />Na amayun n patiya yi ta̱ A̱sula̱, agba a̱ yi nda a̱ yi ɗa mu ufaru shi. Amma n ta̱ e pati ya̱ wu she vu ca mu unusu ko vu tawaa za ro a̱tsuma̱ o u'wa wa dada va̱ wan. Adama a na n reve na aɗa a nda shi!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 22:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 22:16" />Reve mogono ma damma, &lt;&lt;Vu ciga vu 'yuwan o una wu, Ahimele, a̱vu nu u'wa wa dada va̱ wu suru.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 22:17" />A̱vu mogono ma damma a̱za̱ e ipiri ya̱ yi a na a̱ ri mishin u ka̱nda̱ruwu na̱ a̱yi, &lt;&lt;Vadalai yu una nan ganu va̱ A̱sulazuva, adama a na ele fo o ɓolo ta̱ aci na̱ Da̱wuda. E reve ta̱ ni ilaɗi ya̱ yi agba a damma mu shi.&gt;&gt; Amma a̱soja o mogono'o a ciga a̱ 'ya̱sa̱n ukere u le o una nan ganu va̱ A̱sulazuva'a shi.<verse eid="1SA 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 22:18" />Reve mogono ma damma Dowe, &lt;&lt;A̱vu vadaluwa vu una nan ganu.&gt;&gt; Ɗaɗa Dowe vuma va Edom vadaluwai wu una nle. O urana u ndolo wu una ta̱ ama kupakunla̱ no ozo o ton aza a na a̱ da̱na̱i wotowu na̱ mutugu ma̱ epo vo okoro. <verse eid="1SA 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 22:19" />Waru wu una ta̱ fo a̱za̱ a̱ lyuci va Nob na̱ matsun me pe'eni, lyuci nan ganu, na ali e le na̱ a̱ma̱ci na̱ muwun na̱ nreɓu, ni inan na̱ nloli ni ikyon.<verse eid="1SA 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 22:20" />Amma a̱tsuma̱ olobo a Ahimele ulobo wa Ahitu za na a̱ tsu ɗe Abiyata, u la'a ta̱, a̱vu u suma u kuru Da̱wuda. <verse eid="1SA 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 22:21" />A̱vu u damma Da̱wuda, Shawulu una ta̱ nan ganu a̱ A̱sulazuva. <verse eid="1SA 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 22:22" />Ɗaɗa Da̱wuda dammai Abiyata, &lt;&lt;Urana u ndolo a na Dowe vuma va Edom da̱na̱i lo, n reve ta̱ na amayun a na waa damma Shawulu. Adama a̱ va̱ a ɗa o unai u'wa wa dada va̱ wu suru. <verse eid="1SA 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 22:23" />Isawan oɓolo na̱ a̱mu, she vu uwwa wovon wan, adama a na za na a zamishi wuma wa̱ wu u ta zami shi fo za va̱. Vu ta̱ da̱na̱ gbaga oɓolo na̱ a̱mu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 22:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="1SA 23" />
  <para style="s">Da̱wuda wawa ta̱ lyuci va Kayila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 23:1" />Ana a dammai Da̱wuda, &lt;&lt;A̱yi ɗa nda aza a Filistiya a ta yuwusan uvon na aza a Kayila a̱tsuma̱ e iɗa ya Yahuda, waru a̱ ta̱ purusa̱ le ishina o osoroto,&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 23:2" />a̱vu Da̱wuda pati ya̱ A̱sulazuva, u damma, &lt;&lt;N 'ya̱wa̱ n riya̱a̱ aza a Filistiya nu uvon?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 23:2">A̱vu A̱sulazuva a damma yi, &lt;&lt;'Ya̱wa̱ vu riya̱a̱ le tsura̱ vu wawa aza a Kayila.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 23:3" />Amma a̱vu ama a̱ Da̱wuda a damma yi, &lt;&lt;Ka̱lyuwa̱, a̱yi ɗa nda pa a̱tsuma̱ a Yahuda tsu ta uwwusa wovon. Cine tsa ɗa wo o'wo na̱ tsu 'ya̱wa̱ Kayila tsu riya̱a̱ aza a Filistiya nu uvon?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 23:4" />A̱vu Da̱wuda da̱shi pati ya̱ A̱sulazuva, a̱vu A̱sulazuva a̱ usu yi, &lt;&lt;Lapa a̱ cipa̱ Kayila, adama a na n ta ca aza a Filistiya e ekere a̱ wu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 23:5" />Ɗaɗa Da̱wuda na̱ ama a̱ yi a̱ ka̱ra̱i a̱ tyo Kayila, a̱vu a yuwan uvon na aza a Filistiya, waru o una le ta̱ na̱ a̱bunda̱ wa'a shi. A̱vu a̱ pura̱ iliyamunga i le. Reve u wawa ama a Kayila. <verse eid="1SA 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 23:6" />Waru a mantsa ma na Abiyata ulobo wa Ahimele sumai a̱ tyo ya̱ Da̱wuda'a ɗe Kayila, u ta̱wa̱ ta̱ na̱ epo o ukere wa̱ yi.<verse eid="1SA 23:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 23:7" />A damma ta̱ Shawulu a na Da̱wuda ta̱ ɗe Kayila, a̱vu Shawulu damma, &lt;&lt;A̱sula̱ a ta ca yi e ekere a̱ va̱, adama a na u ɓa̱ru ta̱ aciya̱yi, a na wo'woi uwa ta̱ a̱ lyuci na ri na̱ na̱ntsu na a̱ɓa̱ru yi na̱ aɗanga e rumu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 23:8" />A̱vu Shawulu ɗe a̱soja a̱ yi suru a lapa a̱ cipa̱ a̱ tyo Kayila, adama a̱ ka̱nda̱ruwa̱ Da̱wuda na̱ ama a̱ yi nu uvon.<verse eid="1SA 23:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 23:9" />Ana Da̱wuda uwwai Shawulu ta yuwusan ifoɓi i na wa̱ ta̱wa̱ yi nu uvon, a̱vu u damma Abiyata ganu, &lt;&lt;Ta̱wa̱ na̱ epo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 23:10" />Reve Da̱wuda yuwan avasa u damma, &lt;&lt;A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a Isra'ila, aagbashi a̱ wu a uwwa ta̱ a na na amayun Shawulu ta zama u ta̱wa̱ Kayila, tsa̱ra̱ u kototo lyuci adama a̱ va̱. <verse eid="1SA 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 23:11" />Amma Shawulu ta̱ zura̱ a̱ tyo Kayila cine aagbashi a̱ wu uwwai? Waru azagbain a Kayila a ta reme mu reve a ca mu ekere a̱yi? A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a Isra'ila, n te e ipati ya̱ wu vu damma aagbashi a̱ wu.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 23:11">Reve A̱sulazuva a damma, &lt;&lt;U ta̱ ta̱wa̱.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 23:12" />Reve Da̱wuda yuwisan yeci, &lt;&lt;Azagbain a Kayila a ta ca mu na̱ ama a̱ va̱ a̱ tyo e ekere a Shawulu?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 23:12">A̱vu A̱sulazuva a̱ usu, &lt;&lt;A ta ca ɗu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 23:13" />Ɗaɗa Da̱wuda na̱ ama a̱ yi ele ama ukpakuta̱li (600), a̱ 'yon yi a lyawai Kayila, a̱vu a̱ ka̱ra̱ a̱ tyo uba̱ta̱ u na aa gura 'ya̱wa̱ suru adama e reme le wan. Ana a dammai Shawulu Da̱wuda suma ta̱ diga Kayila, a̱vu u bula̱ mmalu a̱ 'ya̱wa̱ ɗe.<verse eid="1SA 23:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 23:14" />A̱vu Da̱wuda isawan pe uba̱ta̱ o upa'atan a̱tsumona, ne e iɗa ya agaɗi wa̱ A̱tsumona a Zif. Waru Shawulu zamishi yi ta̱ urana suru, amma A̱sula̱ a ca Da̱wuda e ekere a̱ yi shi.<verse eid="1SA 23:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Shawulu 'ya̱wa̱ ta̱ izami ya̱ Da̱wuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 23:15" />Ana Da̱wuda da̱na̱i Horesh a̱tsuma̱ A̱tsumona a Zif, reve wu uwwa Shawulu ta̱wa̱ ta̱ uba̱ta̱'a̱ izami ya̱ yi adama wu una yi. <verse eid="1SA 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 23:16" />Reve Jonata ulobo wa Shawulu u 'ya̱wa̱ uba̱ta̱ wa̱ Da̱wuda ɗe Horesh, a̱vu u ca yi adanshi wi isawan no okolo a̱ yi uba̱ta̱ wa̱ a̱ A̱sula̱ ulobonu. <verse eid="1SA 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 23:17" />A̱vu u damma yi, &lt;&lt;She vu uwwa wovon wan, ukere wa dada va̱ Shawulu wa̱a̱ ju'wa̱n wu shi. Vu to o'wo mogono a aci a aza a Isra'ila suru a̱mu gba n to o'wo dodu va̱ wu. Ko Shawulu dada va̱ reve ta̱ ne.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 23:18" />A̱vu ele ra a yuwan nzuwulai a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ A̱sulazuva.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ka̱lyuwa̱: 1 Sam 18:3.</char></note> Reve Jonata ka̱mba̱ o u'wa, a̱vu Da̱wuda isawan pe Horesh.<verse eid="1SA 23:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 23:19" />Ɗaɗa aza a Zif a̱ 'ya̱wa̱i uba̱ta̱ wa Shawulu ɗe Gibiya a̱vu a damma, &lt;&lt;Da̱wuda ta̱ pe a̱tsuma̱ a̱ tsu uba̱ta̱ o upa'atan ɗe Horesh zuva va aagaɗi a Hakila upasu wu uyagi wa Jeshimon.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ka̱lyuwa̱: Ica 54 Aciya adanshi e ishipa.</char></note> <verse eid="1SA 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 23:20" />Gogo, mogono, she vu ta̱wa̱ mantsa ma na u lobono nuwu vu yuwan ne, waru tsu ta tara ume adama tsu ca yi e ekere a̱ wu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 23:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 23:21" />Reve Shawulu damma, &lt;&lt;A̱sulazuva a zuwaa ɗu aba'un, adama a na i roco mu ta̱ isa'ani. <verse eid="1SA 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 23:22" />'Ya̱wa̱yi i yuwisan ifoɓi i ro. I gura reve uba̱ta̱ u na Da̱wuda tsu 'ya̱wusa̱ na za na ene niyi ɗe. Adama a na a damma mu ta̱ u tu nu ugbozu lon. <verse eid="1SA 23:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 23:23" />I gura reve ba̱ta̱ na waa pa'asan suru reve i ka̱mba̱ i damma mu urevu wa amayun. Reve tsu gereyi. Na̱ u ta̱ lo upasu'u, n ta̱ bunga̱ yi ko te ɗa u ri, a̱tsuma̱ o umatsun wa a aza a Yahuda suru.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 23:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 23:24" />A̱vu a̱ 'yon a̱ ka̱ra̱ a̱ tyo Zif babu Shawulu rawa. Da̱wuda gba na̱ ama a̱ yi a̱ da̱na̱ ta̱ A̱tsumona a̱ Mawon, upasu wu uyagi wa̱ Jeshimon a̱tsuma̱ o Uka̱ri wa Araba. <verse eid="1SA 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 23:25" />A̱vu Shawulu na ali o uvon a̱ yi a̱ 'ya̱wa̱ izami ya̱ yi, reve a damma Da̱wuda, ɗaɗa u ka̱ra̱i a̱ cipa̱ tyo a aatali a gbain o ro a̱vu wi isawan A̱tsumona a̱ Mawon. Ana Shawulu uwwai ne, a̱vu u lapa a̱ tyo a̱tsumona a̱ Mawon izami ya̱ yi.<verse eid="1SA 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 23:26" />Shawulu kuru ta̱ upasu u ta̱ wa a aatali a gbai'in Da̱wuda waru na ali o uvon a̱ yi o upasu we ire, a̱vu nan Da̱wuda a̱ jika̱ adama a la'a ya Shawulu. Ana Shawulu na ali o uvon a̱ yi a̱ da̱na̱i a rawusa zuzu na̱ le adama e reme le, <verse eid="1SA 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 23:27" />a̱vu malingata ma̱ ta̱wa̱ ya Shawulu u damma, &lt;&lt;Jika̱ vu ta̱wa̱, adama a na aza a Filistiya a̱ riya̱a̱ ta̱ iɗa i tsu nu uvon!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 23:28" />Ɗaɗa Shawulu lyawai izami ya̱ Da̱wuda a̱vu u 'ya̱wa̱ u riya̱a̱ aza a Filistiya nu uvon. Adama a ndolo a ɗa e ɗeyi uba̱ta̱'a̱ Aatali a Mala'a. <verse eid="1SA 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 23:29" />A̱vu Da̱wuda lapa a gawan diga lo, a̱vu u da̱nu uba̱ta̱ o upa'atan A̱tsumona a En Gedi.<verse eid="1SA 23:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="1SA 24" />
  <para style="s">Da̱wuda lyawa ta̱ Shawulu wuma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 24:1" />Ana Shawulu ka̱mba̱i diga uba̱ta̱ e itoni ya aza a Filistiya, a̱vu a damma yi, &lt;&lt;Da̱wuda ta̱ ɗe A̱tsumona a En Gedi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 24:2" />Ɗaɗa Shawulu ɗangulai ama ukpakukupa uta'atsu (3,000) a̱tsuma̱ a Isra'ila suru, a̱vu o uta̱ izami ya̱ Da̱wuda na ama a̱ yi zuzu na̱ Aatali a̱ Mgbele n Masasan mu Una.<verse eid="1SA 24:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 24:3" />Ana u rawai uba̱ta̱ u na a̱ gutsu su mgbele a̱ nge'en mu ure, uba̱ta̱ u na a̱a̱ba̱nu a̱ ri, a̱vu Shawulu ɓatsa adama u yuwan rulu. Da̱wuda na ali a̱ yi, a̱ shi ta̱ pe alanga pe a̱ba̱nu'u.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ka̱lyuwa̱: Ica 57 na̱ Ica 142 Aciya adanshi e ishipa.</char></note> <verse eid="1SA 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 24:4" />A̱vu ama a̱ yi a damma, &lt;&lt;A̱yi nda a̱yi ɗa urana u na A̱sulazuva a damma nuwu, &lt;Ka̱lyuwa̱, n ta ca ma'yuwatan ma̱ wu e ekere a̱ wu, adama vu yuwan na̱ a̱yi cine vu cigai.&gt; &gt;&gt; Reve Da̱wuda 'yon u puta̱ yi, a̱vu u koɗo iwa̱sa̱ ye elentsu yu utugu wa Shawulu babu a̱yi urevu.<verse eid="1SA 24:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 24:5" />Na̱ a̱ca̱pa̱ a̱vu Da̱wuda dama na̱ cine u koɗo niyi iwa̱sa̱ ye elentsu yu utugu'u. <verse eid="1SA 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 24:6" />A̱vu u damma ama a̱ yi, &lt;&lt;A̱sulazuva a para mu n yuwan na̱ zagbain va̱ ili ya nda, za na A̱sulazuva a tawai, ko n 'ya̱sa̱n ukere u va̱ n ju'wa̱in yi, adama a na a̱yi ɗa A̱sulazuva a̱ tsuwa̱n yi mani'in.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 24:7" />Na adanshi a nda a ɗa Da̱wuda ɓarai ama a̱ yi, waru u lyawa le o una Shawulu shi. A̱vu Shawulu lyawa a̱a̱ba̱nu'u u reme mmalu ma̱ yi.<verse eid="1SA 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 24:8" />Na̱ a̱ca̱pa̱ a̱vu Da̱wuda uta̱ diga a̱ a̱a̱ba̱nu'u, reve u ɗe Shawulu, &lt;&lt;Zagbain va̱ mogono!&gt;&gt; Ana Shawulu vadalai, a̱vu Da̱wuda kingyo u ka̱ɗa̱to urewesu wa̱ yi e iɗa. <verse eid="1SA 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 24:9" />A̱vu Da̱wuda damma yi, &lt;&lt;Nye i zuwai va uwwusa adanshi a na ama a dammai, &lt;A̱yi ɗa nda Da̱wuda ciga ta̱ waa amaton wu&gt;? <verse eid="1SA 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 24:10" />Ka̱lyuwa̱, ana'an nda ve ene ta̱ ne esu a̱ wu, cine A̱sulazuva a ca nuwu e ekere a̱ va̱ a̱tsuma̱ a̱ a̱a̱ba̱nu. A damma mu ta̱ mu una wu, amma n lyawa wu ta̱ wuma, n damma ta̱, &lt;Ma̱a̱ 'ya̱sa̱n ukere u va̱ n ju'wa̱n zagbain va̱ shi, adama a na a̱ yi ɗa za na A̱sulazuva a̱ tsuwa̱yin mani'in.&gt; <verse eid="1SA 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 24:11" />Ka̱lyuwa̱, dada va̱, nda iwa̱sa̱ ya̱ elentsu o utugu wa̱ wu o ukere u va̱! Ko na wo o'woi n koɗoi iwa̱sa̱ ya̱ elentsu o utugu wa̱ wu agba mu una wu shi. Gogo vu jiyan waru vu reve a na n ri ni ifoɓi yu uwuyanu ko aciyogbamu a̱ tyo e ekere a̱ wu shi, n yuwaan wu unusu shi, amma vu ta zamishi mu adama vu una mu. <verse eid="1SA 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 24:12" />Lyawa A̱sulazuva e ge'eto tsu ra. Waru lyawa A̱sulazuva a tsupaa mu iwuya i na vu yuwain a̱ tyo ya̱'a̱ va̱, amma ukere u va̱ wa̱a̱ ju'wa̱n wu shi. <verse eid="1SA 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 24:13" />Cine udammu wu nkaya mu ufaru n dammai, &lt;Iwuya i tsu uta̱ ta̱ uba̱ta̱ wa̱ a̱za̱ e iwuya.&gt; Ne ɗa ukere u va̱ wa̱a̱ ju'wa̱n wu shi.<verse eid="1SA 24:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 24:14" />&lt;&lt;A̱vu na vu ri mogono ma Isra'ila zane ɗa vu uta̱i uvon na̱ a̱yi? Zane ɗa vaa gbagbusa? A̱kwa̱kwa̱ a̱ musa̱n? Ko aakupa? <verse eid="1SA 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 24:15" />Lyawa A̱sulazuva o o'wo za vu uge'etosu u tsu waru u kurato tsu. Lyawa wi idana mu, waru wi isawaan mu u roco a na n ri nu unusu shi, a̱vu u wawa mu e ekere a̱ wu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 24:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 24:16" />Ana Da̱wuda kotoi adansa ne, a̱vu Shawulu ece, &lt;&lt;Uɗyo wa̱ wu u ɗa nda'a, ulobo u va̱ Da̱wuda?&gt;&gt; Reve u shon na̱ yisali lon. <verse eid="1SA 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 24:17" />Reve u damma, &lt;&lt;Vu la'a mu ta̱ a̱ɓula̱ adama a na vu ɓana mu ta̱ ulobonu, amma a̱mu n yuwaan wu ta̱ iwuya. <verse eid="1SA 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 24:18" />Vu damma mu ta̱ gogo isa'ani i na vu yuwaan numu, A̱sulazuva a ca mu ta̱ e ekere a̱ wu, agba vu una mu shi. <verse eid="1SA 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 24:19" />Na̱ vuma ene ma'yuwatan ma̱ yi u ta lyawa yi u ka̱ra̱ fa̱a̱n? Adama o ndolo lyawa A̱sulazuva a tsupaa wu ni isa'ani, adama e ili i na vu roco numu ana'an. <verse eid="1SA 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 24:20" />N reve ta̱ na amayun vu to o'wo mogono, waru tsugono tsa Isra'ila tsa ta lyuwa elime o ukere wa̱ wu. <verse eid="1SA 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 24:21" />Gogo kucinaa mu na̱ A̱sulazuva voo kototo limatan ta̱ va̱ a̱ca̱pa̱ va̱ shi, ko vu kimusa̱ ala a̱ va̱ diga o u'wa wa dada va̱ shi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 24:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 24:22" />A̱vu Da̱wuda kucinaa ne Shawulu. Reve Shawulu ka̱mba̱ o u'wa, amma Da̱wuda na̱ ama a̱ yi a̱ ka̱ra̱ ta̱ a̱ ka̱mba̱ o upa'ata'an.<verse eid="1SA 24:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="1SA 25" />
  <para style="s">Da̱wuda na̱ Nabal na̱ Abigel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 25:1" />Ana a yuwain ne Sama'ila kuwa̱ ta̱, a̱vu aza a Isra'ila suru o ɓoloto a yuwan nden n wiruta̱ adama a̱ yi, reve a̱ ciɗo yi a̱tsuma̱ a̱ lyuci va̱ yi a Rama. Reve Da̱wuda ka̱ra̱ a̱cipa̱ a̱ tyo A̱tsumona a Faran.<verse eid="1SA 25:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2-3" style="v" sid="1SA 25:2-3" />A yuwan ta̱ vuma ro diga a̱tsuma̱ a limatan va Keleb za na a̱ tsu ɗe Nabal, diga a̱ a̱tsuma̱ a̱ lyuci va Mawon, za na ri nu uba̱ta̱ zuzu na̱ lyuci va Kame. Za vu utsuru ɗa da̱na̱i lon, u ta̱ na̱ ni ikyon ukpakukupa uta'atsu (3,000) na̱ mgbele ukpakukupa (1,000). Ka va̱ yi Abigel da̱na̱ ta̱ ulobonu nu urevu, amma vuma ɗa na da̱na̱i na asuvu usuɗuwu ni iwuya. Waru Nabal da̱na̱ ta̱ apunusa ikyon ya̱ yi a̱tsuma̱ a Kame.<verse eid="1SA 25:2-3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 25:4" />Mantsa ma na Da̱wuda da̱na̱i a̱tsumona, wu uwwa ta̱ a na Nabal ta apunusa ikyon ya̱ a̱ yi, <verse eid="1SA 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 25:5" />ɗaɗa u lyunguyi ali o uvon kupa a̱vu u damma le, &lt;&lt;'Ya̱wa̱i uba̱ta̱ wa Nabal ɗe Kame reve i ca̱sa̱ yi na aala a̱ va̱. <verse eid="1SA 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 25:6" />I damma yi, &lt;Wuma wa̱ wu ujima! Asuvu nden a̱ da̱na̱ oɓolo na̱ a̱vu, waru ɓolo nu u'wa wa̱ wu, waru asuvu nden a̱ da̱na̱ oɓolo ni ili i na vu ri na̱ yi suru!<verse eid="1SA 25:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 25:7" />&lt;&lt; &lt;Mu uwwa ta̱ mantsa me ipuna me ikyon ma ɗa. Mantsa ma na azaguɓa a̱ wu a̱ da̱na̱i oɓolo na̱ a̱tsu, tsu yuwaan le iwuya shi, waru suru mantsa ma na a̱ da̱na̱i ɗe Kame babu ili i le i na i puwa̱yin. <verse eid="1SA 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 25:8" />Ece agbashi a̱ wu waru a ta damma wu. Adama o ndolo lyawa olobo a̱ va̱ a̱ tsura̱ isa'ani e esu a̱ wu, adama a na tsu rawa ta̱ urana wa̱ a̱buki. Vu yuwan ankuri vu ca a̱ tsu agbashi a̱ wu, nu ulobo wa̱ wu Da̱wuda, ilyalya i na va̱a̱ tsura̱a̱ a̱ tsu suru.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 25:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 25:9" />Ana olobo a̱ Da̱wuda a rawai, a̱vu a damma Nabal ili i nda suru na ala a̱ Da̱wuda, reve o puro u usuwu wa̱ a̱ yi.<verse eid="1SA 25:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 25:10" />A̱vu Nabal usu le, &lt;&lt;Zane ɗa Da̱wuda nda'a? Zane ɗa ulobo wa̱ Yese nda? Agbashi na̱ a̱bunda̱ a suma ta̱ diga uba̱ta̱ wa azagbain e le a rana nda. <verse eid="1SA 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 25:11" />Nye i zuwai maa tara opopofu a̱ va̱ na̱ mini, ni inama i na m paɗai adama a̱za̱ e ipuna i va̱, reve n ca ama a na o uta̱i diga uba̱ta̱ u na n revei shi?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 25:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 25:12" />Ɗaɗa olobo a̱ Da̱wuda'a a vadalai a̱ ka̱mba̱. Ana a rawai a̱vu a damma yi ili ya nda suru. <verse eid="1SA 25:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 25:13" />A̱vu Da̱wuda damma ama a̱ yi, &lt;&lt;Za suru wu nla̱ matsun me pe'eni ma̱ yi!&gt;&gt; Ɗaɗa a̱ nla̱i mutsun mu pe'eni n le, a̱vu Da̱wuda fo nla̱ matsun me pe'eni ma̱ yi. A̱vu ali ukpakuna̱shi (400) a̱ ka̱ra̱ oɓolo na̱ Da̱wuda, reve ali ukpakure (200) e isawan ipiri yi itana i le.<verse eid="1SA 25:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 25:14" />A̱vu aagbashi a̱ ta̱ a Nabal a damma Abigel ka va Nabal, &lt;&lt;Da̱wuda lyungu ta̱ nlingata diga a̱tsumona a̱ ta̱wa̱ adama a na a̱ ca̱sa̱ zagbain tsu, amma a̱vu u gbarana le. <verse eid="1SA 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 25:15" />A̱yi ɗa nda ama a nda a̱ da̱na̱ ta̱ na̱ a̱ɓula̱ e ekere a̱ tsu lon. A yuwaan tsu iwuya shi, mantsa ma na tsu da̱na̱i alyuna a atsusa zuzu ne ele, ko ili ta̱ i tsu i puwa̱n shi. <verse eid="1SA 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 25:16" />Ayin nu urana o o'wo ta̱ ukari u na u gesheshe n tsu, mantsa ma na tsu uta̱i alyuna e mgbele i tsu zuzu ne ele. <verse eid="1SA 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 25:17" />Gogo she vu yuwan majiyan ve ene ili i na va yuwan, adama a na addama a̱ shiton ta̱ zagbain tsu nu u'wa wa̱ yi suru. A̱yi vuma vama ɗa, na ko za aa gura yuwaan yi adanshi shi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 25:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 25:18" />Agba Abigel jika̱ ta̱, a̱vu u tara akpatali o opopofu ukpakure (200) na̱ tsa̱n vu kwan masayan ma̱ ina̱bi ejere, ni ikyon i ton i na a lapulai ɗe, na̱ ishina yu uzuwun u makundatsu ushin, na̱ ogbodolu o u'yewu ukpaku (100) u muwun n ina̱bi, na akala o u'yewu u muwun mu ubiri ukpakure (200), a̱vu u zuwa le o nloli. <verse eid="1SA 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 25:19" />Reve u damma agbashi a̱ yi, &lt;&lt;Walai elime n ta̱ kuru ɗu.&gt;&gt; Agba u damma vali va̱ yi Nabal shi.<verse eid="1SA 25:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 25:20" />A̱yi a mmalu zuva mololi, a na u rawai e ikyun i masasan, a̱vu we ne Da̱wuda na ama a̱ yi a̱ za̱luwusa̱ a̱ tyo ya̱'a̱ yi, reve u ga'an ne ele. <verse eid="1SA 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 25:21" />Da̱wuda damma ta̱ ɗe, &lt;&lt;Ulinga we pere u ɗa n yuwain a na n pirishi yi itana i vuma nda Nabal a̱tsumona suru, adama she ili i ta̱ ya̱ yi i puwa̱n wan. A̱vu u tsupa mu ni iwuya o una̱ wi isa'ani. <verse eid="1SA 25:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 25:22" />Lyawa A̱sulazuva a ca mu a̱tsuma̱lima̱ lon a̱mu Da̱wuda, na̱ lyawa vali ta̱ wuma kafu usana u tawa!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 25:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 25:23" />Ana Abigel enei Da̱wuda a̱vu u jika̱ u cipa̱ o mololi a̱vu u kingyo u ka̱ɗa̱to urewesu wa̱ yi e iɗa a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ a̱ yi. <verse eid="1SA 25:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 25:24" />A̱vu u riya̱ a ana a̱ yi reve u damma, &lt;&lt;Zagbain va̱ lyawa unusu'u wo o'wo za va̱ goon, yuwan ankuri vu lyawa aagbashi a̱ wu a yuwan adanshi na̱ a̱vu, uwwa ili i na maa damma wu. <verse eid="1SA 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 25:25" />Yuwan ankuri zagbain va̱ she poloo adanshi a vuma vama nda Nabal atsuvu wan. U ta̱ tsa aala a̱yi. Aala a̱ yi ulo u ɗa, waru tsulo tsa̱ ta̱ oɓolo na̱ a̱ yi. Amma adama a̱ va̱, aagbashi a̱ wu, me ene o olobo a na zagbain va̱ lyungu yi shi.<verse eid="1SA 25:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 25:26" />&lt;&lt;Gogo zagbain va̱, n kucuna ta̱ na̱ A̱sulazuva a na a̱ ri wuma na̱ wuma wa̱ wu, a na wo o'woi A̱sulazuva a putsa nuwu na voo oco mpasa, ko vu tsupaa aciya̱wu ne ekere a̱ wu, lyawa n'yuwatan ma̱ wu na aza a na a zama a amaton wu zagbain va̱ o o'wo tsa Nabal. <verse eid="1SA 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 25:27" />Waru lyawa une'e u nda, za na aagbashi a̱ wu a̱ ta̱wa̱yi zagbain va̱, a ca ama a na a̱ kuru nuwu. <verse eid="1SA 25:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 25:28" />M pati wu ta̱ vu yuwaan aagbashi a̱ wu gafura n na̱ n yuwaan ta̱ unusu biti, adama a na A̱sulazuva a ta zuwa u'wa wa̱ wu u shuwa̱ na amayun hali hali, adama a na zagbain va̱ ta yuwusan nla̱ngi mu uvon wa̱ A̱sulazuva, waru a̱a̱ tsura̱ iwuya ya̱'a̱ wu shi, suru a mantsa ma wuma ma̱ wu. <verse eid="1SA 25:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 25:29" />Ko na wo o'woi za ro ta gbagbusa wu e izami i wuma wa̱ wu adama wu una wu, wuma wu zagbain va̱ ta̱ da̱na̱ gbaga ukatalu a̱tsuma̱ o oɓolo a aza a wuma a̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ wu. Amma wuma wu n'yuwatan ma̱ wu a̱ ta̱ vuta̱la̱ le cine a̱ tsu vuta̱la̱ aatali a̱ a̱bitsutsu. <verse eid="1SA 25:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 25:30" />Mantsa ma na A̱sulazuva a shitowoyi zagbain va̱ nzuwulai mi ili isa'ani i na u yuwain suru adama a̱ yi waru a̱vu u zuwa yi zagbain a aci ya aza a Isra'ila, <verse eid="1SA 25:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1SA 25:31" />zagbain va̱ a̱ da̱na̱ na̱ a̱tsuma̱la̱ngu ko udamotowu o okolo adama o wocosu wu mpasa shi, she vu tsupaa aciya̱wu wan. Waru na̱ A̱sulazuva o roco zagbain va̱ isa'ani, vu cuwan na̱ a̱mu aagbashi a̱ wu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 25:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1SA 25:32" />A̱vu Da̱wuda damma Abigel, &lt;&lt;Za va aba'un ɗa A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a Isra'ila, za na lyungu nuwu ana'an vu ga'asan na̱ a̱mu. <verse eid="1SA 25:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1SA 25:33" />Lyawa vu da̱na̱ na aba'un adama o uge'etosu u sa'ani wa̱ wu, waru a na vu 'yasan numu na̱ wocosu wu mpasa, waru she n tsupaa aciya̱va̱ ne ekere a̱ va̱ wan. <verse eid="1SA 25:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1SA 25:34" />Na̱ ne shi, n kucuna ta̱ na̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a Isra'ila a na a̱ ri wuma, za na putsa numu na ma amaton wu, na̱ shi a damma vu jika̱ vu ta̱wa̱ vu ga'asan na̱ a̱mu shi, babu ko vali ta̱ o u'wa wa Nabal na asa wuma kafu usana.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 25:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1SA 25:35" />A̱vu Da̱wuda ushi ili i na u ta̱wa̱a̱ niyi, a̱vu u damma, &lt;&lt;Ka̱mba̱ o u'wa na̱ nden ma asuvu. Mu uwwa ta̱ adanshi a̱ wu waru n usu ta̱ ipati ya̱ wu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 25:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1SA 25:36" />Ana Abigel ka̱mba̱i ya Nabal, a̱yi pe a̱tsuma̱ o u'wa a yuwusan a̱buki, tsa̱ a̱buki o tsugono, u da̱na̱ ta̱ a uwwusa uyo'o, waru usowu lon. Agba u damma yi adama shi hali she nu usana. <verse eid="1SA 25:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1SA 25:37" />Nu usana, ana usowu'u wu uta̱i Nabal, a̱vu ka va̱ yi damma yi ili ya nda suru, reve okolo a̱ yi a kuɗa nu uta̱, a̱vu u von kpa̱ka̱ tsa aatali. <verse eid="1SA 25:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1SA 25:38" />Ana a yuwain rana kupa a̱vu A̱sulazuva a faba Nabal, a̱vu u kuwa̱.<verse eid="1SA 25:38" /></para>
  <para style="s">Da̱wuda na̱ Abigel a yuwan ta̱ lolo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1SA 25:39" />Ana Da̱wuda uwwai a na Nabal kuwa̱ ta̱, a̱vu u damma, &lt;&lt;Za va aba'un ɗa A̱sulazuva a na a tsupaa numu wisulusa u na n tsura̱i o ukere wa Nabal waru u putsa ta̱ aagbashi a̱ yi a yuwan iwuya. A̱sulazuva a̱ ka̱mbuwa̱a̱ ta̱ Nabal ni iwuya ya̱ yi a aci a̱ yi.&gt;&gt; A̱vu Da̱wuda lyungu adanshi a̱ tyo ya Abigel, a damma yi u ciga ta̱ wo o'wo ka va̱ yi.<verse eid="1SA 25:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="1SA 25:40" />Ana agbashi a̱ Da̱wuda a̱ 'ya̱wa̱i uba̱ta̱ wa Abigel ɗe Kame reve a damma yi, &lt;&lt;Da̱wuda ɗa lyungu ntsu tsu tara wu vo o'wo ka va̱ yi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 25:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1SA 25:41" />A̱vu u ka̱ɗa̱to urewesu wa̱ yi a̱ tyo e iɗa reve u damma, &lt;&lt;Apa a̱mu aagbashi a̱ wu ufoɓu u na maa yuwaan wu a̱ga̱nda̱, reve n sa'a ana a agbashi a zagbain va̱.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 25:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1SA 25:42" />A̱vu Abigel jika̱ u 'yon u kumba mololi na agbashi e esheli o ton aza a na a yuwusaan yi ulinga a mmalu ana. A̱vu u toni nlingata ma̱ Da̱wuda reve wo o'wo ka va̱ yi. <verse eid="1SA 25:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1SA 25:43" />A̱vu Da̱wuda zuwisa ka na a̱ tsu ɗe Ahinowam diga Yezireyel, a̱vu ele ra o o'wo a̱ma̱ci a̱ yi. <verse eid="1SA 25:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1SA 25:44" />Amma Shawulu ca ta̱ usheli wa̱ yi Mikal, ka va̱ Da̱wuda ya Palti ulobo wa Layish vuma va Galim, wo'o ka va̱ yi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">25:44 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ka̱lyuwa̱: 2 Sam 3:14-16.</char></note><verse eid="1SA 25:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="1SA 26" />
  <para style="s">Da̱wuda lyawisa ta̱ Shawulu wuma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 26:1" />A̱vu a ama a Zif a̱ 'ya̱wa̱ uba̱ta̱ wa Shawulu ɗe Gibiya a̱vu a damma yi, &lt;&lt;Da̱wuda ta̱ ɗe uva̱pu agaɗi a Hakila, za na a̱ ka̱lyuwusa̱ Jeshimon.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ka̱lyuwa̱: Ica 54 Aciya adanshi e ishipa.</char></note><verse eid="1SA 26:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 26:2" />Ɗaɗa Shawulu ka̱ra̱i a̱cipa̱ a̱ tyo A̱tsumona a Zif oɓolo na ali o uvon ukpakukupa uta'atsu (3,000) aza a Isra'ila a na u ɗangulai, adama a zami ɗe Da̱wuda. <verse eid="1SA 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 26:3" />A̱vu Shawulu yuwan uva̱la̱ta̱ wa̱ yi zuzu nu ure zuva va aagaɗi a Hakila a̱ ka̱lyuwusa̱ Jeshimon, amma Da̱wuda da̱na̱ ta̱ nden a̱tsumona'a. Ana wu uwwai ana Shawulu ta̱wa̱ ta̱ izami ya̱ yi, <verse eid="1SA 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 26:4" />a̱vu u lyungu aza a na aa tawa utyo, a̱vu gba e ene amayun a ɗa Shawulu ta̱ lo oɓolo na ali o uvon yi.<verse eid="1SA 26:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 26:5" />Reve Da̱wuda 'yon u 'ya̱wa̱ uba̱ta̱ u na Shawulu va̱la̱i, a̱vu we ene uba̱ta̱ u na Shawulu na̱ Abna ulobo wa Ner, yali ya̱ a̱soja a̱ yi, o voyin. Shawulu da̱na̱ ta̱ pe nven e memere mo uva̱la̱ta̱, reve ali o uvo'on o von uka̱nda̱ruwu na̱ a̱yi a nlavu.<verse eid="1SA 26:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 26:6" />Reve Da̱wuda damma Ahimele za va Hitiya, na̱ Abishai mawun ma̱ a̱na̱wun ma Yowab za na mma le ɗa Zeruya, &lt;&lt;Zane ɗa a̱ kuru mu a̱ 'ya̱wa̱ o uva̱la̱ta̱ uba̱ta̱ wa Shawulu?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 26:6">A̱vu Abishai usu, &lt;&lt;N ta̱ 'ya̱wa̱ oɓolo na̱ a̱vu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 26:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 26:7" />Ɗaɗa Da̱wuda na̱ Abishai a̱ 'ya̱wa̱i o uva̱la̱ta̱ wa Shawulu na ayin, a̱vu a cina yi a nlavu, ni ibata ya̱ yi usapu e iɗa zuzu na aaci a̱ yi. Abna gba oɓolo na akapi ali o uvo'on a̱ da̱na̱ ta̱ nven uka̱nda̱ruwa̱ na̱ a̱ yi.<verse eid="1SA 26:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 26:8" />Reve Abishai damma Da̱wuda, &lt;&lt;Ana'an A̱sula̱ a ca ta̱ ma'yuwatan ma̱ wu o ukere wa̱ wu. Gogo lyawa mu n ya̱wa̱ n sapa yi usapu u ta̱ ni ibata ya̱ yi n ɓolo yi ni iɗa, n ciga n sapa yi ure shi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 26:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 26:9" />Amma a̱vu Da̱wuda damma Abishai, &lt;&lt;She vu una yi wan! Zane ɗa a̱a̱ 'ya̱sa̱n ukere u ju'wa̱n vuma na A̱sulazuva a tawai a̱vu u da̱na̱ babu unusu?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 26:10" />A̱vu Da̱wuda damma, &lt;&lt;N kucuna ta̱ na̱ A̱sulazuva a na a̱ ri wuma, A̱sulazuva na aciya̱yi a̱yi ɗa woo kototo yi, ko urana wa̱ yi u ta̱wa̱ a na wa̱a̱ kuwa̱, ko u 'ya̱wa̱ uba̱ta̱ o uvon a̱vu u kuwa̱ ɗe. <verse eid="1SA 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 26:11" />Amma A̱sulazuva a paraa mu n 'ya̱sa̱n ukere u va̱ n ju'wa̱n za na A̱sulazuva a̱ tsuwa̱yin mani'in. Gogo vu tara ibata i na i ri uba̱ta̱ a aaci a̱ yi na̱ medele ma̱ mini a̱vu vu ta̱wa̱ tsu wala.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 26:12" />Ɗaɗa Da̱wuda tarai ibata na̱ medele ma̱ mini ma na ma̱ ri zuzu na aaci a Shawulu, reve a̱ ka̱ra̱. Babu za na ene nle ko revei ili i na i farai, ko za ro juwan, adama a na suru nle nlavu ma̱ a̱ru'un diga uba̱ta̱ wa̱ A̱sulazuva ma̱pura̱ le ta̱.<verse eid="1SA 26:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 26:13" />Reve Da̱wuda ka̱ra̱ a̱ tyo mavada mo uka̱ri ma̱ ndeɗe, a̱vu u kumba aagaɗi o ro za na ri akasu nu uba̱ta̱ u na Shawulu no oɓolo ali o uvon a̱ yi ri. A̱ba̱jini agalaci a̱ da̱na̱ ta̱ e memere me ele. <verse eid="1SA 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 26:14" />A̱vu Da̱wuda salaa ali o uvon na̱ Abna ulobo wa Ner, a̱vu u damma, &lt;&lt;Vu ta uwusa mu Abna?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 26:14">Reve Abna usu, &lt;&lt;Zane ɗa a̱vu za na e ɗesu a damatosun mogono tsun nda?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 26:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 26:15" />Reve Da̱wuda damma Abna, &lt;&lt;A̱vu vali ɗa, ko ne ɗa shi? Zane ɗa ri tsa̱ wu a̱tsuma̱ ali o uvon a Isra'ila? Nye i zuwai vu piriyi zagbain va̱ wu mogono ulobonu shi? Adama a na za ro ta̱wa̱ ta̱ adama wu una mogono zagbain va̱ wu. <verse eid="1SA 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 26:16" />Ili i na vu yuwain u lobono shi. N kucuna ta̱ na̱ A̱sulazuva a na a̱ ri wuma, a̱vu na ali o uvon a̱ wu i 'yuwan i kuwa̱, adama a na i piriyi zagbain ɗu ulobonu shi, za na A̱sulazuva a̱ tsuwa̱yin mani'in. Ka̱lyuwa̱i a̱ te ɗa ibata i mogono na̱ medele ma̱ mini ma na ma̱ ri zuzu na aaci a̱ yi?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 26:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 26:17" />Shawulu reve ta̱ uɗyo wa̱ Da̱wuda a̱vu u damma, &lt;&lt;Uɗyo wa̱ wu u ɗa nda'a ulobo u va̱ Da̱wuda?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 26:17">A̱vu Da̱wuda usu, &lt;&lt;Ee a̱mu ɗa zagbain va̱ mogono.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 26:18" />A̱vu Da̱wuda lyuwa elime na adanshi u damma, &lt;&lt;Nye i zuwai zagbain va̱ a gbagbusa aagbashi a̱ yi? Nye i ɗa n yuwain, waru iwuya i ne ɗa i ri e ekere a̱ va̱? <verse eid="1SA 26:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 26:19" />Gogo lyawa zagbain va̱ mogono ma uwwa adanshi a aagbashi a̱ yi. Ko na̱ shi A̱sulazuva a ɗa a zuwa nuwu vu yuwan upan adama a̱ va̱, to lyawa u ushi kucci. Amma na ama ɗa a zuwai, lyawa a yuwaan le una̱ a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ a̱ A̱sulazuva! Adama a na a̱ gba̱ra̱ mu ta̱ ana'an adama a na ma̱ tsura̱ akunda a̱tsuma̱ agadu A̱sulazuva, a dansaa, &lt;Ya̱wa̱ vu yuwaan musula̱ n ro a̱ga̱nda̱.&gt; <verse eid="1SA 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 26:20" />Gogo she vu lyawa mpasa n va̱ mo oco e iɗa alanga na̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ A̱sulazuva wan. Nye i zuwai mogono ma Isra'ila ma̱ ri ya̱ izami i na wo una aakupa tsa a̱ va̱? Cine tsu ɗa va yuwan ugenge u va̱ tsa matsulu a nsasan?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 26:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 26:21" />Ɗaɗa Shawulu dammai, &lt;&lt;N yuwan ta̱ unusu, ka̱mba̱ Da̱wuda ulobo u va̱, ma yuwan wu iwiya waru shi, adama a na vu tara ta̱ wuma u va̱ na̱ a̱ɓula̱ ana'an. Amayun n yuwan ta̱ tsulo, waru ni ili yu uwuyanu lon!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 26:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 26:22" />A̱vu Da̱wuda usu, &lt;&lt;Apa nda ibata i mogono, lyawa za ta̱ a̱tsuma̱ ali o uvon a̱ wu u ta̱wa̱ u ushi yi. <verse eid="1SA 26:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 26:23" />A̱sulazuva a tsu zuwaa ta̱ koyan aba'un o una̱ wa̱ a̱ɓula̱ a̱ yi na amayun a̱ yi. A̱sulazuva a ca wu ta̱ e ekere a̱ va̱ ana'an, amma ma̱a̱ 'ya̱sa̱n ukere n ju'wa̱n za na A̱sulazuva a̱ tsuwa̱yin mani'in shi. <verse eid="1SA 26:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 26:24" />A̱yi ɗa nda, cine wuma wa̱ wu u ri ulobonu ana'an e esu a̱ va̱, ne ɗa lyawa wuma u va̱ u da̱na̱ ulobonu o urewesu wa̱ A̱sulazuva, waru lyawa u wawa mu a̱tsuma̱ a addama suru!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 26:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 26:25" />Ɗaɗa Shawulu dammai Da̱wuda, &lt;&lt;Lyawa vu da̱na̱ na aba'un ulobo u va̱ Da̱wuda, vu ta yuwan ili na̱ a̱bunda̱ waru na amayun vu ta lyuwa aci e le.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 26:25">Ɗaɗa Da̱wuda remei ure wa̱ yi, a̱vu Shawulu ka̱mba̱ o u'wa.<verse eid="1SA 26:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="1SA 27" />
  <para style="s">Da̱wuda suma ta̱ a̱ tyo ya a aza a Filistiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 27:1" />Reve Da̱wuda yuwan majiyan o okolo a̱ yi, &lt;&lt;Urana u ro n ta̱ kuwa̱ o ukere wa Shawulu. Ili i na i la'aa numu a na ma yuwan a̱yi ɗa n suma a̱ tyo e iɗa ya aza a Filistiya. Shawulu ta lyawa izami i va̱ uba̱ta̱ suru a̱tsuma̱ a pasu vi iɗa ya Isra'ila, waru n ta la'a o ukere wa̱ yi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 27:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 27:2" />Ɗaɗa Da̱wuda na ali o uvon a̱ yi ukpakuta̱li (600) a na a̱ ri oɓolo na̱ a̱yi a̱ ka̱ra̱i, a̱vu a̱ tyo mavada uba̱ta̱ wa Akish ulobo wa Mawok, mogono ma Gat. <verse eid="1SA 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 27:3" />A̱vu Da̱wuda na ali o uvon a̱ yi a̱ da̱nu a̱tsuma̱ a Gat oɓolo na̱ Akish. Za suru da̱na̱ ta̱ oɓolo nu u'wa wa̱ yi, waru Da̱wuda da̱na̱ ta̱ oɓolo na̱ a̱ma̱ci e re a̱ yi Ahinowam za va Yezireyel na̱ Abigel za va Kame, ma̱runa̱ ma Nabal. <verse eid="1SA 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 27:4" />Agba ana a dammai Shawulu Da̱wuda suma ta̱ a̱ tyo Gat, u da̱shi zami yi shi.<verse eid="1SA 27:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 27:5" />Uranu u ro reve Da̱wuda damma Akish, &lt;&lt;Na̱ n tsura̱ isa'ani e esu a̱ wu, lyawa vu ca mu uba̱ta̱ u ro a̱tsuma̱ a̱ mulyuci vi iɗa'a, adama n da̱nu ɗe. Adama a̱ nye a ɗa aagbashi a̱ wu a̱ da̱nu a̱ lyuci tsugono oɓolo na̱ vu?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 27:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 27:6" />Ne ɗa o urana u ndolo Akish ca niyi Ziklag, a̱yi ɗa i zuwai Ziklag wo o'woi za vu ngono ma Yahuda hali na ana'an. <verse eid="1SA 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 27:7" />Da̱wuda da̱nu ta̱ e iɗa ya Filistiya aa'wan a̱ ta̱ na̱ woto na̱shi.<verse eid="1SA 27:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 27:8" />A̱tsuma̱ a rana vu nden ma̱ a̱ yi a̱tsuma̱ a Ziklag, Da̱wuda tsu u ta̱ ta̱ na ali o uvon a̱ yi adama a̱ riya̱a̱ aza a Geshura nu uvon, na aza a Girzi na aza a Amaleka. Ɗe nu ufaru ama a nda a ɗa a fara da̱nuyi e iɗa'a, diga upasu wa̱ Shur, hali a cina Masar. <verse eid="1SA 27:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 27:9" />Mantsa ma na suru Da̱wuda riya̱a̱ nle nu uvon, u tsu lyawa vali ko ka wuma shi, amma u tsu pura̱ ta̱ mgbele ni inan, na̱ nloli, na arakumi, ni itana yu otosu. Reve u ka̱mba̱ ya Akish.<verse eid="1SA 27:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 27:10" />Na̱ Akish ece yi, &lt;&lt;Te ɗa vu 'ya̱wa̱i uvon ana'an?&gt;&gt; Da̱wuda tsu damma yi ta̱, &lt;&lt;Uba̱ta̱ wa Nege wu upasu wa Yahuda,&gt;&gt; ko, &lt;&lt;Uba̱ta̱ wa Nege wu upasu wa aza a Yerameyel,&gt;&gt; ko, &lt;&lt;Uba̱ta̱ wa Nege wu upasu wa̱ a̱za̱ a̱ Keni.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 27:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 27:11" />Da̱wuda tsu lyawa vali ko ka wuma shi, adama a na she ta̱wa̱ a̱ 'ya̱wa̱ nu dammu a̱tsuma̱ a Gat a damma, &lt;&lt;Apa ili i na Da̱wuda yuwain&gt;&gt; wan. A̱yi ɗa ili i na u yuwusain mantsa ma na u da̱na̱i nden e iɗa ya aza a Filistiya suru. <verse eid="1SA 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 27:12" />A̱vu Akish lyawaa Da̱wuda okolo, a̱vu u damma aciya̱yi, &lt;&lt;Wo o'wo ta̱ ili yi idaba lon uba̱ta̱ wa ama a̱ yi, aza a Isra'ila, adama wo o'wo aagbashi a̱ va̱ hali hali.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 27:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="1SA 28" />
  <para style="s">Shawulu na̱ ka na o ɓoloso aci na̱ ruhu va̱ a̱kwa̱kwa̱</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 28:1" />A rana ndolo aza a Filistiya o ɓoloto ta̱ ali o uvon e le adama o uvon, adama a yuwan uvon na aza a Isra'ila. A̱vu mogono Akish damma Da̱wuda, &lt;&lt;Vu reve a na a̱vu na ali o uvon a̱ wu i to uta̱ oɓolo na̱ a̱mu, na ali o uvon a̱ va̱ adama o uvon.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 28:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 28:2" />Reve Da̱wuda damma, &lt;&lt;U lobono ta̱, vu te ene ili i na aagbashi a̱ wu aa gura.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 28:2">Reve Akish damma Da̱wuda, &lt;&lt;U lobono ta̱, n ta̱ ka̱mbuwa̱ wu za vi ipiri va̱ a mantsa ma wuma u va̱.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 28:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 28:3" />Gogo Sama'ila kuwa̱ ta̱ ɗe, a̱vu aza a Isra'ila suru a yuwan nden n wiruta̱ adama a̱ yi, a̱vu a̱ ciɗo yi a̱ lyuci va̱ yi ɗe Rama. Shawulu gba̱ra̱ ta̱ ɗe aza a na o ɓoloso aci na̱ ruhu va̱ a̱kwa̱kwa̱ na̱ a̱za̱ a̱ yindi e iɗa'a.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">28:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ka̱lyuwa̱: 1 Sam 25:1; N.Gn 20:27; U.Wl 18:10-11.</char></note><verse eid="1SA 28:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 28:4" />Reve aza a Filistiya o ɓoloto aciya̱le reve a yuwan uva̱la̱ta̱ zuzu na̱ lyuci va Shunem, Shawulu gba shi u ɓoloto ta̱ suru ali o uvon a Isra'ila, a̱vu a yuwan uva̱la̱ta̱ u le a Masasan ma Gilbowa. <verse eid="1SA 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 28:5" />Ana Shawulu enei ali o uvon a Filistiya, reve okolo a̱ yi e je'en na̱ wovon lon. <verse eid="1SA 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 28:6" />Waru a na Shawulu patiyi A̱sulazuva, A̱sulazuva a̱ usu yi shi, ko uba̱ta̱ wa alavu, ko na̱ Urim, ko uba̱ta̱ wa ama̱sula̱. <verse eid="1SA 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 28:7" />Reve Shawulu damma agbashi a̱ yi, &lt;&lt;Zamiya numu ka na o ɓoloso aci na̱ ruhu va̱ a̱kwa̱kwa̱, adama n 'ya̱wa̱ ya̱'a̱ yi me ece yi ili i na maa yuwan.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 28:7">A̱vu agbashi a̱ yi a damma yi, &lt;&lt;Za ro ta̱ ɗe En Do.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 28:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 28:8" />Ɗaɗa Shawulu pusa̱n yi iroci ya̱ yi a̱vu wo oto itana i ro, reve na ayin a̱yi na ama e re a̱ ka̱ra̱ a̱ 'ya̱wa̱ uba̱ta̱ a ka'a a̱vu u damma yi, &lt;&lt;Ece we mu ruhu vu za na kuwa̱i vu ta̱wa̱a̱ mu na̱ za na suru mee ɗe aala a̱ yi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 28:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 28:9" />Amma ka'a u damma yi ta̱, &lt;&lt;Amayun vu reve ta̱ ili i na Shawulu yuwain. U gba̱ra̱ ta̱ aza a na o ɓoloso aci na̱ ruhu va̱ a̱kwa̱kwa̱ na̱ a̱za̱ a̱ yindi a̱tsuma̱ e iɗa'a. Adama a̱ nye vaa azuwayi wuma u va̱ maza, adama vu zuwa o una mu?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 28:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 28:10" />Shawulu kucinaa yi ta̱ na̱ A̱sulazuva, &lt;&lt;N kucina ta̱ na̱ A̱sulazuva a na a̱ ri wuma, aa ca wu a̱tsuma̱lima̱ adama a nda shi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 28:11" />Reve ka'a u damma, &lt;&lt;Zane ɗa ma̱a̱ ta̱wa̱a̱ wu?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 28:11">A̱vu u damma, &lt;&lt;Ta̱wa̱a̱ mu na̱ Sama'ila.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 28:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 28:12" />Ana ka'a we enei Sama'ila a̱vu wo oruwo lon a̱vu u damma Shawulu, &lt;&lt;Nye i zuwai vu luluma̱ numu? Ashe a̱vu ɗa mogono Shawulu!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 28:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 28:13" />Reve mogono'o u damma yi, &lt;&lt;She vu uwwa wovon wan. Nye i ɗa ve enei?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 28:13">A̱vu ka'a u damma, &lt;&lt;Me ene ta̱ za ro tsa ma̱sula̱ o uta̱sa̱ diga e iɗa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 28:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 28:14" />A̱vu we ece yi, &lt;&lt;Nye i ɗa oroci a̱ yi?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 28:14">Reve u usu, &lt;&lt;Abara a ɗa me enei a̱ ta̱wa̱ woto wu nu utugu.&gt;&gt; Ɗaɗa Shawulu revei a na Sama'ila ɗa, a̱vu u kingyo u ka̱ɗa̱to urewesu wa̱ yi a̱ tyo we iɗa.<verse eid="1SA 28:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 28:15" />Reve Sama'ila damma Shawulu, &lt;&lt;Nye i zuwai vu damaton numu a na vu ta̱wa̱to numu?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 28:15">A̱vu Shawulu usu, &lt;&lt;N ta̱ pe a̱tsuma̱ a̱tsuma̱lima̱ lon, aza a Filistiya a ta yuwusan uvon na̱ a̱mu waru A̱sula̱ a vadalaa mu ta̱ ucina̱. U da̱shi usu mu shi, ko uba̱ta̱ wa ama̱sula̱ ko uba̱ta̱ wa alavu shi. Adama o ndolo n ɗe wu ta̱ vu damma mu ili i na maa yuwan.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 28:16" />Reve Sama'ila damma, &lt;&lt;Nye i zuwai ve ece numu, a na wo o'woi A̱sulazuva a vadalaa nuwu ucina̱, a̱vu wo o'wo ma'yuwatan ma̱ wu? <verse eid="1SA 28:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 28:17" />A̱sulazuva a yuwan ta̱ na̱ a̱vu cine u dammai o una̱ u va̱. A̱sulazuva a kara ta̱ tsugono diga e ekere a̱ wu a̱vu u ca moron ma̱ wu Da̱wuda.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">28:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ka̱lyuwa̱: 1 Sam 15:28.</char></note> <verse eid="1SA 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 28:18" />Adama a na vu yuwan tsutoni nu uɗyo wa̱ A̱sulazuva shi, a na vu kuɗa̱i o kototo aza a Amaleka aza a na u da̱na̱i a uwwusa upan u le lon,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">28:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ka̱lyuwa̱: 1 Sam 15:3-9.</char></note> a̱yi ɗa i zuwai A̱sulazuva a yuwaan nuwu ili ya nda ana'an. <verse eid="1SA 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 28:19" />Babu na̱ ne, A̱sulazuva a ta ca ali o uvon a Isra'ila oɓolo na̱ a̱vu e ekere a aza a Filistiya, waru nfa'an a̱vu no olobo a̱ wu i ta̱ da̱na̱ oɓolo na̱ a̱mu. A̱sulazuva a ta ca ali o uvon a Isra'ila suru e ekere a aza a Filistiya.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 28:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 28:20" />Ɗaɗa Shawulu rishiyi nu uta̱ wudaruwu e iɗa, tapu nu wovon adama a adanshi a Sama'ila. Waru u da̱na̱ nu ucira shi, adama a na u lyuwai ili i ro shi urana na ayin o ndolo suru.<verse eid="1SA 28:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 28:21" />Ana ka'a ta̱wa̱i ya Shawulu, waru ana we enei u ta̱ e meje'en lon, reve u damma yi, &lt;&lt;A̱yi ɗa nda aagbashi a̱ wu a yuwaan wu ta̱ tsutoni. N ca ta̱ wuma u va̱ adama n yuwan ili i na vu damma numu. <verse eid="1SA 28:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 28:22" />Gogo yuwan ankuri vu uwwa aagbashi a̱ wu. Waru vu lyawa n ca wu ilyalya tsura̱ vu lyuwa adama vu tsura̱ ucira u na va̱a̱ ka̱mba̱.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 28:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 28:23" />A̱vu u 'yuwan u damma, &lt;&lt;Maa lyuwa ili i ro shi.&gt;&gt; Amma agbashi a̱ yi a kamba ta̱ ka'a a patishi yi, reve wu uwwa adanshi e le. Ɗaɗa u yoyin diga e iɗa a̱vu u da̱nu a̱ a̱ga̱da̱.<verse eid="1SA 28:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 28:24" />Ka'a u shi ta̱ na̱ ma̱dindim ma̱ lipu o u'wa, ɗaɗa u jika̱ tara u paɗa yi, a̱vu u tara yira u lapa, reve u yuwaan yi opopofu a na a̱ ri na̱ wolilo shi. <verse eid="1SA 28:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 28:25" />Ɗaɗa u delyo wa̱ yi Shawulu na̱ agbashi a̱ yi, a̱vu a tama. Ɗaɗa a̱ 'yoyin a̱ ka̱ra̱i na ayin o ndolo.<verse eid="1SA 28:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="1SA 29" />
  <para style="s">Aza a Filistiya a 'yuwan ta̱ Da̱wuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 29:1" />Aza a Filistiya o ɓoloto ta̱ ali o uvon e le suru ɗe Afe, a̱vu aza a Isra'ila a̱ va̱la̱ a̱ lyusu mini a̱tsuma̱ a Yezireyel. <verse eid="1SA 29:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 29:2" />Mantsa ma na azagbain a aza a Filistiya a̱ ri a mmalu no oɓolo ali o uvon ukpaku na̱ ukpakukupa, Da̱wuda na ali o uvon a̱ yi a̱ da̱na̱ ta̱ o tono ele a mmalu a̱ca̱pa̱ oɓolo na̱ mogono Akish. <verse eid="1SA 29:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 29:3" />Nan yali o uvon a Filistiya a yuwan ta̱ yeci, &lt;&lt;Nye i ɗa Mmaci ma Ibrahim nda maa yuwusan pa?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 29:3">Reve Akish usu, &lt;&lt;Da̱wuda ɗa zana da̱na̱i aagbashi a Shawulu mogono ma Isra'ila. U ta̱ pa oɓolo na̱ a̱mu aa'wan aa'wan, waru diga urana u na wu kasai na̱ Shawulu a cina ana'an n tsura̱ yi nu unusu shi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 29:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 29:4" />Amma nan yali o uvon a Filistiya a yuwan ta̱ upan na̱ a̱yi a̱vu a damma yi, &lt;&lt;Ka̱mba̱to ɗe vuma nda, adama u ka̱mba̱ ɗe uba̱ta̱ u na vu ca niyi nda̱na̱ta̱. Wa̱a̱ 'ya̱wa̱ oɓolo na̱ a̱tsu uba̱ta̱ o uvon shi, ta̱wa̱ u ta̱wa̱ u vadalaa tsu mantsa mo uvon wan. U ta gura yuwan ulinga na̱ mantsa ma nda wu koɗo aci a̱tsu adama u yo'onoto Shawulu zagbain va̱ yi okolo. <verse eid="1SA 29:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 29:5" />Ashe Da̱wuda ɗa na a canaa yi ishipa nu uje'en a̱vu a cana,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="1SA 29:5" />
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 29:5">&lt;&lt; &lt;Shawulu una ta̱ ukpakukupa va̱ yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 29:5">waru Da̱wuda una ta̱ ukpakukupa kupa va̱ yi.&gt; &gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">29:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ka̱lyuwa̱: 1 Sam 18:7; 1 Sam 21:11.</char></note><verse eid="1SA 29:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 29:6" />Ɗaɗa Akish ɗeyi Da̱wuda reve u damma yi, &lt;&lt;N kucina ta̱ na̱ A̱sulazuva a na a̱ ri wuma, a̱vu za va̱ a̱ɓula̱ ɗa, waru shi ta̱ n ciga vu 'ya̱wa̱ uvon oɓolo na ali o uvon a̱ va̱. Adama a na diga urana u na vu ta̱wa̱i ya̱'a̱ va̱ a cina ana'an, n tsura̱ wu nu unusu shi, amma akapi azagbain a Filistiya a̱ usu wu shi. <verse eid="1SA 29:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 29:7" />To, gogo she vu vadala vu ka̱mba̱ na asuvu nden, she vu yuwan ili i na ya̱a̱ lungusa̱ okolo akapi azagbain a Filistiya wan.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 29:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 29:8" />A̱vu Da̱wuda ece yi, &lt;&lt;Amma nye i ɗa n yuwain? Unusu u ne u ɗa vu tsura̱i uba̱ta̱ wa aagbashi a̱ wu diga o urana u na n ta̱wa̱i ya̱'a̱ wu hali a cina ana'an? Nye i zuwai ma̱a̱ 'ya̱wa̱ n yuwan uvon na̱ n'yuwatan mu zagbain va̱ mogono shi?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 29:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 29:9" />A̱vu Akish usu yi reve u damma, &lt;&lt;N reve ta̱ vu ta̱ babu unusu na amayun a̱ wenu u va̱ tsa malingata ma̱ A̱sula̱, suru na̱ ne nan yali o uvon a Filistiya a damma ta̱, &lt;Wa̱a̱ 'ya̱wa̱ oɓolo na̱ a̱tsu uba̱ta̱ o uvon shi.&gt; <verse eid="1SA 29:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 29:10" />Gogo she vu 'yon nu usana, oɓolo na̱ agbashi a zagbain va̱ wu Shawulu aza a na a̱ ta̱wa̱i oɓolo na̱ a̱vu, a̱vu i ka̱ra̱ nu usana urana a̱ ma̱ɓa̱tsa̱a̱.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 29:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 29:11" />Ɗaɗa Da̱wuda na ali o uvon a̱ yi o uta̱i nu usana adama a̱ ka̱mba̱ e iɗa ya aza a Filistiya, reve aza a Filistiya a̱ ka̱ra̱ a̱ tyo Yezireyel.<verse eid="1SA 29:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="1SA 30" />
  <para style="s">Da̱wuda kototo ta̱ aza a Amaleka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 30:1" />Ana a yuwain rana ta'atsu, a mantsa ma na Da̱wuda oɓolo na ali o uvon a̱ yi a rawai a 'wa le a̱ lyuci va Ziklag, reve a cina oɓolo ali o uvon a Amaleka cina a̱ ta̱wa̱a̱ ozo o upasu we Nege na̱ Ziklag nu uvon hali a̱ kula̱to yi. <verse eid="1SA 30:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 30:2" />A̱vu e reme a̱ma̱ci na aza a na a̱ ri pe suru, mawun na̱ zagbain suru. Agba o una ko za shi, amma a̱ pura̱ le ta̱ a̱ ka̱ra̱.<verse eid="1SA 30:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 30:3" />Ana Da̱wuda na ali o uvon a̱ yi a rawai Ziklag, a̱vu a cina a̱ kula̱to yi ta̱ na akina waru a̱ma̱ci e le no olobo ne esheli e le a̱ pura̱ le ta̱. <verse eid="1SA 30:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 30:4" />Ɗaɗa Da̱wuda na ali o uvon a na a̱ ri oɓolo na̱ a̱yi a̱ shosuyin na̱ yisali lon hali a lamba ucira u na a̱a̱ shon. <verse eid="1SA 30:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 30:5" />A̱ pura̱ ta̱ fo a̱ma̱ci e re a̱ Da̱wuda, Ahinowam za va Yezireyel na̱ Abigel ma̱runa̱ ma Nabal va Kame.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">30:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ka̱lyuwa̱: 1 Sam 25:42-43.</char></note> <verse eid="1SA 30:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 30:6" />Waru Da̱wuda da̱na̱ ta̱ pe e meleshe lon, adama a na ali o uvon a̱ yi a yuwan ta̱ adanshi a na a vuvara yi na atali hali u kuwa̱, adama a na koyan da̱na̱ ta̱ o upan lon u na waa lamba o olobo ne esheli a̱ yi. Amma Da̱wuda ca ta̱ aciya̱yi adanshi adama a na u zuwa ta̱ ucira wa̱ yi e ekere a̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ yi.<verse eid="1SA 30:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 30:7" />Reve Da̱wuda damma Abiyata ganu, ulobo wa Ahimele, &lt;&lt;Ta̱wa̱a̱ mu na̱ epo.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">30:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ka̱lyuwa̱: 1 Sam 22:20-23.</char></note> Ɗaɗa Abiyata ta̱wa̱yi Da̱wuda na̱ epo. <verse eid="1SA 30:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 30:8" />Reve Da̱wuda ece A̱sulazuva, &lt;&lt;N saɓa oɓolo ali o uvon a na a̱ ta̱wa̱a̱ ntsu nu uvon u nda? N ta cina le?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 30:8">A̱vu u usu yi, &lt;&lt;Saɓa le adama a na na amayun vu ta cina le, reve vu usa suru ili i na a̱ pura̱ nuwu wi i ɗa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 30:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 30:9" />Ɗaɗa Da̱wuda uta̱i, na ali o uvon ukpakuta̱li (600) a na a̱ ri oɓolo na̱ a̱yi. Ana a rawai o Uka̱ri wa Beso, reve ozo o ro e le e isawan lo. <verse eid="1SA 30:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 30:10" />Amma Da̱wuda na ali o uvon ukpakuna̱shi (400) a lyuwa ta̱ elime na̱ masaɓa me le goon, adama a na ali o uvon ukpakure (200) a̱ kuna̱ ta̱ hali a gura pasa uka̱ri'i shi.<verse eid="1SA 30:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 30:11" />Ali a na a̱ da̱na̱i oɓolo na̱ Da̱wuda a̱ tsura̱ ta̱ vuma va Masar a atsusa reve a tara yi a̱ tyo ya̱ Da̱wuda. A̱vu a ca yi ilyalya u lyuwa, na̱ mini reve u sowo. <verse eid="1SA 30:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 30:12" />A̱vu a cayi abishi akala a̱ muwun mu ubiri o u'yewu, na̱ ogbodolu a̱ muwun n ina̱bi o u'yewu ejere. Waru a na u tamai reve ugbozu u ka̱mba̱ yi, adama a na u shi u lyuwa ilyalya ko u sowo mini shi a̱tsuma̱ arana ta'atsu na ayin a ta'atsu.<verse eid="1SA 30:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 30:13" />Reve Da̱wuda damma yi, &lt;&lt;Zane ɗa zagbain va̱ wu waru te ɗa vu uta̱i?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 30:13">Reve u usu, &lt;&lt;A̱mu vuma va Masar ɗa aagbashi a za va Amaleka. Zagbain va̱ lyawa mu ta̱ rana ta'atsu na ka̱ra̱i a na m banakain. <verse eid="1SA 30:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 30:14" />Tsu 'ya̱wa̱ ta̱ nu uvon upasu wa̱ Nege va aza a Keretiya na̱ upasu wa aza a Yahuda na̱ upasu wa̱ Nege va Keleb, a̱vu waru tsu kula̱to Ziklag.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 30:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 30:15" />A̱vu Da̱wuda damma yi, &lt;&lt;Vu ta gura tara mu a̱ cipa̱ uba̱ta̱ o oɓolo ali o uvon o ndolo?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 30:15">Reve u usu, &lt;&lt;Kucinaa mu na̱ A̱sula̱ a na voo una mu ko vu cawisan mu waru e ekere a zagbain va̱ shi, n ta tara wu a̱ tyo uba̱ta̱ u le.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 30:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 30:16" />A̱vu u tara yi a̱ 'ya̱wa̱, a̱vu a cina le ɗe ubetu'wu o upasu wi iɗa'a suru, a lyuwusa no osowi a uwusa uyo'o, adama a̱ a̱bunda̱ e itana i na a̱ pura̱i diga e iɗa ya aza a Filistiya na̱ diga e iɗa ya Yahuda. <verse eid="1SA 30:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 30:17" />Reve Da̱wuda riya̱a̱ le nu uvon diga urana a̱ ma̱riya̱ hali a cina nfa'an nu ulivu, waru babu vuma a̱tsuma̱ e le za na la'ai, she olobo ukpakuna̱shi (400) a na a kumbai arakumi a̱vu a suma. <verse eid="1SA 30:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 30:18" />Da̱wuda usa ta̱ ili i na suru aza a Amaleka a̱ shi a̱ pura̱i, oɓolo na̱ a̱ma̱ci e re a̱ yi. <verse eid="1SA 30:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 30:19" />Babu ili i na i puwa̱yin, ko mawun ko zagbain ko ulobo ko usheli, ko itana ko ili i ro i na a̱ shi a̱ pura̱i. Da̱wuda ka̱mbuwa̱ ta̱ ili'i suru. <verse eid="1SA 30:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 30:20" />U pura̱ ta̱ geru vu mgbele ni inan suru, a̱vu ali o uvon a̱ yi a guɓa le elime iliyamunga i le, a dansa, &lt;&lt;Ele ɗa ili i na Da̱wuda pura̱i uba̱ta̱ wu uvon.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 30:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 30:21" />Reve Da̱wuda ka̱mba̱ o Uka̱ri wa Beso a̱vu u cina ali o uvon ukpakure (200) a na a gura kuru niyi shi adama o ukunu, a̱vu a̱ ta̱wa̱ a ga'asan na̱ Da̱wuda oɓolo na ali o uvon a na a̱ ri oɓolo na̱ a̱yi. A mantsa ma na Da̱wuda na ali o uvon a rawai zuzu na̱ le a̱vu u ca̱sa̱ le. <verse eid="1SA 30:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 30:22" />Amma a̱vu suru a̱za̱ e iwuya na̱ ama a vama a̱tsuma̱ aza a na a̱ kuruyi Da̱wuda a damma, &lt;&lt;Adama a na a̱ 'ya̱wa̱i oɓolo na̱ a̱tsu shi, tsaa ca le ili i na tsu tsura̱i uba̱ta̱ wu uvon shi. She de a tara a̱ma̱ci e le na̱ muwun n le a̱ ka̱ra̱.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 30:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 30:23" />Amma Da̱wuda damma ta̱, &lt;&lt;Waa yuwan ne shi, a̱za̱ a̱ va̱! She i ciga aciya a̱ ɗu ekere e ili i na A̱sulazuva a ca n tsu wan. U geshe tsu ta̱, a̱vu u ca tsu oɓolo ali o uvon a na a̱ ta̱wa̱i a yuwain uvon na̱ a̱tsu. <verse eid="1SA 30:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 30:24" />Babu za na a̱ usu ili i na i dammai! Akunda a za na isawain ni itana u ta̱ da̱na̱ una̱ta̱ na̱ za na 'ya̱wa̱i uba̱ta̱ o uvon. Suru tsu ta̱ ne'eshen le una̱ta̱.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1SA 30:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 30:25" />Da̱wuda zuwa yi ta̱ wo o'wo wila̱ ni ili i na a̱ kuru uba̱ta̱ wa aza a Isra'ila diga urana u ndolo hali a cina ana'an.<verse eid="1SA 30:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 30:26" />Ana Da̱wuda rawai Ziklag, u lyungu ta̱ akapi a̱tsuma̱ e ili i na a̱ pura̱i a̱ tyo uba̱ta̱ a̱ n'utsa̱ ma̱ yi, mbara ma Yahuda, u damma, &lt;&lt;Nda une'e u ɗu diga e itana i na tsu pura̱i uba̱ta̱ wu uvon uba̱ta̱ wu n'yuwatan ma̱ A̱sulazuva.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1SA 30:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 30:27" />Nda ala e ilyuci i na Da̱wuda lyunguwa̱ yi une'e, Betel na̱ Ramot a̱tsuma̱ e Nege na̱ Yati <verse eid="1SA 30:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 30:28" />na̱ Arowa na̱ Sifamo na̱ Eshitemowa <verse eid="1SA 30:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 30:29" />na̱ Rakal ni ilyuci ya aza a Yerameyel ni ilyuci ya̱ a̱za̱ a̱ Keni <verse eid="1SA 30:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 30:30" />na̱ Homa na̱ Bor Ashan na̱ Atak <verse eid="1SA 30:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1SA 30:31" />na̱ Heburon na̱ suru uba̱ta̱ u na Da̱wuda na ali o uvon a̱ yi a garusai.<verse eid="1SA 30:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="1SA 31" />
  <para style="s">Ukwa̱ wa Shawulu na̱ olobo a̱ yi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 10:1-12">1 Alb 10:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 31:1" />Ele lo reve aza a Filistiya a yuwisan uvon na aza a Isra'ila, hali she na aza a Isra'ila a sumai. Amma o una ta̱ ali o uvon a Isra'ila na̱ a̱bunda̱ a Masasan ma Gilbowa. <verse eid="1SA 31:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 31:2" />A̱vu aza a Filistiya a saɓusa Shawulu na̱ olobo yi, reve o una olobo a ta'atsu yi Jonata na̱ Abinada na̱ Malkishuwa. <verse eid="1SA 31:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 31:3" />Uvo'on u suɗuwa ta̱ Shawulu. Ali o uvon a na a̱ da̱na̱i na̱ tan na aya a̱ tsura̱ ta̱ a tawan yi waru a amaton yi ta̱ lon.<verse eid="1SA 31:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 31:4" />A̱vu Shawulu damma vuma na a̱a̱ guzusa̱a̱ yi itana yu uvon, &lt;&lt;Vu tala matsun me pe'eni ma̱ wu reve vu una mu, ta̱wa̱ a̱za̱ o ulambu wu upaɗu wu uryumbu a nda a yuwan mu ulamu o una mu wan.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 31:4">Vuma na gba guzusa̱a̱ niyi itana yu uvoꞌon u 'yuwan ta̱ adama a na wu uwwa ta̱ wovon lon. Ɗaɗa gba Shawulu tala yi matsun me pe'eni ma̱ yi, reve u riya̱a̱ yi wu una aciya ya̱ yi. <verse eid="1SA 31:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 31:5" />Ana za na a̱ guzusa̱a̱ yi itana yu uvon enei Shawulu kuwa̱ ta̱, a̱vu a̱yi fo u riya̱a̱ matsun me pe'eni ma̱ yi a̱vu u kuwa̱ oɓolo na̱ a̱yi. <verse eid="1SA 31:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 31:6" />Ne ɗa Shawulu kuwa̱i, no olobo a ta'atsu a̱ yi, na̱ za na tsu guzusa̱a̱ yi itana yu uvon, na̱ ali o uvon a̱ yi suru a̱ kuwa̱ ta̱ urana u ta̱ oɓolo.<verse eid="1SA 31:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 31:7" />Mantsa ma na aza a Isra'ila aza a na a̱ ri mavada mo o upasu wu Uka̱ri wa Yezireyel na̱ mavada mo Uɗolu wa̱ Urudu a uwwai, na a ɗa a na Shawulu no olobo a ta'atsu a̱ yi a̱ kuwa̱ ta̱, waru a uwwai a na a̱soja a Isra'ila a sumai, reve e le fo a suma a lyawa ilyuci i le. A̱vu aza Filistiya a̱ ta̱wa̱ a̱ da̱nu pe.<verse eid="1SA 31:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 31:8" />Ana usana u tawai, a na aza a Filistiya a̱ ta̱wa̱i a̱ pura̱ itana ya̱ a̱kwa̱kwa̱'a̱, a̱vu a cina Shawulu no olobo a ta'atsu a̱ yi nven ukwa̱ zuva Masasan ma Gilbowa. <verse eid="1SA 31:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 31:9" />Ɗaɗa o koɗoi aci a Shawulu a̱vu a̱ pura̱ itana yu uvon ya̱ yi, reve a̱ lyungu nlingata e iɗa ya Filistiya ma̱ɓula̱ a damma alabari a̱tsuma̱ o u'wa wa̱ a̱ma̱li e le nu uba̱ta̱ wa ama e le suru. <verse eid="1SA 31:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 31:10" />A̱vu a zuwa itana yu uvon ya̱ yi a̱tsuma̱ o u'wa wa̱ a̱ma̱li a Ashitore, reve a̱ sa̱ga̱do lipu va̱ yi o uɓaɓu u lyuci wa Bet Shan.<verse eid="1SA 31:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 31:11" />Ana aza a na a̱ ri na̱ nden Jabe Giliyadu a uwwai ili i na aza a Filistiya a yuwain na̱ Shawulu, <verse eid="1SA 31:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 31:12" />suru ali o uvon o ukadu le a̱ 'yon ta̱ a̱vu a̱ 'ya̱wa̱ na ayin a tara lipu va Shawulu na̱ lipu vo olobo a̱ yi diga o uɓaɓu wa Bet Shan, a̱vu a̱ tyowetyo le Jabe a̱vu a̱ kula̱to le ɗe. <verse eid="1SA 31:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 31:13" />Reve a̱ pura̱ etele e le reve a̱ ciɗo le e ikyun yu uɗanga u na a̱ tsu ɗe tamari ɗe Jabe, avu a yuwan akuli rana cindere adama o a̱tsuma̱la̱ngu.<verse eid="1SA 31:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 31" />
</usx>